<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Biblica® Open Kiyombe Contemporary New Testament and Psalms 2002</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsamu Mboti wusonika Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsamu Wumboti wusonika</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Thonono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Sumbu batu batona sonika mambu momo mavioka va khatitsikꞌeto ; <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>banga bubatukambila mawu kuidi batu bobo baba bambangi bamona mesotona vana thonono ayi baba bisadi bi mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>A mueni Tewofile, ndimona ti didi dimbote, sumbu ndifiongunina bumbotemambu moso tona vana thonono mu kusonikina mawu boso bu malandikinini <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>muingi wuzaba kiedika ki mambu momo wulongu.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">MBUTUKULU AYI BUMUANA BU YESU</para>
  <para style="s1">Tsamununu yi mbutukulu yi Yowani-Mbotiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Mu thangu Elode kaba ntinu mu Yuda, muba ayi nganga Nzambi yimosi, dizina diandi Zakali. Niandi wuba mu dikabu di Abia ayi nketo andi Elizabeti wuba mu nkuna Aloni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Bawu buadi baba batu basonga va meso ma Nzambi ayi baba kinzikangazithumunu zioso ayi mina mioso mi Pfumu mu kambu tsembolo. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Basia buta bana ko bila Elizabeti wuba sita ayi bawu buadi baba banuna ngolo.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Lumbu kimosi Zakali kaba sala kisalu kiandi ki kinganga Nzambi va ntuala Nzambi bila yiba thangu yi dikabu diandi ; <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>landila bu bela kifu ki zinganga Nzambi, niandi wubuilu tsombo mu kota mu vinga ki nlongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Banganga Nzambi ziawu kaka ziba minsua mu kota mu vinga kilutidi nlongo. Mutu wunkaka niandi kota kafueti fua.</char></note> ki Pfumu mu diambu di yoka ansa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ansa</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">biti bintotulanga tsudi yikitoko bu biyokolo ku mbazu.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Mu thangu yinyokongo ansa, nkangu woso wu batu widi mu lusambulu ku nganda. <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Tumbu zimbukila mbasi yi Pfumu yintotukila, buna yitelimini va koko ku lubakala lu diziku di banyokilanga ansa. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakali bu kammona, weka ntita ayi weka mona tsisi. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Vayi mbasi yinkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:13">—A Zakali, bika mona tsisi bila Nzambi wuwilu lusambulu luaku, diawu nketoꞌaku Elizabeti wela kubutila muana wu bakala ayi wela kuntedilanga Yowani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Wala ba tho yi khini ayi di tsaya kuidi ngeyo ayi batu bawombo bela mona khini mu mbutukulu andi. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Wela ba wunneni va ntuala Pfumu, kalendi nua kadi vinu ko, kadi malavu mankolosongo ko. Wela ba wufuluka mu Pheve Yinlongo tona mu vumu ki nguandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Wela vutula bana ba Iseli bawombo kuidi Nzambi awu. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Wela tuamina Pfumu ku ntuala mu mpeve ayi mu lulendo lu Eli mu diambu di vutula nguizani va khatitsika madisa ayi bana bawu, mu diambu di batu bobo badi matingu batula mu tezo ki yindula bangabatu basonga ayi mu kubika batu bakubama mu diambu di Pfumu.<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Buna Zakali wuyuvula mbasi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:18">—A buevi ndiela bu zabila e ? Bila minu veka ndieka nunu ki ngolo ayi nketo ama mimvu miwombo keka.<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Mbasi yimvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:19">—Minu ndidi Ngabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngabi</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minsekudi minkaka misonika Ngabileli va buangu ki Ngabi.</char></note>, minu nditelamanga va ntuala Nzambi, thumunu mu kuyolukila ayi ku kamba minsamu miami mimbote. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Vayi weka kituka dibaba ayi wulendi baka bu buela yolukilanga ko nate lumbu kioki mambu mama mela vangama. Bobo buela bela bila wusi wilukila ko mambu mama, momo mela vangama mu thangu yifuana.<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Vayi mu thangu beni, nkangu wu batu wuba vingila Zakali. Batu basimina bu bamona ti wulembu zingila muna vinga ki nlongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Bu katotuka, kasi baka bu yolukila ko batu bobo bakutakana. Buna basudika ti tsongolo kamueni muna vinga nlongo. Niandi mu bidimbu kaba kuba yolukila ayi wusiala dibaba. <verse eid="LUK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Bu kamanisa bilumbu biandi bi kisalu, buna wuvutuka ku nzoꞌandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Bilumbu bina bu bivioka, nketo andi Elizabeti weka mu buemba. Vayi zingondi zitanu kasuamina bila wukamba ti :<verse eid="LUK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>—Tala maphangidi Pfumu ! Niandi wumbengudidi thalu yimbote ayi botudi zitsoni ziama va meso ma batu boso.<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsamununu yi mbutukulu yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Mu ngondi yi nsambanu, Nzambi wufidisa mbasi Ngabi ku divula dimosi didi mu Ngalili. Dizina di divula beni Nazaleti, <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>kuidi muana ndumba wumosi wuwizana makuela ayi bakala dimosi, diba mu nkuna Davidi. Dizina di bakala beni Zefu ayi dizina di muana ndumba Maliya.<verse eid="LUK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>—Mboti aku e ! Ngeyo wumonokono nlemvo kuidi Nzambi ! Pfumu widi yaku !<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Maliya weka mona boma bu kawa mambu momo. Wuba ku kiyuvula tsundu yi mbote yoyo.<verse eid="LUK 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Buna mbasi yinkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:30">—Bika mona tsisi Maliya bila Nzambi wumueni kiadi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Tala : wela ba mu buemba ayi wela buta muana wu bakala ; wela kuntedilanga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Wela ba wunneni. Wela tedudulungu “Nzambi yizangama” ayi Pfumu Nzambi wela kumvana kundu ki kipfumu ki nkulu andi Davidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Wela biadilanga, mu zithangu zioso, batu batotukila mu Yakobi ayilubialu luandi lulendi suka ko.<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Maliya wukamba Mbasi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:34">—A buevi mela vangimina bila ndisi zaba nitu yi bakala ko ?<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Mbasi yimvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:35">—Pheve Yinlongo yela kuluka mu ngeyo ayi kitsusula ki lulendo lu Nzambi wuzangama kiela kufukidila. Diawu wunlongo wela butuka, wela tedudulungu Muana wu Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Tala khombꞌaku Elizabeti, mamvandi widi mu buemba bu muana wu bakala mu bununu buandi. Niandi baba tedilanga sita weka mu ngondi andi yi nsambanu. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Bila kuisi ko diambu diela lembakana vanga Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Buna Maliya wuvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:38">—Minu ndidi kisadi ki Pfumu. Bika mavangimina kuidi minu boso buididi mambu maku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:38">Buna mbasi yimbika.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maliya wuyenda kuidi Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Mu bilumbu bina, Maliya wuyenda nsualu-nsualu ku divula didiku miongo, mu zunga ki Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Wukota mu nzo Zakali ayi wuvana Elizabeti mboti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Thangu Elizabeti kawa mbote yi Maliya muanꞌandi wunikuka mu vumu kiandi. Buna wuwala mu Pheve Yinlongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Ayi wuyamikina mu mbembo yingolo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:42">—Ngeyo widi wusakumunu va miudi baketo ayi muana widi mu vumu kiaku widi wusakumunu. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Buna kuevi kubedi diambu diadi ti ngudi yi Pfumu ama kiza kuidi minu e ? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Bila mu thangu nguilu mbotiꞌaku mu matu mama buna muana wunikukini mu vumu kiama mu diambu di khini. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Khini kuidi nketo wowo wuwilukila bila mambu momo makamba Pfumu mu diambu diandi mela vangama.<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Buna Maliya wukamba :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">Muelꞌama wunkembisanga nzitusu wu Pfumu<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>ayi mpeve yama yilembo mona khini mu diambu di Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:47">Mvulusi ama.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Bila wubengudi thaluꞌandi va kisadi kiandi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">kikambulu mfunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">diawu zitsungi zioso ziela kuthedilanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">nketo wu zikhini.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Bila Nzambi yi zingolo zioso wuphangidi mambu manneni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Dizina diandi didi dinlongo.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Ayi mamboti mandi mela zingilanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">mu tsungi ka tsungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">kuidi bobo ba kunkizikanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Wumonikisidi zingolo ziandi mu koko kuandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">wusasikisidi batu badi luniemo mu mintima miawu<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Wukuludi batu ba lulendo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">mu bikundu biawu bi kipfumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">ayi wunangikidi batu bobo badi balembama<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Wuyukutisidi batu bobo baba nzala mu bima bimbote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">Wusindika bamvuama mioko yi mioko<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Wusadisidi kisadi kiandi Iseli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">mu thebukulu yi moyo mu mambote mandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Banga buididi tsila yi kavana bakulu beto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">kuidi Abalahami ayi kuidi nkunꞌandi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">mu zithangu zioso.<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Tezo ki zingondi zitatu Mliya kavuandila kuidi Elizabeti, bosi wuvutuka ku nzoꞌandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbutukulu yi Yowani Mbotiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Lumbu ki Elizabeti ki buta bu kifuana, wubuta muana wu bakala. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Bakundi bandi ayi bibutu biandi bu bawa phila Pfumu kamonisina mambote mandi, bamona khini va kimosi ayi niandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Muana bu kadukisa dinana di bilumbu, bayiza mu diambu di nzengulu yi nitu yi kibakala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuda baba kifu kizenganga nitu yi kibakala muana bu kadukisi dinana di bilumbu.</char></note>. Bawu boso bazola kuntedila Zakali banga dizina di siandi, <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>vayi nguandi wukamba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:60">—Nana, dizina diandi Yowani.<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Vayi bawu bankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:61">—Kadi mutu wumosi mu dikanda diaku kasi ko dizina diodi.<verse eid="LUK 1:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Buna bayuvula dise, mu bidimbu, mu zaba dizina mbi katidi vana muana. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Wulomba tini ki dibaya ; muna kasonika ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:63">—Dizina diandi Yowani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:63">Buna batu boso basimina.<verse eid="LUK 1:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Muna thangu yina, munu andi wuzibudidi ayi ludimi luandi luniangukidi. Wuyolukidi ayi wukembisidi Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 1:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Batu babo bafikasana yawu bamona tsisi, ayi, bayolukilamambu beni mu tsi yoso yi miongo mi Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Babo bawa nsamu beni balunda wawu mu mintima miawu ayi batuba : “A buna muana beni buevi kela bela e ?” Bila Pfumu wuba yandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Dise diandi Zakali wufuluka mu Pheve Yinlongo, diawu kabikudila ti :<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>Nkembo kuidi Pfumu, Nzambi yi Iseli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">Bila wuyiza tala batu bandi ayi wuba kudidi<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Wututotudidi nkudi wu lulendo mu nkuna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">Davidi, kisadi kiandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Banga bu kayolukila tona vana thonono</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:70">mu miunu mi mimbikudi miandi minlongo :<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>ti wela ku tukula mu mioko mi bambeni zieto ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">mu mioko mi batu bobo ba kutulendanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Mu diambu di dukisa mambote kuidi bakulu beto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">ayi mu diambu di tebukila nguizani andi yinlongo moyo ;<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>ayi tebukila moyo ndefi yoyo kalevila nkulu eto Abalahami<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>mu kutuvana diluaku di kunsadila mu kambu tsisi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">bu kameni kutukula mu mioko mi bambeni zieto<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>mu bunlongo ayi mu busonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">mu bilumbu bieto bi luzingu, va ntualꞌandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Ngeyo muana, wela tedudulungu Mbikudi wu Nzambi yizangama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">bila ngeyo wela tuaminina Pfumu ku ntualꞌandi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">mu diambu di kubika nzilꞌandi ;<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>mu diambu di zabikisa kuidi batu bandi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">ti Nzambi wumveni phulusu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">ayi wunlemvukidi masumu andi.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Bila Nzambi eto fulukidi mu diadi ayi mu mambote</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Diawu mbuetete yi nsuka yela totukila</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">ku yilu mu diambu dieto<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>mu diambu di kienzula bobo badi mu tombi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">ayi bobo badi mu kini ki lufua,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">ayi mu diambu di diaisa zithambi zieto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">mu nzila yi ndembama.<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Muana wuyunduka ayi wukinda mu mpeve. Bosi wuzingila mu bibuangu bisuama nate mu lumbu kioki kakimonisa va meso ma batu ba Iseli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbutukulu yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayi 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Mu bilumbu bina, ntinu Sezari Ogisite wuvana lutumu lu tangabatu boso disasama va ntoto wumvimba. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Disasama beni diawu diba dithete divangama mu thangu Kiliniusi kaba nyadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nyadi</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">voti guvelinele.</char></note> wu Sili.<verse eid="LUK 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Kadika mutu wuyenda kisonikisa ku divula diandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Sumbu Zefu kaba mu nkuna wu Davidi, diawu kabotukila ku divula di Nazaleti, mu tsi yi Ngalili mu kuenda mu tsi yi Yuda ku divula di Betelemi, divula di Davidi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Wuyenda va kimosi ayi Maliya, nketo wukazola kuela, wuba mu buemba.<verse eid="LUK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Buna badi ku Betelemi, Maliya wutula mu thanguꞌandi yibutila. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Buna wubuta muana wubakala : muanꞌandi wuthete. Wunzinga mu minledi ayi wuntula mu dikulu ki bibulu bila bibuangu bisia bakana ko mu diambu diawu mu zinzo zinlekanga banzenza.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Minsungi mi mamemi miba mu zitsola zizungidila zunga beni mibansunga mu nkielo buisi minkangu miawu mimamemi. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Kuna mbasi yi Pfumu yiba monikina ayi nkembo wu Pfumu wubazungidila. Buna tsisi yingolo yiba buila.<verse eid="LUK 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Vayi mbasi yiba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:10">—Bikanu mona boma. Tsangu yimboti ndilunatini. Yikuiza monisabatu boso khini. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Bila buabu balubutidi Mvulusi mu divula di Davidi. Niandi Mesiya, Pfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Luela mona muana wu tsombi zingulu mu minledi ayi tululu mu dikulu ki bibulu. Kiawu kioki dimbu luela kunzabila.<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Buela zimbukila nkangu wu zimbasi ziba mu dikabu di masodi ma diyilu wumonika va ndambu mbasi beni. Nkangu beni wuyimbila minzitusu mi Nzambi :<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>Nkembo kuidi Nzambi yizangama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">Ndembama va ntoto kuidi batu baketa zola.<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Zimbasi bu zibika minsungi, zivutuka ku diyilu, buna minsungi mi mameme mikambasana miawu na miawu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:15">—Bika tuendanu ku Betelemi mu kuenda tadi mambu momo mavangimini kuna ; momo Pfumu katusamunini.<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Bayenda nsualu ayi bayenda bata Maliya ayi Zefu va kimosi ayi muana wu tsombi wulekusu mu dikulu ki bibulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Buna baba mona, basamuna mambu moso momo baba kamba mu diambu di muana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Babo bobo bawu wawu, basimina buwombo mu diambu di mambu momominsungi mi mameme miba kamba. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Vayi Maliya wulunda mambu moso ayi wuba ku mayindulanga mu ntimꞌandi.<verse eid="LUK 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Bosi minsungi mivutuka, minkembisa ayi minsanisina Nzambi mu diambu di mamo ma bamona ayi ma bawa. Mawu maba banga kuandi bu babakambila mawu.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunatu ku nzo Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Dinana di bilumbu bu biduka, thangu yi zengisa lunitu lu kibakala lu muana bu yifuana, buna bamvana dizina Yesu. Diawu dizina divana mbasi tuamina nguandi kaba mu buemba buandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Bilumbu bizengu mu Mina mi Moyize mu diambu di tsukudulu awu bu bifuana, bambuta ba Yesu zinnata ku Yelusalemi mu diambu dikummonisa kuidi Pfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Boso buidi busonama mu Mina mi Pfumu ti :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:23">
    <char style="qt">Woso muana wuthete wu bakala wumbutuka,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:23">
    <char style="qt">wela tambuku kuidi Pfumu.</char><verse eid="LUK 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Bayiza diaka mu diambu di tambika dikaba boso buididi mu Minami Pfumu : biduka biodi voti bana buadi ba mabembi.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Mutu wumosi wuba ku Yelusalemi, dizina diandi Simewoni. Wubamutu wufuana ayi wusonga. Wuba vingila mbombolo yi Iseli ayi Pheve Yinlongoyiba va niandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Bila Pheve Yinlongo yinkamba ti kalendi vika fua ko enati kamuenieti ko Klisto yi Pfumu.<verse eid="LUK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Niandi wuyiza ku nzo Nzambi mu lutumunu lu Mpeve Yinlongo. Mu thangu bambuta ba Yesu zinata muana mu diambu di dukisa mambu madi mu Mina, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>buna Simewoni wunsimba mu mioko ayi wusanisina Nzambi bu katuba :<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>A Pfumu, yekula buabu kisadi kiaku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">kienda mu ndembama boso buididi tsilꞌaku<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>bila meso mama manueni phulusu aku<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>yoyi wukubika mu diambu di batu boso<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>yawu yidi muinda mu diambu di kienzula makanda ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">ayi nkembo wu Iseli, batu baku.<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Dise ayi ngudi basimina buwombo mu wa mambu katuba mu diambu diandi.<verse eid="LUK 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simewoni wuba sakumuna ayi wukamba Maliya, nguandi Yesu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:34">—Tala muana wawu wu kubukulu mu diambu di buisa ayi mu telimisa batu bawombo mu Iseli. Wela ba dimbu kiela bangusanga bawombo ; <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>muingi mayindu ma mintima mi batu bawombo matotuka. Vayi kuidi ngeyo veka, wela ba banga mbedi yela tobul mpeve aku.<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Mbikudi wumosi wu nketo wuba diaka muna. Dizina diandi Anna, muana Fenueli, wuba mu dikanda di Aseli. Wuba wununa ngolo. Tsambudi di mimvu kaka kavuandila va makuela mu bumuana buandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Bosi wukituka difuola ayi wuzingila mu kidifuola nate mu tezo ki lunana lu mimvu ayi mimvu minya. Kadi lumbu kimosi kasia bika ko nzo Nzambi bila muna kaba nsadilanga Nzambi builu ayi muini mu lusambulu ayi mu kukifuisa nzala mu diambu di lusambulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minsekudi minkaka misonika “mina nsoki” va buangu ki kukifuisa nzala mu diambu di lusambulu.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Niandi mamvandi bu kayiza muna thangu yina, wusanisina Nzambi ayi wuyolukila mambu ma muana kuidi batu bobo baba mvingilanga khudulu yi Yelusalemi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Bu bamana dukisa mambu momo masonama mu Mina mi Pfumu, Maliyaayi Zefu bafutuka ku buala buawu, Nazaleti, didi mu Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Muana wuyunduka ayi wukinda. Diela diwombo diba yandi ayi nlemvo wu Nzambi wuba mu niandi.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Kadika mvu bambuta ba Yesu ziba kuendanga ku Yelusalemi mu nyengo Pasika. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yesu bu kadukisa kumi mimvu miodi buna bayenda ku Yelusalemi, mu diambu di nyengo, boso bubela kifu kiawu.<verse eid="LUK 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Nyengo bu wumanisa, bavutuka kuawu. Vayi muanꞌawu Yesu wusiala ku Yelusalemi ayi bambuta bandi zisia bu zaba ko. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Bawu babanzila ti widi muidi bakundi bawu bayenda yawu va kimosi. Bu badiata lumbu kimvimba, buna batona kuntomba muba bibutu biawu ayi bazabana yawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Vayi sumbu basia kummona ko ; diawu bavutukila ku Yelusalemi mu kuenda ntombi.<verse eid="LUK 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Bilumbu bitatu bu bivioka, bambakula muna nzo Nzambi, buna kavuendi va khatitsika minlongi mi mina. Wuba wa ayi wuba yuvula biuvu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Babo bobo banwa, basimina mu diambu di diela diandi ayi mu diambu di mimvutuziandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Zimbuta bandi zisimina buwombo bu zimmona vana. Buna nguandi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:48">—Muanꞌama, bila mbi wutuvangidi bobo e ? Zebi kuaku ti siaku ayiminu tsisi yiwombo tumueni ayi tutombidi ngolo.<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Buna Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:49">—Bila mbi lufueti kuthombila e ? Lusi zaba ko ti mfueti ba mu nzo yi dise diama ?<verse eid="LUK 2:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Vayi basia sudika ko mambu momo ka bakamba.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Buna wuyenda yawu ayi wuvutuka ku Nazaleti. Wuba tumukina. Vayi nguandi wulunda bumboti mambu moso momo mavioka. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesu wuyunduka mu nduenga ayi mu ntela. Khini yiwombo kamonisa Nzambi ayi batu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="ms1">KHUBUKULU YI KISALU KI YESU</para>
  <para style="s1">Yowani Mbotiki, mvuala wu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-10">Matayi 3.1-10</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-6">Malako 1.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Mu mvu wu kumi wu ntnu wu lubialu lu ntinu Tibeli Sezari, Ponse Pilatu niandi wuba nyadi mu Yuda, Elode Tetalake wubiadila mu Ngalili, khombꞌandi Filipi mu Itule ayi mu Talakonite, Lisaniasi wubiadila mu Abileni. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Ana ayi Kayife baba bapfumu zi zinganga Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:2">Mu mvu beni mambu ma Nzambi mayiza kuidi Yowani muana Zakali, bu kaba mu dikanga. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Yowani wudiengila tsi yoso yiba mu yenda Yolidani ayi wuba kuenda longingi : “Bila lubotama mu monisa ti lubaludi mavanga, buna Nzambi wela lemvukila masumu meno.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Banga bu busonimina mu nkanda wu mbikudi Ezayi :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">Mbembo yi mutu wulembu yamikina mu dikanga :</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">Lukubika nzila yi Pfumu</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">Luludika minsolo miandi</char><verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>
    <char style="qt">Mindimba mioso miela sesolo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">Miongo mioso ayi zimbata zioso zimiongo ziela lendumunu</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">zinzila zi zikhondo ziela lulama</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">minsolo mi mabadi miela fuanusu.</char><verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>
    <char style="qt">Ayi batu boso bela mona phulusu yi Nzambi.</char><verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Yowani wuba kambanga batu bobo baba kuizanga mu botama kuidi niandi ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:7">—Bana ba bikusa ! Nani wululubudi mu tina nganzi yoyi yeka kuiza ? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Monisanu mavanga mamboti momo mafueni kuidi batu bobo babalula mavanga. Lubika banza bu lulembu yindulanga mu mintima mieno ti : “Beto dise dieto Abalahami !” Bila bukiedika ndikulukamba ti Nzambi wulenda totula bana ba Abalahami mu mataid mama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Matayi 3.9</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Lukeba : soka kikubimini mu zenga mianzi mi minti. Woso nti wunkambu buta mu zenga mianzi mi minti. Woso nti wunkambu buta makundimamboti wela kuangu ayi wela viku ku mbazu.<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Buna nkangu wu batu wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:10">—Buna mbi tufueti vanga e ?<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:11">—Woso mutu widi bikhutu biodi, bika kavana kimosi kuidi mutu wowo kambulu. Woso mutu widi bidia bika kavanga bobuawu.<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Ayi mimfutisi mi ziphaku miyiza botama kuidi Yowani, minyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:12">—Nlongi, mbi tuvanga e ?<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Buna wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:13">—Lubika buelanga thalu va mbata thalu yoyo yizengo.<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Masodi mamvawu manyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">—Buna beto, mbi tuvanga e ? Buna niandi wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">—Lubika zionanga bima bingana ; lubika fundanga batu mu mambu ma luvunu. Lutadidilanga kaka mfutu eno.<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:11-12">Matayi 3.11-12</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">Malako 1.7-8</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yowani 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Batu boso bata diana di ngolo bila babanzila ti Yowani niandi Klisto.<verse eid="LUK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yowani wuba vutudila bawu boso ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:16">—Minu mu nlangu ndilembu lubotikila. Vayi mutu wowo wulembu yizi wundutidi mu lulendo ; ndisi fuana ko u zibula minsinga mi zisapatu ziandi. Niandi wela kulubotikila mu Pheve Yinlongo ayi mu mbazu. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Ayi simbidi mbangu mu mioko miansi ; niandi wela kombula buangu kioki kela vevila. Wela lunda ble<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ble</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mpila kunusu kinsadulungu falina ; kidi banga masangu.</char></note> ku yilu banga vayi wela yoka biti ku mbazu yi kayilendi zima ko.<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Yowani bu kaba vananga zithumunu ziwombo kuidi batu, buna wuba kubalonganga Nsamu Wumbote.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Matayi 14.3-4</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Malako 6.17-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Vayi Yowani wuba tubidilanga buwombo nyadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nyadi</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">voti guvelenele. Tala Luka 2.2.</char></note> Elode mu diambu di kakuela Elodiasi, nketo wu khombꞌandi ayi mu diambu di kavanga mavanga mawombo mankakamambimbi. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Elode wubuela diaka yika bila kiaki va yilu mambimbi mandi moso : wukotisa Yowani mu nloko.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubotama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayi 3.13-17</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Malako 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Batu boso bu bamana botama, Yesu mamvandi wubotama. Bu kaba sambila, diyilu dizibuka <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>ayi Pheve Yinlongo yi nkitila banga dibembi. Kuna kuwakana mbembo yimosi yitotukila ku diyilu, yikamba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:22">—Ngeyo widi Muanꞌama wu luzolo ; khini yiwombo wukumbonisanga.<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Khikulu ki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayi 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesu buna weka nduka-nduka makumatatu ma mimvu bu katona kisalu kiandi. Batu babanzila ti niandi muana Zefu wu Heli : <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>wu Mata, wu Levi, wu Maliki, wu Yanayi, wu Zefu <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>wu Matatiasi, wu Amosi, wu Nahumi, wu Esili, wu Nangayi. <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Wu Mati, wu Matatiasi, wu Simeyini, wu Yose, wu Yoda. <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Wu Yowanani, wu Leza, wu Zolobabeli, wu Salatieli, wu Neli <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>wu Meleki, wu Adi, wu Kosami, wu Elimadami, wu El. <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Wu Yesu, wu Eliezeli, wu Yolimi, wu Mata, wu Levi <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>wu Simewoni, wu Yuda, wu Zozefi, wu Yonami, wu Eliakimi. <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Wu Meleya, wu Mena, wu Matata, wu Natani, Wu Davidi. <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Wu Isayi, wu Obedi, wu Vowazi, wu Salimoni, wu Nasoni <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>wu Aminadabi, wu Adimini, wu Alini, wu Esiloni, wu Pelesi, wu Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>wu Yakobi, wu Isaki, wu Abalahami, wu tela, wu Nawoli. <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Wu Selungi, wu Lewu, wu Faleki, wu Hebeli, wu Sala <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>wu Kayinani, wu Alifazadi, wu Semi, wu Nowa, Wu Lemeki. <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Wu Matusalemi, wu Enoki, wu Yeledi, wu Maleleli, wu Kenami, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>wu Enosi, wu Seti, wu Adami, niandi veka wuba muana wu Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuvukumunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayi 4.1-11</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Malako 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesu wuba wuwala mu Pheve Yinlongo, wubotuka ku Yolidani. Mpeve yinnata ku dikanga. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Kuna satana kamvukumunina mu tezo ki makumaya ma bilumbu. Kadi kiasa kasia dia ko mu bilumbu beni. Bu biduka, buna wumonanzala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Buna satana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Satana</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">voti nkadi-a-mpemba. Tala Matayi 4.1.</char></note> wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:3">—Kamba ditadi diadi dikituka dipha enati widi muana Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:4">—Disonama ti : <char style="qt">mutu kalendi zingilanga kaka mu dipha ko.</char><verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Buna satana wunnata va kingiela ayi wummonisa mu khumbu yimosibipfumu bioso bi ntoto <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:6">—Ndiela kuvana lulendo loso lualu, ayi nkembo wu bimbumu biabi. Bila minu veka ndivanu wawu ayi ndenda kuwuvana kuidi woso mutu nsodidi. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Ngeyo kumbuongimina kuandi buna bibioso biobi bieka ba biaku.<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:8">—Disonama :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">
    <char style="qt">Pfumu Nzambi aku niandi kaka fueti buongimina ayi</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">
    <char style="qt">niandi kaka fueti sadila.</char><verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Buna bosi satana wunnata ku Yelusalemi, wuntula ku buangu kilutidizangama kimbata muanzu wu nzo Nzambi ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:9">—Enati bukiedika ti widi Muana Nzambi, wukilozi ku ntoto bila disonama :<verse eid="LUK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>
    <char style="qt">Nzambi wela fidisa zimbasi ziandi mu diambu diaku muingi zikeba</char><verse eid="LUK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>
    <char style="qt">ayi ziela kunata mu mioko miawu mu diambu di kulu kuaku kuedibumina thutu mu ditadi.</char><verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:12">—Bakamba : <char style="qt">Wulendi vukumuna Pfumu Nzambi aku ko !</char><verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Satana bu kamana kumvukumuna mu zithotolo zi phila mu philabuna wuntatukila nate mu thangu yizengo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">KISALU KI YESU KU NGALILI</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu niandi kisadi kisobolo kuidi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayi 4.12-17</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Malako 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Buna Yesu wuvutuka ku Ngalili ; lulendo lu Pheve luba mu niandi. Tsangu andi yimana tembakana mu zunga kioso. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Wuba longanga mu zinzo ziawu zi zikhutukunu ayi batu boso baba kuniemisanga.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayi 13.53-58</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Malako 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Wuyenda ku Nazaleti ku Kayundukila ayi wukota mu nzo yi lukutukunu mu lumbu ki saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lumbu ki saba</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lumbu ki lumingu kuidi Bayuda. Mu bilumbu bieto kidedikini mu lumbu ki kisabala.</char></note> bila bobo bu bela kifu kiandi. Wutelama mu diambu di tanga masonoko. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Buna bamvana nkanda wu mbikudi Ezayi. Bu kazibula nkanda beni, wubua va tini kisonama mambu mama :<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>
    <char style="qt">Pheve yi Pfumu yidi va minu</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">bila wutsodula mu longa Nsambu Wumbote kuidi minsukami,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">wumfidisa mu yamikisa khudulu yi batu bakangama,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">mu zibula meso ma baphofo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">mu nata phulusu kuidi batu banyamusu</char><verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>
    <char style="qt">ayi yamikisa mvu wu nlemvo wu Pfumu.</char><verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Wuzibika nkanda beni ayi wuvutula wawu kuidi kisadi ki nzo yi lukutukunu bosi wuvuanda. Meso ma batu boso baba mu nzo yi lukutukunu maba kuntala.<verse eid="LUK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:21">—Buabu, masonuku mama ma luwilu masundukidi.<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Batu boso bantelimina kimbangi. Basimina mu diambu di mambu ma nlemvo matotukila mu munu andi. Buna batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:22">—Niandi ko muana Zefu e ?<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:23">—Bukiedika ti ma lukhamba kingana kiaki : “Munganga, wukibelusa ngeyo veka !” ayi maluthela : “Tuwilu mambu mavangimini ku Kafalinawumi. Vanga buawu kuaku, mu divula diaku !”<verse eid="LUK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Buna wubuela ku bakamba ti : Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti kuisi ko mbikudi wela yakulu bumboti mu tsi andi ! <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti mafuola maba mawombo mu Iseli mu thangu Eli. Zimvula zisia noka ko mu tezo ki mimvu mintatu ayi ndambu ; ayi kanda kingolo kiba mu tsi yoso. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Vayi Eli kasia fidusu kuidi mfuola moso ko. Vayi kuidi difuoladimosi diba zingilanga ku Salapeta, mu tsi yi Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Batu babela buazi baba bawombo mu Ieli mu thangu mbikudi Elisa vayi kadi wumosi mu bawu kasia vedusu ko ; botula kaka Namani muisi Sili.<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Batu boso baba muna nzo yi lukutuku bafuema ngolo bu awa mambu mama. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Batelama, banata Yesu ku nganda yi divula ; nate ku tsongi wu mongo, kutungulu divula beni. Bannata kuna muingi bannunguna ku tsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Vayi wufielumuka va khatitsikꞌawu ayi wuyenda kuandi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukuka mpeve yimbimbi ayi wubelusa bambevo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Malako 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Wuyenda ku Kafalinawumi, divula di Ngalili. Kuawu kaba longila mu lumbu bi saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Matayi 12.1.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Basimina buwombo mu wa malongi mandi bila wulongila mu lulendo.<verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Muna nzo lukutukunu muba mutu wumosi wuba mpeve yimbimbi, wuyamikina mu ndinga yingolo :<verse eid="LUK 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>—A Yesu muisi Nazaleti, mambu mbi tuidi betu yaku e ? Wizidi mu kutubunga e ? Minu nzebi ti ngeyo widi nani : Widi mutu wunlongo wu Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesu wutemina pheve yimbimbi ayi wuntumina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:35">—Bika biyoko ; totuka mu mutu wawu !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:35">Mpeve beni yimbimbi yilumba mutu beni va tsi, va meso ma batu boso babavana. Buna yitotuka mu kambu kumvanga mpasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Batu boso basimina ayi bayuvasana bawu na bawu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:36">—A mambu mbi mama e ? Bila niandi wumvana zithumunu kuidi ziphevi zimbimbi mu kibakala ayi mu lulendo ayi ziawu zilembu totuka.<verse eid="LUK 4:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Tsangu yi Yesu yimuangana mu mala moso ma zunga kina.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayi 8.14-17</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Malako 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Bu katotuka mu nzo yi lukutukunu, wuyenda ku nzo yi Simoni. Nzitu wu Simoni wuba zinzangala zingolo ayi baleba Yesu muingi kambelusa. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Wuyinama va kaba, wutemina zinzangala ayi ziawu zitumbu kumbika. Buna nzitu wu Simoni wutelama mu nsualu ayi wuba kubikila bidia.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Thangu buna yeka diama, baboso baba bedisa bambevo banata bambevo ziawu, ziba bimbevo bi mpila mu mpila, kuidi Yesu. Wutetika mioko kuidi kadika mutu ayi wuba belusa. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Ziphevi zimbimbi zitotuka mu batu bawombo. Sumbu zintotuka zi kuenda yamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">—Ngeyo widi Muana Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Vayi Yesu wutemina ziphevi beni zimbimbi ayi kasia zivana ko minsua mu yoluka bila zizaba ti niandi Klisto.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Malako 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Buisi buna bukia, Yesu wutotuka ayi wuyenda ku buangu kisuma. Nkangu wu batu wuntomba ayi bu wutula va kaba ; batu bazola kunsimbidila mu diambu kabika kuenda. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Vayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:43">—Mfueti samuna diaka Nsamu Wumbote wu Kipfumu ki Nzambi mu mavula mankaka bila diawu ndifidusulu.<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Buna wulonga mu zinzo zi zikhutukunu zi Yuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minkanda minkaka mi khulu musonama Ngalili va buangu ki Yuda.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Minlonguki mitheti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayi 4.18-22</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Malako 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Lumbu kimosi yesu kaba muyenda disimu di mbu wu Ngenezaleti ayi sumbu nkangu wu batu wunzungidila mu diambu di wa mambu ma Nzambi, <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>buna wumona minlungu miodi muyenda mbu. Minlobi mi zimbizi bakuluka kuawu mu minlungu miawu bila makondi mawu baba sukula. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Nlungu wumosi wuba wu Simoni. Yesu wukuma muawu ayi wunkambakatatukila fioti disimu. Buna wuvuanda muna nlungu ayi wutona longa nkangu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Buna kamanisa yoluka, wukamba Simoni :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:4">—Kuesa nlungu kungingi nlangu, kuna kuidi thimpula bosi ngeyo ayi bakundi baku lozanu makondi meno mu diambu di luloba.<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Vayi Simoni wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:5">—A nlongi, builu bumvimba tusedi vayi kadi kiasa tusia baka ko. Vayi sumbu wuthumini, ndieka loza makondi.<verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Baloza makondi ayi babaka zimbizi ziwombo ; ayi makondi mawu tsatu makanzuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Buna batumisa bakundi bawu bobo baba mu nlungu wunkaka muingi biza basadisa. Bayiza ayi minlungu mioso mimiodi miwala zimbizi, ayi tsatu midiama.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Bu kamona bobo, Simoni-Piela wufukama va malu ma Yesu ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:8">—Pfumu, bika wuthatukila bila ndidi nkua masumu.<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Muaki lukhuku lumbuila va kimosi ayi bakundi bandi mu mona phila zimbizi baloba. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Zaki ayi Yowani, bana ba Zebede, bakundi ba Simoni, mamvawu lukhuku lu babuila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Buna Yesu wukamba Simoni :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">—Bika mona tsisi bila tona buabu wela ba nlobi wu batu.<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Bu bavutula minlungu miawu ku disimu, basia bika bibioso ayi balandakana Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa bambevo bawombo ayi wulemvukila masumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-14">Matayi 8.1-14</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Malako 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Lumbu kimosi Yesu bu kaba mu divula dimosi, kuna kutotukila mutu wumosi wuba ayi buazi. Bu kamona Yesu, mutu beni wufukamava ntualꞌandi vayi wuyinika zizi kiandi mu tsi ayi wunleba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:12">—A Pfumu, enati tidi buna wulenda kuaku kumvedisa !<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesu wunonuna koko kuandi, wunsimba ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:13">—Nyinga, thidi, vedila kuaku !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:13">Mu yina thangu, wuvedila mu buazi buandi. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Vayi wunkandika kabika kamba kadi kuidi mutu wumosi mambu mavangimini mu niandi. Vayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:14">—Yenda kimonisa kuidi nganga yi Nzambi ayi nata dikaba dilomba Moyizemu diambu diba kimbangi kuidi bawu.<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Tsangu yi Yesu yiluta muangana. Diawu minkangu miwombo mi batu bayiza muingi banwa ayi muingi babelusu mu bimbevo biawu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Vayi niandi wuyenda tinina mu bibuangu bisuama mu diambu kasambila.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayi 9.1-8</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Malako 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Lumbu kimosi bu kaba longa, Bafalisi ayi minlongi mi mina bobobatotukila mu mala moso ma Ngalili, ma Yuda ayi ma Yelusalemi bayizavuanda vana ayi lulendo lu Pfumu lumonika mu bambevo baba balusanga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Zimbukila babakala batotuka, banata dikoka mu kimpoyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Matayi 9.2</char></note>. Batomba diluaku di kunkotisila mu nzo muingi bantula va ntuala Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Vayi basia baka ko diluaku di kunkotisila mu diambu di nkangu wu batu. Diawu bakumina ku mbata muanzu ayi batobudila divudumu muanzu, bosi, bakulula dikoka beni mu kiphoyi va khatitsika batu, va ntuala Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesu bu kamona minu ki batu bobo, wukamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:20">—Nkundi ama, masumu maku malemvokolo.<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Minlongi mi Mina ayi Bafalisi batona niunguta ayi bakambasana :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:21">—Buna nani mutu wawu wuntuba mamu ma mvuezolo e ? Nani beki minsuamu lemvukil masumu ? A keti Nzambi kaka e ?<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Vayi Yesu wuzaba mayindu mawu, ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:22">—Bila mbi lunyindudila bobo mu mintima mieno e ? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Mbi bilutidi kambu phasi mu kamba : “Masumu maku malemvokolo” voti “telama kuaku ayi diata ?” <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Vayi muingi luzaba ti muana mutu beki lulendo va ntoto lu lemvukila masumu…</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:24">Buna wukamba dikoka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:24">—Minu ndikutumina : “Telema, bonga kiphoyi kiaku ayi vutuka ku nzoꞌaku !”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Vana vawu dikoka ditelama, va meso ma batu boso, dibongakiphoyi kiandi ayi divutuka ku nzoꞌandi. Sumbu kavutuka wulembu kembisa Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Batu boso basimina, bakembisa Nzambi kutsi boma baba vayi batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:26">—Matsiminanga tumueni buabu.<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafindisa Yesu ziphaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayi 9.9-13</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Malako 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Mambu momo bu mavioka, Yesu wuyenda kuandi. Vayi wumona mfutisi wumosi wu ziphaku mu nzila, buna kavuendi mu bilu kimfutusulungu ziphaku, dizina diandi Levi. Buna wuntela ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:27">—Wundandakana.<verse eid="LUK 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Mutu beni wutelama, wubika bima bioso ayi wulandakana Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Buna Levi wukubikila Yesu ndikulu dinneni, ku nzoꞌandi. Batu bawombo baba yawu va meza. Mu bawu muba mimfutisi mi ziphaku.<verse eid="LUK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Bafalisi ayi minlongi mi mina miomi miba mu dingumba diawu mifuema ayi bayuvula minlonguki mi Yesu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:30">—Bila mbi lulembo dila ayi nuina va kimosi ayi mimfutisi mi ziphaku miomi, bankua masumu e ?<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:31">—Batu bobo badi nitu yi buvini batombanga munganga ko. Vayi batu badi bimbevo bawu bantombanga munganga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Ndisia kuiza tela batu basonga ko vayi ndiyiza mu diambu di tela bankua masumu.<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimona ayi kikhula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayi 9.14-17</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Malako 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Buna bankaka banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:33">—Bila mbi minlonguki mi Yowani ayi mi Bafalisi mikukifuisanganzala mu diambu di lusambulu vayi miaku mindia ayi minua e ?<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:34">—A beno lumbanza ti batu bobo batumusu, kuidi ditoko diodi dikuedidi, balenda kukifuisa nzala mu diambu di lusambulu ditoko dikuedidi bu dikidi yawu va kimosi e ? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Vayi vadi thangu bu bela ku babotula ditoko, buna bosi mu bilumbu binabela kukifuisa nzala mu diambu di lusambulu.<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Buna wuba kamba nongo yimosi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:36">—Mutu kalendi ko kanzuna tendi kinledi wumona muingi kalondila nledi wunkhulu. Bila buna maka kanzuna nledi wumona ayi tendi kioki kabongidi mu nledi wumona kilendi fuanakana ko ayi tendi kikhulu. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Bobuawu, mutu kalendi tula ko vinu kimona mu zitsaku zikhulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuda baba kifu kilundilanga vinu mu zitsaku zivangulu mu minkanda mi bibulu, vayi mu nkanda wu khombo ziba luta vangiminanga. Tala Matayi 9.17.</char></note> bilanganu vinu kimona kilenda kanzuna zitsaku zikhulu. Buna vinu kidukukidi ayi zitsaku zifuidi. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Vayi bufueni mu tula vinu kimona mu zitsaku zimona. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Kuisi ko mutu wunua vinu kikhulu wubuela tomba diaka nua vinu kimona bila kafueti tuba : vinu kikhulu kilutidi lueki !<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu niandi pfumu lumbu ki saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayi 12.1-8</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Malako 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Kiba lumbu ki saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Matayi 12.1</char></note>, Yesu wuviokila mu tsola yi ble<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Matayi 3.12 ; 12.1 ; Luka 3.17.</char></note>. Minlonguki miandi mivela makundi ayi midia mawu.<verse eid="LUK 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Bafalisi bankaka bayuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:2">—Bila mbi lulembo vangila mambu makanduku mu lumbu ki saba e ?<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesu wubavutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:3">—Lutengi ko mambu Davidi kavanga mu thangu niandi ayi bakundi bandibaba mu nzala e ? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Niandi wukota mu nzo Nzambi, wubonga mapha matambuku kuidi Nzambi ayi wudia mawu ; wukabudila batu bobo baba yandi, ka diambu ko, kasia ba ko minsua bila banganga Nzambi kaka ziba minsua mu dia mawu.<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Buna wubuela tuba diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:5">—Muana mutu niandi Pfumu yi lumbu ki saba.<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayi 12.9-14</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Malako 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Mu lumbu kinkaka ki saba, Yesu wukota mu nzo yi lukutukunu ayi wutona longa. Muna muba mutu wumosi wuba koko ku lubakala kusioka. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Minlongi mi mina ayi Bafalisi basunga Yesu mu tala kani wulendakumbelusa mu lumbu ki saba mu diambu babaka bila kioki balenda kumfundila.<verse eid="LUK 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Vayi Yesu bu kazaba mayindu mawu, buna wukamba mutu wuba koko kusioka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:8">—Telama, yiza va ntuala batu boso !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:8">Mutu beni wutelama. Wuyiza vana.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Buna Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:9">—Kiuvu kidi yama ki kuluyuvula : minsua midi mu vanga mambotevoti mambimbi mu lumbu ki saba e ? Minsua midi mu vukisa luzingu voti mu kuluvonda e ?<verse eid="LUK 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Buna wuzungisa thalu andi kuidi batu boso baba vana bosi wukamba mutu beni :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:10">—Nonuna koko kuaku. Mutu beni wunonuna koko ayi koko kuandi kubeluka. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Minlongi mi mina ayi Bafalisi bafuema ngolo ayi bayuvasana bawu na bawu mu zaba diambu mbi balenda vangila Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusobula bamvuala kumi buadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-4">Matayi 19.1-4</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Malako 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Muna bilumbu beni, Yesu wuyenda ku mbata mongo mu diambu di sambila. Builu bumvimba kasambidila. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Buisi buna bu kia, buna wutela minlonguki miandi ayi wusobula va khatitsikꞌawu kumi mi miodi. Wuba vana dizina di bamvuala. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Mazina mawu mawu mama : Simoni wuka bieka Piela ayi khombꞌandi Andele ; Zaki, Yowani, Filipi, Balitelemi <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Matayi, Toma, Zaki muana Alife, Zimoni wuba mu dingumba di ba Zeloti, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yuda muana zaki ayi Yuda Isikalioti, mutu wumvakula.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu va khatitsika nkangu wu batu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayi 4.23-25</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-11">Malako 3.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Bu kaba kuluka mongo va kimosi ayi bawu Yesu wutelama va ndimba. Minlonguki miandi miwombo miba vana va kimosi ayi nkangu wuwombo wu batu baba mu zunga kioso ki Yuda, ki Yelusalemi, mu mala ma Tile ayi Sidoni momo madi mu yenda nzadi. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Baboso bayiza mu diambu di banwa ayi babelusu mu bimbevo biawu. Bobo bayamusu kuidi ziphevi zimbimbi babeluka. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Baboso batomba kunsimba bila lulendo lutotukila mu niandi luba lubelusa batu boso.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mambu ma khini voti ma mabienga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayi 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Buna Yesu wutala minlonguki miandi ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:20">—Khini kuidi beno minsukama bila beno luvuidi Kipfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Khini kuidi beno luidi buabu mu nzala bila luela yukutusu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:21">Khini kuidi beno lulembu didi buabu bila luela seva.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>Khini kuidi beno mu thangu bela ku lulenda, bu bela ku luloza, bu bela ku lufinga, bu bela ku lukuka, bu bela manga mazinga meno banga mazina mambimbi mu diambu di Muana Mutu.<verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Mu lumbu kina buna luela mona khini ayi luela dumuka mu diambu di khini bila mfutu eno widi wunneni mu diyilu. Bila buawu bobo kuandi bakulu bawu bayamisila mimbikudi.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Vayi mabienga kuidi beno zimvuama bila lukitambudidi yeno mbombolo.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Mabienga kuidi beno luidi bayukuta buabu bila luela mona nzala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:25">Mabienga kuidi beno lulembu sevi buabu bila luela ba mu kaniki ayi luela dila.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Mabienga kuidi beno batu boso bu bela kuluniemisa bila buawu bobobakulu bawu bavangila mimbikudi mi luvunu.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi mu diambu di zola bambeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayi 5.38-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>—Vayi kuidi beno lunwa, ndikulukamba : luzola bambeni zienu ; luvangila mambote bobo bakululendanga ; <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Lusakumuna bobo bakulusinganga ; lusambidila bobo bakuluvangilanga mambu mambimbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Enati mutu wuzubidi mbata mu luvenga lumosi, buela ntambika luvenga lunkaka. Enati mutu wuzionini yunga kiaku, buna kadi ku nkandika kaziona kikhutu kiaku. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Vana kuidi woso mutu wukulomba. Enati mutu wuzionini bima biaku, buna kadi kunlomba diaka biawu.<verse eid="LUK 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Mambu momo lutidi baluvangila, mawu mamveno lufueti vangila bankaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>Enati lunzolanga kaka bobo bakuluzolanga buna mbi lumbaka e ? Bila bankua masumu, mamvawu, beta zola bobo baku bazolanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Enati lumvangila mamboti kuidi bobo bakuluvangilanga kaka mambote, buna mbi lumbaka ? Bila bankua masumu mamvawu beta bu vanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Enati lueta devisa kaka bobo balenda kuluvutudila, buna mbi lumbaka e ? Bila bankua masumu mamvawu beta devisa bankua masumu yawu muingi baba vutudila.<verse eid="LUK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Vayi beno bika luzola bambeni zienu, luba vangila mambote ayi ludevisa mu kambu ba mayindu keni bela kuluvutudila. Buna mfutu eno welaba wunneni, luela ba bana ba Nzambi yizangama bila niandi veka widi wumbote kuidi bobo bazabanga ko vutula matondo ayi kuidi batu bambimbi.<verse eid="LUK 6:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Bika luba batu bambote banga dise dieno widi wumbote.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayi 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>—Lubika sambisa tala mamveno luedi sambusu. Lubika zengila batu nkanu tala mamveno luedi zengulu nkanu. Lulemvukila badienu muingi mamveno balulemvukila. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Luvananga buna mamveno bela kuluvana. Bela kuluvana kuku kifuana, kuku kikomana, kinikunu ayi kinsapuka bila bela kulutezila luelo luela dedakana banga lolo lutezila.<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Yesu wubuela bakamba diaka nongo yayi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:39">—A buevi, phofo wulenda nata phofo yandi e ? Buna bawu buadi balenda bua mu dibulu e ? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Nlonguki kasi viatuka ko nyiyisi andi vayi bu kameni kubuku bu mbote, buna boso kalenda dedakana banga nyiyisi andi.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Bila mbi wuntadila kiti kidi mu diesu di khombꞌaku vayi ngeyo vekawukadi mona tunga yidi mu diesu diaku e ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Voti, buevi wulenda kambila khombꞌaku ti : “A khomba bika ndibotula kiti kidi mu diesu diaku !” vayi ngeyo veka wukadi mona tunga yidi mu diesu diaku e ? Mutu wu mayuya ! Botula nteti tunga yidi mu diesu diaku buna bosi mawumona bumboti mu botula kidi kidi mu diesu di khombꞌaku.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayi 7.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>—Bila kuisi ko nti wumbote wela buta makundi mambimbi ayi nti wumbimbi wulendi buta makundi mambote ko. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Bila banzabilanga nti mu makundi mandi. Bila balendi vela ko makundima figi mu nti wu zitsendi ayi balendi vela ko makundi ma vinu mu nti wu zitsolokoto. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Mutu wumbote wuntotulanga mambote momo mambanga mu kiuka kimboteki ntimꞌandi. Mutu wumbimbi wuntotulanga mambimbi mambanga mu kiuka kimbimbi ki ntimꞌandi bila mutu wuntubanga mambu momo mafulukidi mu ntimꞌandi.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntungi wu diela ayi wu buvulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayi 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>—Bila mbi lukuthedilanga “Pfumu, Pfumu” vayi lukadi vanga mambu momo ndilembu lukambi e ?<verse eid="LUK 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Ndieka kulumonisa buevi budedikinini woso mutu wowo wunkuiza kuidiminu, wulembu wi mambu ndilembu tubi ayi wulembu kumasadila. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Niandi dedikini banga mutu wowo wutunga nzo. Wutimuna fondasio yimula ayi wutungila yawu va yilu matadi. Khuka yi nlangu bu yiyiza, yiyiza lumbama muna nzo beni ayi yisia yinikuna ko bila yitungu va yilu matadi.<verse eid="LUK 6:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Vayi woso wulembu wi mambu mama ayi wunkambu sadila mambu beni dedikini banga mutu wutunga nzoꞌandi va mbata ntoto mu kambu fondasio. Khuka yi nlangu bu yiyiza lumbama mu nzo beni, yawu yitumbu bua, mfuilu yi nzo beni yiba yinneni.<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa kisadi pfumu masodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayi 8.5-13</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 4:46-54">Yowani 4.46-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Bu kamana kamba batu mambu maba yandi, Yesu wuyenda ku Kafalinawumi.<verse eid="LUK 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Pfumu yimosi yi masodi wuba ayi mvikꞌandi wuba mu kimbevo, wuba nduka mu fua. Pfumu beni wuba zolanga ngolo mvika beni. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Bu kawa tsangu yi Yesu, buna pfumu beni yi masodi wumfidisila bakulutu ba Bayuda muingi banleba kiza belusa mvikꞌandi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Bu batula vaba Yesu mbadi banleba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:4">—Niandi fueni wumvangila buawu. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Bila wunzolanga tsi etu ayi niandi veka wututungila nzo yi lukutukunu.<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Yesu wuyenda yawu. Buna weka nduka tula ku nzo, pfumu yi masodiwumfidisila bakundi bandi mu kunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">—A pfumu, bika kuaku kiyamisa bila ndisi wufuana ko muingi ngeyo wukota mu nzoꞌama. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Diawu ndisi kuiza kudenginina ko minu veka vayi tuba kaka diambu dimosi buna kisadi kiama ma kibeluka. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Bila minu veka ndidi ku tsi luyalu lu bapfumu ayi mbeki masodi ma ndieta tumina. Minu kamba kuidi wumosi : “Yenda” makenda. Minu kamba kuidi wunkaka : “Yiza” makiea. Minu kamba kuidi mvikꞌama : “vanga diadi !”, balavanga diawu. <verse eid="LUK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesu wusimina buwombo bu kawa mamu ma pfumu yi masodi. Buna wubaluka kuidi nkangu wuba kunlandakana ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:9">—Bukiedika ndikulukamba ndimueni ko, ka diambu ko mu Iseli, minu kinneni banga kiaki.<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Bamvuala mi pfumu masodi zivutuka kuawu kuna nzo, kuna yiyenda bata mvika beni mu buvini.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wufulukisa ditoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Mu lumbu kilanda, Yesu wuyenda ku divula dimosi diba bantedilanga Nayini. Minlonguki miandi minlandakana va kimosi ayi nkangu wuwombo. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Bu katula va difula di divula, wudengana batu banata mvumbi ku nganda yidivula. Wuba muana wumosi kaka wu difuola. Nkangu wu wombo wu divula wuba yandi va kimosi. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Pfumu bu kamona difuola beni buna wummona kiadi ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:13">—Bika dila.<verse eid="LUK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Bosi wufikama vaba kesi yi mvumbi ayi wutetika koko kuandi va mbata kesi beni. Bobo banata kesi batelama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:14">Buna wukamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:14">—Ndikutumina, muana ditoko, telama kuaku !<verse eid="LUK 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Zimbukila mutu wuba wufua wuvumbuka, wuvuanda ayi wutona yoluka. Yesu wumvana kuidi ngudi andi. <verse eid="LUK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Babo bamona tsisi, bakembisa Nzambi ayi batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:16">—Mbikudi wunneni wututotukidi ayi Nzambi wizidi mu sadisa batu bandi.<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Tsangu yi nsamu wawu yitembakana mu Yuda dioso ayi mu bizunga bizungidila.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Minlonguki mi Yowani mimana kamba Yowani mambu moso momo mavioka. Buna wutumisa minlonguki miandi miodi <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>ayi wuba fidisa kuidi Pfumu mu diambu banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:19">—Bukiedika kuandi ti ngeyo mutu wowo wufueti kuiza voti tufueti vingila wunkaka e ?<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Batu beni bayenda kuidi Yesu ayi bankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:20">—Yowani Mbotidi wututumini. Katu kembi tuyuvula : “ngeyo mutu wowo wufueti kuiza voti tufueti vingila wunkaka e ?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Muna thangu yina, Yesu wubelusa batu bawombo baba mu bimbevo ayi mu minsongo. Wubelusa batu bayamusu kuidi ziphevi zimbimbi ayi wuzibula meso ma baphofo bawombo. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Buna wukamba kuidi bobo bafidudu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:22">—Luvutuka kudi Yowani ayi lunkamba mambu momo lumueni ayi luwilu ; baphofo zilembu moni ; makoka malembu diati ; batu ba buazi balembu vedusu, batu bafua matu balembu wi, bafua balembu fuluka ; nsamu wumboti wulembu longu kuidi batu basukama. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Khini kuidi mutu wela manga zimbisa minu kiandi mu diambu diama.<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Bamvuala zi Yowani bu zivutuka, Yesu wubaka diluaku di yolukila mambuma Yowani kudi nkangu wu batu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:24">—Mbi biobi luyenda tala ku dikanga e ? Nti wufioti wulembu vevumunu kuidi phemo e ? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Vayi buna nani luyenda tale e ? Mutu wuvuata minledi mi kitoko e ? Tala batu bobo bamvuatanga minledi mi kitoko ayi banzingilanga mu zikhini mu zinzo zi mintinu bankalanga. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Vayi buna mbi luyenda tala e ? Mbikudi luyenda tala e ? Nyinga buawu kuandi vayi ndikulukamba ti niandi viokidi mbikudi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Bila niandi wuyolukulu mu minkanda ti :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="qt">Tala mfidisidi mvualꞌala ku ntualꞌaku,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="qt">niandi wela kubika nzilꞌaku ku ntualꞌaku.</char><verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba : mu batu boso bobo babutu kuidi baketo, kuidiko mutu wowo viokidi Yowani. Vayi wulutidi kefa mu kipfumu ki Diyilu wunlutidi.<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:16-19">Matayi 11.16-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>—Batu boso bawa mambu momo ayi mimfutisi mi ziphaku, bazababusonga bu Nzambi bu babotoko kuidi Yowani. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Vayi Bafalisi ayi minlongi mi mina, bobo bamanga botoko kuidi niandi, va meso mawu baloza luzolo lu Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Banga banani ndenda dedikisa tsungi yayi e ? Yidedikini banga babani e ? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Yidedikini banga bana bafioti bavuedi va zandu ayi balembu kambasana bawu na bawu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:32">Beto tulusikidi nsioni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nsioni</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minsekudi minkaka misadila siku bantedilanga mu kifalansi “flûte” tala Matayi 11.17.</char></note> vayi lusia kina ko. Tuyimbila minkunga mi mafua vayi lusia dila ko.<verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Bila Yowani wuyiza, kasia dia mampa ko ayi kasia nua vinu ko. Vayi lukamba : “Pheve yibmimbi yidi yandi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Muana mutu wuyiza ; wundia, wunua ayi luntuba : “Niandi nzuna kadi ayi kolu mbungu ; nkundi mimfutisi mi ziphaku ayi bankua masumu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Vayi nduenga yimmonikanga yisonga mu nzila yi bana bandi.<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayi nsumuki wu nketo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Mfalisi wumosi wuleba Yesu mu dia yandi va meza. Yesu wuyenda ku nzoꞌandi ayi wuvuanda va meza. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Zimbukila va totuka nketo wumosi wu divula, wuba nsumuki. Wuzaba ti Yesu vuendi va meza ku nzo yi Mfalisi buna wunata bungu ki wala malasi, bungu beni kivangulu mu ditadi di alabatele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Matayi 26.7 ; Malako 14.3.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Wutelama ku mbusa malu mandi. Wuba dila ayi matsuela mandi mabua mu malu ma Yesu. Buna wufiona mawu mu zitsuki ziandi. Wufifa malu mandi besi ayi wufukudila mawu malasi.<verse eid="LUK 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Bu kamona bobo, Mfalisi wowo wutumisa Yesu wuniunguta : enati bukiedika mutu wawu mbikudi nginu bakudingi nani nketowowo wulembu nsimbi nani ayi buevi kadidi ; bila nkento nkua masumu.<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesu wunkamba mu mbembo yingolo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">—A Simoni, diambu didi yama di kukamba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Buna Mfalisi wumvutudila ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">—A nlongi, tuba kuaku !<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Buna Yesu wunkamba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:41">—Vaba mutu wumosi wudevisa zimbongo kuidi batu buadi. Wutheti wudeva zikhama zitanu zi denali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Denali</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kimosi kidedakana mu mfutu wu lumbu kimosi wu kisadi kinsalanga mu ndima.</char></note> bosi wummuandi wudeva makumatanu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Sumbu bawu buadi basia ba ko zimbongo zikumvutudila, buna wubalemvukila. Mu mpila yaku, mu bawu buadi ; nani wela luta kunzola e ?<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoni wuvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">—Minu mbueni Mutu wowo wuba pholo yinneni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Buna Yesu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">—Bukiedika kuaku tubidi.<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Bosi wubaluka kuidi nketo ayi wukamba kuidi Simoni :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:44">—Mueni nketo wawu e ? Mu thangu khotidingi mu nzoꞌaku, wusia kundatinanga ko nlangu mu diambu ndisukula malu. Vayi niandi bodisidingi malu mama mu matsuela mandi ayi fioniningi mawu mu zitsuki ziandi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Wusia ku mfifanga besi ko vayi tona buna khotidingi, niandi kakadi vonga mu lembu kafifanga malu mama bibesi. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Wusia dukulanga ko mafuta ku ntu ama vayi niandi dukudingimalasi mu malu mama. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Diawu ndikukambila ti masumu mawombo momo mabedi yandi malemvokolobila wumonisina luzolo luwombo. Vayi mutu wowo beta lemvukila fioti, niandi mamvandi fioti kaka keti zodila.<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Bosi wukamba nketo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:48">—Masumu maku malemvukulu.<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Batu bobo baba yandi va meza bakambasana bawu na bawu ti : “Buna nani mutu wawu wulemvukila masumu ?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Vayi Yesu wukamba nketo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:50">—Minu kiaku kivukisidi ; yenda mu ndembama !<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Batu bobo baba landakananga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Bosi Yesu wuyenda mu mavula ayi mu mala mu yamikisa ayi mu samuna Nsamu Wumboti wu Kipfumu ki Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Kumi bamvuala buadi banlandakana va kimosi ayi ndambu baketo bobokabelusa bu bayamusu kuidi ziphevi zimbimbi ayi bobo kabelusa mu zimpasi. Baketo beni bawu baba : Maliya baba ntedilanga Maliya muisi Mangadala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mangadala</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">buala buidi ku disimu di wesite di mbu wu Ngalili.</char></note>. Mu niandi katotula ziphevi tsambudi zimbimbi, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Zana nketo Suza mutu wuba lundanga bima bi Elode, Suzani ayi bawombo bankaka baba kunsadisanga mu bima biawu.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi nkuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayi 13.1-9</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Malako 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Nkangu wuwombo wu batu wuyiza kutakana. Batu beni batotukila mu mavula mavombo. Buna Yesu wuba samunia nongo yayi :<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>—Nkuni wumosi wuyenda ku muanga mbongo andi. Mu thangu kaba muanga mbongo andi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuda baba kifu ki muanganga zitheti mu ntangu yi kuna.</char></note>, ndambu yi zitheti yibua mu ndambu yi nzila. Batu badiatila ziawu ayi zinuni zidoda ziawu. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Ndambu yinkaka yi zitheti yibua va matadi. Bu zimena, zivika yuma bilavasia ba mbozi ko. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Zinkaka zibua va zitsendi. Zitsendi ziyunduka va kimosi ayi mintuidilavayi zitsendi zifietikisa miawu. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Vayi zinkaka zibua va ntoto wumboti. Zimena ayi zibuta makundi. Kadika luteti lubuta khama yinkaka yi zitheti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Buna katuba mambu momo, wuyamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">—Woso widi matu ma wila buna bika kawa.<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-13">Matayi 13.10-13</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Malako 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Minlonguki miandi minyuvula tsundu yi nongo yoyi.<verse eid="LUK 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:10">—Beno lutambula diluaku di zabila matsueki ma Kipfumu ki Nzambi vayi kuidi bankaka mambu mama mafueti yolokolo mu zinongo muingi ka diambu kobalembu tadi vayi bakadi mona ; ka diambu ko balembu wa vayi balendi sudika ko.<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayi 13.18-23</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Malako 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>—Luwa tsundu yi nongo yayi : mbongo yawu mambu ma Nzambi <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Mu ndambu nzila yidi batu beti wanga mambu ma Nzambi vayi satana wunkuizanga ayi wunzionanga mawu mu mintima miawu mu diambu di kuba kandika babika wilukila muingi bedi vuka.<verse eid="LUK 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>“Mbongo yibua va matadi” yidi batu beti wanga mambu ma Nzambiayi beti tambulanga mawu mu khini vayi basiko mianzi. Minu kiawu kizingilanga ko. Mu thangu yi thotolo bavika kukitabilanga.<verse eid="LUK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>“Mbongo yibua va zitsendi” yidi batu bobo bawa mambu ma Nzambi ayi bayenda kuawu. Vayi bafietukusu mu diambu di mayindu, bamvuama ayi makhini ma luzingu. Babutanga ko mimbutu milenda yela.<verse eid="LUK 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Bosi “mbongo yibua va ntoto wumbote” yidi batu bobo bawa mambuma Nzambi, balunda mawu mu ntima wukambulu mayuya ayi wumbote. Bawu bambutanga mimbutu bu bavibididi.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi muinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Malako 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>—Mutu bu kalemisini muinda, kalendi kuwufukidila nzungu kovoti kuwutula ku tsi mbuka ; vayi va yilu meza kafueti wutula mu diambu di bobo bankota bamona kiezila. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Bila mamo masuama mafueti ba va kiesila ; mamo masueku mafueti zabakana ayi totuka va nganda.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Diawu lulubuka mu mpila lulembu wila bila bela buela vana kuidi mutu wowo beki vayi kudi mutu wowo kambulu bela kunziona, ka diambu ko, biobi kambanza ti bidi yandi.<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikanda dikiedika di Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayi 12.46-50</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Malako 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Ngudi yi Yesu ayi bakhomba bandi bayiza kuidi niandi vayi basianunga ko fikama va kaba mu diambu di nkangu wu batu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Buna bankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:20">—Ngudi aku ayi bakhomba ziaku badi ku nganda ayi batidi kumona.<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:21">—Bobo beti wanga mambu ma Nzambi ayi bansadilanga mawu bawu ngudiama ayi bakhomba ziama.<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu viatukidi vuka mu ngolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayi 8.23-27</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Malako 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Lumbu kimosi Yesu wukuma mu nlungu va kimosi ayi minlongukimiandi, buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:22">—Bika tusabukanu ku disimu dinkaka di mbu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:22">Buna batula ku ngingi nlangu. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Bu baba vuila, Yesu wuleka tulu. Zimbukila vuka kimosi kingolo kitonamu mbu, nlangu wutona wala mu nlungu ayi mu ziphasi miba.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Minlonguki mifikama vaba Yesu, minkotula mu yamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">—A nlongi, A nlongi tueka fua !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Wukotuka ayi wutemina vuka ayi mayo ma mbu. Buna biawu bilembama ayi ndembama yivutuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Buna wukamba minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">—A kuevi kuidi minu kieno e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Vayi bawu bamona tsisi ayi basimina. Ayi bayuvasana bawu na bawu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">—Buna nani niawu wuntumina vuka ayi nlangu, ayi biawu binkutumukina e ?<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu viatukidi ziphevi zimbimbi mu ngolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayi 8.28-34</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Malako 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Batula mu zunga ki basi Ngalasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngalasa</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minsekudi minkaka misonika “Zunga ki basi Ngadala”, minkaka misonika “zunga ki basi Ngelengesi”. Tala Matayi 8.28 ; Malako 5.1.</char></note>, kitalani ayi ngalili <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Yesu bu kakuluka va disimu buna mutu wumosi muisi divula beniwuba ayi ziphevi zimbimbi tona thama wuyiza kundengana. Pheni nkua kaba kibanga ; kaba vuandanga ko mu nzo vayi ku biziami kaba vuandanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Bu kamona Yesu, wubua va ntualꞌandi ayi wutuba mu mbembo yi ngolo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:28">—A diambu mbi tuidi betu yaku, ngeyo muana Nzambi yizangama e ? Wundemvukila, kadi kundiamisa.<verse eid="LUK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Wutuba bobo mu diambu Yesu wutumina mpeve yimbimbi yitotuka mu mutu wowo. Bila tona thama, mpeve beni yimbila. Buna mutu beni baba kunkanganga ayi kunkebilanga mu zisieni ayi bisengo mu malu vayi wuba kubi tabunanga ayi mpeve yimbimbi yiba kunnatanga mu bibuangu bisuama.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesu wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">—Dizina diaku nani e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Niandi wuvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">—Lengio. Bila ziphevi ziwombo zimbimbi zikota mu mutu beni.<verse eid="LUK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Ziphevi zimbimbi beni zileba Yesu muingi kabika kuba tuma benda ku diyenga. <verse eid="LUK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Nkangu wu zingulu wuba dia vana mbata mongo. Ziphevi zimbimbizileba Yesu muingi zikota mu zingulu beni. Buna wuba vana minsua. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Ziphevi zimbimbi zitotuka mu mutu ayi zikota mu zingulu. Muna yina thangu nkangu wu zingulu wunengumuka mu mongo nate ziyiza bua mu mbu. Buna zidiama.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Mu thangu minsungi mi zingulu mimona mambu momo mavioka, mitina ayi miyenda kamba mambu beni ku divula ayi mu zitsola. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Batu bayiza tala mambu momo mavioka. Bayiza vaba Yesu ayi bamona mutuwowo wutotulu ziphevi zimbimbi buna kavuendi va malu ma Yesu. Wuvuata minledi ayi diela diandi diduka. Buna bamona boma. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Batu bobo bamona mambu beni baba kamba buevi bu vukila mutu wowo wuyamusu kuidi ziphevi zimbimbi.<verse eid="LUK 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Vana vawu batu ba zunga ki Ngelasa bu bamona boma bu ngolobuna baleba Yesu kabotuka mu zunga kiawu. Niandi wukuma mu nlungu ayi wuvutuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Mutu wowo wukulu mu ziphevi zimbimbi wuleba Yesu muingi kanlandakanavayi Yesu wumvutula ayi wunkamba :<verse eid="LUK 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>—Vutuka ku nzoꞌaku ayi samuna mambu moso Nzambi kavangidi. Buna mutu beni wuyenda, wuyemikisa, mu divula dioso, mambu Yesu kamvangila.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuviatuka bimbevo ayi lufua mu ngolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayi 9.18-26</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Malako 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Bu kavutuka, nkangu wu batu wuyakula Yesu bila batu boso baba kumvingila. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Tala mutu wumosi dizina diandi Yayilusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minsekudi minkaka misonika Yayilo va buangu ki Yayilusi. Tala Malako 5.22.</char></note>. Niandi wuba pfumu yi nzo yi lukutukunu, wuyiza ayi wubua va malu ma Yesu, wunleba mu diambu kiza ku nzo andi <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>bila muanꞌandi wumosi kaka wunketo, wuba nduka-nduka kumi mimvu miodi wuba nduka mu fua. Bu kaba kuenda vayi nkangu wu batu wumfietikisa.<verse eid="LUK 8:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Nketo wumosi wuba kimbevo kiviokanga menga ; kumi mimvu miodi kabedila kimbevo beni ayi wumana fukisa bima biandi bioso kuidi minganga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wumana fukisa bima biandi bioso mu diambu di futa minganga : mambu mama masi ko mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note>. Vayi kadi munganga wumosi kasia nunga ko mu kumbelusa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Wufikama ku manima ma Yesu ayi wusimba tsongi nledi andi. Vana vawu menga makangama.<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Buna Yesu wuyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">—Nani wutsimbidi. Baboso bamanga kuawu kikinina. Diawu Piela kankambila va kimosi ayi bobo baba yandi : A Nlongi, nkangu wu batu wuzungididi ayi wufietikisidi ku zindambu zioso.<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Vayi niandi wuvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:46">—Mutu wumosi wutsimbidi bila nzebi ti lulendo lutotukidi mu munu.<verse eid="LUK 8:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Nketo beni bu kamona ti kalendi suama ko, buna, wuyiza ayi lunkuku, wufukama va malu ma Yesu. Wusudikisa va ntuala wu batu boso bila kiokikansimbila ayi buevi kabelukididi.<verse eid="LUK 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yesu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:48">—A muanꞌama wunketo, minu kiaku kivukisidi, yenda mu ndembama.<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Buna kamanisini ko tuba, mutu wuba kuidi pfumu nzo yilukutukunu wuyiza ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:49">—Muanꞌaku wunketo fuidi, bika buela yamisa nlongi.<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Yesu bu kawa bobo, wukamba Yayilusi ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:50">—Bika mona boma vayi wilukila kaka bila muanꞌaku wunketo wela beluka.<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Bu katula ku nzo, wukandika batu boso babika kota mu nzobotula kaka Piela, Yowani, Zaki ayi dise ayi ngudi yi muana ndumba. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Batu boso badila ayi banionga mu diambu diandi ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:52">—Bikanu dila bila kadi fua ko, tulu tuandi kalekidi.<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Batu baba kunsekinina bila bazabati fuidi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Buna Yesu wusimba koko ku muana ndumba ayi wutuba mu mbembo yingolo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:54">—Muanꞌama, telama kuaku.<verse eid="LUK 8:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Buna wufuluka ayi wutelama ; Yesu wuvana minsua mu diambu bamvana bidia. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Zimbuta zi muana ndumba zisimina. Yesu wuba kandika babika kambakadi kuidi mutu wumosi mambu maviokidi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutuma mimvuala kumi mimiodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-9">Matayi 10.1-9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:11-14">11-14</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Malako 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesu wukutikisa kumi mimvuala miodi ayi wuba vana lulendo ayi luyalu lu totudila ziphevi zioso zimbimbi ayi lubelusila bambevo. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Bosi wuba tuma benda yamikisa luyalu lu Nzambi ayi wuba tuma babelusa bambevo. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Wuba vana zithumunu ziazi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:3">—Kadi nata kadi kiasa mu nzila : kadi nata nkawa, kadi tsaku, kadi khuta, kadi zimbongo. Kadi mutu kanata kikhutu kiviakisa. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Yoso nzo luela kota buna luvuanda muna nate luela botuka va divula beni. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Enati bamengi kulutambula buna mu thangu luela totuka mu divula beni, buna luba kukumuna mbungi-mbungi yi malu meno muingi kiba kimbangi kuidi bawu.<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Buna miyenda. Midiengila mu mala moso. Milonga nsamu Wumbote ayi mibelusa bambevo mu bibuangu bioso.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Elode wukiyamisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Matayi 14.1-2</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-16">Malako 6.14-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Nyadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nyadi</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">voti nguvelinele</char></note> Elode wawu zitsangu zi mambu mamo mavioka, wukiyamisangolo. Bila bankaka batuba : “Yowani niandi wufulukidi mu bafua !” <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Vayi bankaka : “Eli niandi wumonikini.” Vayi bankaka “Niandi widi mbikudi wumosi mu mimbikudi mikhulu, niandi fulukidi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Vayi Elode wuba tuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:9">—Keti minu veka ndizengisa Yowani ntu ! Vayi buna nani mutuwowo, ndilembu wilanga mambu momo ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:9">Buna wutomba nzila mu kummona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudikila mili tanu yi babakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayi 14.13-21</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 6:33-44">Malako 6.33-44</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-15">Yowani 6.1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Mimvuala mivutuka ayi mivumbudila Yesu kipholo ki mamo mivanga ; wuba nata va lutengo ku ndambu divula dibeti tedila Betisayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Vayi nkangu wu batu bu bazaba nsamu beni, buna banlandakana. Yesu wuba yakula, wuba yolukila nsamu wu kipfumu ki Nzambi ayi wu belusa batu baba tsatu yi belusu.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Buisi buna bueka yila, kumi mimvuala miodi va kaba ayi minkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:12">—Vutula nkangu wu batu muingi benda mu mala ayi mu zitsola zifikimini mu diambu babaka bidia ayi minleku bila va buangu kikambulu batu tuidi.<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Vayi Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">—Luba vananu beno veka bidia. Vayi bawu bavutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">—Mampa matanu kaka madi yeto ayi zimbizi zizole zi nlangu. Mananga tidi beto veka tuenda sumbi bidia mu diambu di batu boso baba e ?<verse eid="LUK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Bila nduka-nduka mili tanu yi babakala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuda baba kifu kitanganga kaka babakala, baba tanganga ko baketoayi bana balezi. Tala Matayi 14.21 ; Malako 6.44.</char></note> yiba vana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu wukamba minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">—Luba vuandisa mu makabu ma makumatanu ma batu. <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Buawu mivanga ayi mivuandisa batu boso. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Buna Yesu wubonga mampa beni matanu ayi zimbizi beni zizole zi nlangu. Wumvumbula meso ku Yilu, wusakumuna mawu bosi wubukuna mawuayi wuvana mawu minlonguki miandi mu diambu bakabudila nkangu wu batu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Bawu boso badia ayi bayukuta. Mu bitini bisiadidila, batota kumi bipani biodi.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Piela wutelimina Yesu kimbangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-21">Matayi 16.13-21</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-31">Malako 8.27-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Lumbu kimosi Yesu kaba sambila va lutengu, minlonguki miandi miba yandi va kimosi. Buna wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:18">—Buevi batu beti tubanga ; minu ndidi nani e ?<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Minlonguki mimvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:19">—Bankaka beta tuba widi Yowani Mbotikii ; bankaka Eli ; bankakabeta tuba widi wumosi mu mimbikudi mi tsi khulu wufulukidi.<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Buna wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">—Vayi benu veka, lueta tuba ti minu ndidi nani e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Buna Piela wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">—Ngeyo widi Klisto, wu Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Buna Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:21">—Lubika kamba mambu mama kadi kuidi mutu wumosi.<verse eid="LUK 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Buna wubuela diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:22">—Muana Mutu kafueti mona ziphasi ziwombo ayi bakulutu ba batu, bapfumu zi zinganga ayi minlongi mi mina miela kunloza. Wela vondu vayi wela fuluka mu lumbu kintatu.<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buevi bu landikinina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Matayi 16.24-28</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Malako 8.34–9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Buna wukamba batu boso ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:23">—Enati mutu tidi kundandakana buna kafueti kukizimbakana niandi veka vayi kabonga dikulusi diandi kadika lumbu ayi kandandakana. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Bila woso tidi keba luzingu luandi wela luzimbisa vayi wosowela luzimbisa mu diambu diama, buna wela luvukisa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Enati mutu beki ntoto wumvimba vayi wukizimbisidi voti wukibivisidiniandi veka, buna ndandu mbi kambaka e ? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Enati mutu wumfuididi tsoni voti fuidi tsoni mu diambu di mambu mama, buna Muana mutu wela kumfuila tsoni bu kela kuizila mu nkembuꞌandi, mu nkembo wu Tata ayi wu zimbasi zinlongo. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti batu bankaka badi vava balendi ba fuako nate bela mona kipfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukituka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayi 17.1-8</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Malako 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Dinana di bilumbu bu bivioka, landila mambu momo, Yesu wubonga Piela, Yowani ayi Zaki ayi wuyenda ku mbata mongo mu kuenda sambila.<verse eid="LUK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Mu thangu kaba sambila, zizi kiandi kikituka, minledi miandimieka miphembi dio lio, milezama banga lusiemo. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Batu buadi baba solula yandi : Moyize ayi Eli. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Mu bawu mu monika nkembo. Bayolukila lufua lolo kela dukisa ku Yelusalemi.<verse eid="LUK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Piela ayi bakundi bandi buadi baba baleka. Mu thandu bakotuka, bamona nkembo wu Yesu ayi bamona batu beni baba buadi baba yandi.<verse eid="LUK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Mu thangu batu beni baba nduka vambana ayi Yesu, Piela wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:33">—Pfumu, bulutidi mboti tukala kuetu vava. Tueka tunga zinzozitatu zikapu : yimosi mu diambu diaku, yimosi mu diambu di Moyize, yimosi mu diambu di Eli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:33">Vayi kasia zaba ko mambu momo katuba.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Buna wukidi tubi, dituti dimosi diyiza ayi diba fukidila. Buna minlonguki mimona tsisi mu thangu mikota mu dituti.<verse eid="LUK 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Buna mbembo yitotuka mu dituti beni yiwakana :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:35">—Niandu niandi Muanꞌama wundisobula, lunwila !<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Mbembo yoyo bu yiwakana, Yesu niandi veka wusiala. Vayi bawu baba dio sui ; Mu bilumbu bina basia yolukila ko kadi kuidi mutu wumosi mambu momo bamona.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa muana wuba mpeve yimbimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayi 17.14-18</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Malako 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Mu lumbu kilanda bu baba kuluka mongo, nkangu wu batu wuyiza dengana Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Muna nkangu beni mutotukila mutu wumosi wuyamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:38">—A Nlongi, ndikuleba, tala muanꞌama wubakala. Wawu kaka muana widi yama. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Mpeve yawu kumbuila, buna muana wunyamikinanga. Mpeve beni yinkuntutumunanga, yikuntotulanga difulu ayi bu yimeni kumvongisa bunabosi yinkumbikanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Ndebidingi minlonguki miaku muingi miyitotula vayi misi nunganga ko.<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Buna Yesu wuvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:41">—Tsungi yikambulu minu ayi yimbimbi ! Zithangu zikua ndielakadilanga yeno diaka va kimosi ? Zithangu zikua ndiela buela kangilanga ntima mu bila kieno e ? Buna wukamba mutu beni ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:41">—Tuala muanꞌaku vava !<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Mu thangu muana kaba fikama, mpeve yimbimbi yinlumba va ntotoayi yitona kuntutumuna ngolo. Buna Yesu wutemina mu kingolo mpeveyimbimbi. Buna wubelusa muana wubakala ayi wutambika wawu kuidi Siandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Babo basimina mu diambu di bunneni bu Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu wubuela wuyolukila lufua luandi.</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayi 17.22-23</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Malako 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Buna babo bakidi simina mu diambu di mambu moso momo Yesu kaba vanganga, buna wukamba minlonguki miandi :<verse eid="LUK 9:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>—Lulunda bumbote mama luwilu bila Muana Mutu weka yekulu mu mioko mi batu.<verse eid="LUK 9:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Vayi minlonguki misia sudika ko mambu momo. Baba suekila tsundu yi mambu beni mu diambu mibika sudika. Ayi mimona tsisi mu yuvula tsunduyi mambu momo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nani lutidi munneni mu kipfumu ki Diyilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayi 18.1-5</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Malako 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Ziphaka zitotuka mu bawu na bawu mu diambu di zaba nani lutidi munneni. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yesu bu kazaba mayindu mawu ma mintima miawu, wubonga muanalezi, wuntedimisa va ndambu andi <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:48">—Woso mutu wunyakula muana wawu mu dizina diama buna minu kuandi kayakudi. Ayi woso wundiakudi buna yakudi diaka mutu wowo wuntuma. Bila woso lutidi keva mu beno, buna niandi lutidi munneni.<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Malako 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Buna Yowani wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:49">—A nlongi, tumueningi mutu wumosi wulembu totulanga ziphevizimbimbi mu dizina diaku. Vayi tunkandikidingi bila kadiatanga yetu va kimosi ko.<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Vayi Yesu wumvutudila ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:50">—Lubika kunkandika bila woso kambulu bumbeni kudi beno buna ku ndambu eno kadi.<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">YESU WUYENDA KU YELUSALEMI</para>
  <para style="s1">Basia tambulu ko ku Samali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Thangu yoyi Yesu kafueti kuendila ku diyilu bu yifuana, bunawubaka lukanu lu kuenda ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Wufidisa mimvuala ku ntualꞌandi. Buna miyenda mikota mu buala bumosi bu Samali mu diambu minkubikila nleko. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Vayi basi Samali bamanga ku ntambula bila ku Yelusalemi kaba kuenda. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Minlonguki miandi, Zaki ayi Yowani, bu mimona bobo, mituba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:54">—Pfumu, tidi tutumina mbazu, yintotukila ku diyilu, yibuila batu baba muingi yiba yoka ?<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Vayi Yesu wubaluka ayi wuba temina.<verse eid="LUK 9:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Buna bayenda ku buala bunkaka.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlonguki kafueti kukivana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:18-22">Matayi 8.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Buna bakidi mu nzila mutu wumosi wuyiza kamba Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:57">—Nlongi thidi kulandakana koso ku wunkuenda.<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:58">—Mimbaku midi ayi minsuku miawu momo mieta leka ayi zinuni zidiayi zindiala ziawu vayi muana mutu kasi ko buangu kivundisila ntu andi.<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Yesu wukamba kuidi wunkaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">—Ngeyo ndandakana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Vayi mutu beni wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">—A Pfumu, phani minsua ndienda tuami ziki siama.<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Buna Yesu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:60">—Bika bazika batu bawu bafua vayi ngeyo yenda samuna Kipfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Wunkaka diaka wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:61">—A Pfumu, ndiela kulandakana vayi bika theti ndienda vanimboti zitsuka kuidi dikanda diama.<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Vayi Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:62">—Mutu wowo simbidi tsengu mu sala mu tsola vayi tedi ku manima, kasi fuana ko mu diambu di Kipfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutuma lusambudi lu makumi ayi minlonguki miodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Momo bu mavioka, Pfumu wusobula diaka lusambudi lu makumi ayi minlonguki miodi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minkanda minkaka mieta yolukila lusambudi lu makumi</char></note> ; wuba tuma buadi-buadi muingi bantuaminina ku ntuala mu mavula moso ayi mu bibuangu bioso biobi niandi veka kafueti viokila. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:2">—Makundi meka mawombo mu ndima vayi bisadi bidi bifioti. Diawu luleba Pfumu yi ndima muingi kafidisa bisadi mu ndimꞌandi. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Tala minu ndiludidisidi banga mameme va khatitsika memvu. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Lubika nata kadi photimoni, kadi sakosi, kadi zisapatu ayi lubika vana kadi mutu mbote mu nzila.<verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Bu luela kota mu nzo yimosi, lutuba theti : “Bika ndembama yiba mu nzo yayi”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kiba kifu ki Bayuda mu vanasananga mbote mu mambu mama.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Enati mutu wundembama wudi mu nzo beni buna ndembama yeno yela ba mu niandi vayi enati buawu ko buna ndembama beni yela luvutukila. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Buna luvuanda mu nzo beni, ludia bidia bela kuluvana ayi lunuanduinu bena kuluvana bila “kisadi kifueni mu tambula mfutu andi.” Lubika ba ti lueka nzo yayi, luedi mu nzo yina.<verse eid="LUK 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Mu dioso divula di lunkota ayi enati baluyakudi buna ludia bioso bela kuluvana, <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>lubelusa bambevo ziela ba muna ayi luba kamba : “Kipfumu ki Nzambiki lufikimini.” <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Vayi mu dioso divula di lunkota ayi enatibamengi kuluyakula buna lutotuka mu zinzila zi divula beni ayi lutuba : <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>“Ka diambu ko mbungi-mbungi yi divula dieno yinemi mu malumeto, tueka yikukumuna ; vayi luzaba diadi ti Kipfumu ki Nzambi ki fikimini.”<verse eid="LUK 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:15">Matayi 10.15</ref> ; <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Ndikulukamba ti mu lumbu kina, thumbudulu yi divula dina yelaviatuka thumbudulu ui Sodoma.<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>Mabienga kuidi ngeyo Kolazini ! Mabienga kuidi ngeyo Betesayida ! Bila enati bikumu bivangulu va khatitsikꞌeno biawu bivangulu ku Tile ayi ku Sidoni, nganu thama batu ba mavula beni babalula mavanga mawu ayi mu monisa buawu mu vuata zitsaku ayi mu kivinda dibombi. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Vayi mu lumbu ki tsambusu, thumbudulu yeno yela viatuka yi Tile ayi yi Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>A ngeyo Kafalinawumi, ngeyo wummuena ti wela tombulu nateku diyilu e ? Wela kululu nate ku tsi yi bafua !<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Buna wubuela diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:16">—Woso mutu wukuluwila buna minu kuandi kawilu ; ayi woso mutu wululozidi buna minu kuandi kalozidi vayi woso mutu wundozidi buna lozidi mutu wowo wuthuma.<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Lusambudi ayi minlonguki miodi mivutuka, khini ayi mituba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:17">—A Pfumu, ka diambu ko ziphevi zimbimbi zitutumimini beto kuzivana zithumunu mu dizina diaku.<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Niandi wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:18">—Ndimueni satana wubuidi va tsi banga lusiemo. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Tala ; ndiluveni lulendo lu diatila zinioka, zikhutu ayi kipfumu va lulendo loso lu mbeni ayi kadi kima kimosi kilendi kuluvanga mbimbi ko. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Muaki lubika mona khini mu diambu ziphevi zilutumimini vayi lumona khini mazina meso bu madi masonama ku Diyilu.<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nduzi yi minlonguki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayi 11.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Muna thangu beni, Yesu wumona khini mu Mpeve ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:21">—A Tata, Pfumu yi Diyilu ayi yi ntoto, ndikukembisa bila wusuekamambu mama kuidi batu banduenga ayi badiela vayi wumonisini mawu kuidi bana balezi. Nyinga, tata, mu luzolo luaku buawu bobo wumuenina. <verse eid="LUK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>Dise diama dindiekudila mambu moso kuisi ko mutu zebi muana botula kaka Dise. Kuisi ko mutu zebi Dise botula kaka Muana ayi woso-woso mutu wowo Muana katidi monikisa Dese.<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">Matayi 13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Bu kabaluka kuidi minlonguki miandi, buna wuba kamba va bawu veka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:23">—Khini kuidi batu balembu moni mambu momo lulembo moni ! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Bila bukiedika ndikulukamba mimbikudi miwombo ayi mintinumiwombo mizola mona mambu momo lulembo moni vayi misia mamona ko ; mizola wa mambu momo lulembo wi vayi misia mawa ko.<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi mutu wumboti wu muisi Samali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Nlongi wumosi wu Mina wutelama ayi wuyuvula Yesu kiuvu mu kumfiela ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:25">—A nlongi, diambu mbi mfueti vanga muingi ndibaka luzingu lukalimani e ?<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:26">—A mambu mbi masonama mu mina ? Mambu mbi wuntanganga muna e ?<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Niandi wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:27">—<char style="qt">Fueti zola Pfumu Nzambi aku mu ntimꞌaku wumvimba, mu muelꞌakuwumvimba, mu zingolo ziaku zioso, mu mayindu maku moso ayi fueti zolandiaku banga bobo weta kukizodila ngeyo veka.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:28">—Ngeyo vutudi bumboti, vanga buawu buna wela zinga.<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Vayi nlongi wu mina beni wuzola kukinungisa, wubuela yuvula Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:29">—A buna nani ndiama e ?<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Buna Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:30">—Kuba mutu wumosi wuba ku Yelusalemi wuba kuenda ku Yeliko ; wudengana mivi. Minziona bima biandi bioso ; minlueka miyenda kuawu ayi mimbika weka nduka fua. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Vayi nganga Nzambi yimosi yiviokila mu nzila beni, wumona mutu beni vayi wuzengisa ku ndambu yinkaka ayi wuyenda kuandi. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Bobuawu, wumosi mu dikanda di Levi wutula vana buangu beni, wumona mutu beni, wuzengisa ku ndambu yinkaka ayi wuyenda kuandi. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Vayi muisi Samali wumosi wuba viokila vana, wutula va ndambu vaba mutu beni. Bu kamona mutu, wummona kiadi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Wufikama va kaba, wutula mafuta ayi vinu mu zimputa ziandi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mafuta maba sadulungu mu diambu di dekula mianga bosi vinu mu diambu di vonda mikolobo ; vinu kidedikini banga mayoka.</char></note> ayi wuzizinga ziphasima. Bosi wuntula va yilu mpundꞌandi, wunnata ku nzo yi banzenza ayi kuna kansadisa bumboti. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Mu lumbu kilanda, wubonga denali biodi, wuvana biawu kuidi pfumu yi nzo yi banzenza ayi wunkamba : “Sadisa bumbote mutu wawu. Zimbongo zioso wela fukisa va yilu, minu veka ndiela kuvutudila ziawumu thangu ndiela vutuka.”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Buna Yesu wubuela diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:36">—Kuidi ngeyo, mu bawu batatu nani wumonikini ndiandi kuidi mutu wowo wuvangu phasi kuidi mivi e ?<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Buna nlongi wu mina beni wuvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">—Mutu wowo wummona kiadi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Buna Yesu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">—Yenda ayi vanga banga mutu wuna.<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maliya wusobula kuku kilutidi kitoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Buna bakidi mu nzila, Yesu wukota mu buala bumosi. Kunakuba nketo wumosi, dizina diandi Malite<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minsekudi minkaka misonika Malata va buangu ki Malite.</char></note>, wunyakula ku nzoꞌandi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Wuba ayi khombꞌandi yinketo, dizina diandi Maliya. Niandi wuyiza vuanda va malu ma Yesu ayi wuba lembu kawanga mambu matuba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Vayi Malite wukiyekula mu bisalu biwombo. Buna wufikama vaba Yesu ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:40">—A nlongi, disi kuvanga phasi ko mu mona ti khombꞌama wundiekudidi bisalu bioso e ? Nkambi kiza tsadisa.<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Vayi Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:41">—Malite, Malite, ngeyo weka mayindu ayi wulembo kukiyamisamu diambu di mambu mawombo ! <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Vayi diambu dimosi kaka dilutidi mfunu. Maliya niandi sobudi kukukimbote ayi balendi kunziona kiawu ko.<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Buevi bu sambidila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayi 6.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Bu kaba sambila va buangu kimso ; bu kamanisa, nlonguki andi wumosi wuyiza ayi wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:1">—A Pfumu, wutulongisa sambila banga Yowani bu kalongisila minlonguki miandi.<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Buna wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:2">—Mu thangu lunsambila, lutubanga :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Tata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Bika dizina diaku diba dinlongo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Bika Kipfumu kiaku kiza<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Wutuvana, kadika lumbu, bidia bioni bifueni<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Wutulemvukila masumu meto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">bila beto mamveto tueti lemvukila bobo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">bakutu vangilanga mambimbi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">ayi kadi kutubika tubua mu phukumunu.<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Buna wubuela diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:5">—Zimbukila mutu wumosi mu beno widi ayi nkundi andi, ayi wedi va khatitsika builu mu kunkamba : “A nkundi ama, ndevisa mapha matatu <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>bila nkundi ama wumosi meba mu nzietolo weka yama kuna nzo vayi ndisi ko kadi kima ki kunyakudila.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Vayi mutu wowo widi mu khati nzo maka mvutudila : “Bila kundiamisa, muelo wukangiminingi ayi bana bama ayi minu veka tukilekidingi ; diawu ndilendi kotuka ko mu diambu ndivana mawu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba, kadiambu ko kalendi kotuka ko mu diambu di kumvana mawu bila kadi nkundi andi vayi wela kotuka bila mutu wunawulembu nyamisa, buna wela kumvana bibioso, boso buididi mfunu andi.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">Matayi 7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>—Diawu ndikulukambila ti : lulomba ayi luela tambula ; lutomba ayi luela bakula ; lukokuta ayi luela zibudulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Bila woso wunlombanga niandi wuntambulanga ; woso wuntombanga niandi wumbakulanga ayi woso wunkokutanga niandi wunzibudulungu.<verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Nani mu beno, madise, lenda vana muanꞌandi nioka bu kanlombidi mbizi yi nlangu e<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minkanda minkaka mibuela : nani lenda vana ditadi kuidi muanꞌandi bu kanlombidi dimpa e ?</char></note> ? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Voti kumvana khutu niandi bu kanlombidi diki e ? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Buna enati beno batu bambimbi luzebi vana bana beno bima bimbotebuna dise dieno didi ku diyilu wela luta vana Mpeve yinlongo kuidi bobobakunlombanga yawu.<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi voti satana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayi 12.22-30</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Malako 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Buna wutotula mpeve yimbimbi yi dibaba. Mpeve yimbimbi bu yitotuka, dibaba dieka yoluka ayi nkangu wu batu wusimina. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Vayi ndambu yi batu mu bawu batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:15">—Keti mu lulendo lu Belezebuli, pfumu yi ziphevi zimbimbi, kalembo totudila ziphevi zimbimbi.<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Bankaka mu kumfiela banlomba dimbu kintotukila ku diyilu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Vayi kazaba mayindu mawu, buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:17">—Kipfumu kioso kivasukidi kiawu veka kifueti muangana ayi nzo yivasukidi yawu veka yifueti bua. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Enati satana vasukidi niandi veka, buna buevi kipfumu kiandikilenda zingila e ? Bila beno lulembo tubi ti mu lulendo lu Belezebuli ndilembo totudila ziphevi zimbimbi. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Enati bukiedika ti mu lulendo lu Belezebuli ndilembo totudila ziphevi zimbimbi, buna nani wuvana bana beno lulendo lutotudila ziawu e ? Diawu bela ba mazuzi meno.<verse eid="LUK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Vayi enati mu lulendo lu Nzambi ndilembu totudila ziphevi zimbimbibuna luzaba ti kipfumu ki Nzambi kieka vadi beno.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Mutu widi ngolu ayi widi binduanina bifuana bu kalembu sungi nzoꞌandi buna bima biandi bidi mu ndembama. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Vayi enati vatotukidi mutu wunlutidi ngolu ayi wunnungini buna ma kanziona binduanina biandi bioso bi kabedi tudilanga diana, ma kanziona bima biandi bioso ayi ma kakabula biawu.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>Woso kambulu ku ndambu ama buna mbeni ama, ayi woso wunkamba kupika yama buna niandi lembu sasikisa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayi 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>—Mu thangu mpeve yimbimbi yitotukidi mu mutu, buna yindiengilangamu bibuangu biyuma mu tomba luvundulu vayi enati yikadi baka buangu, buna yintubanga : “Bika ndivutuka mu nzoꞌama yoyi nditotukila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Bu yivutukidi buna yimbabanga nzoꞌandi yinkombulu ayi yikubulu bumboti. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Bosi yimvutukanga ayi yimbonganga tsambudi di ziphevi zinkaka, zimviatukidi nganzi. Bu zikotidi buna zinkalanga muna. Buna khadulu yi zimunina yi mutu wowo yilutidi biva ayi yina yithete.<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Muthangu kaba tuba bobo, nketo wumosi wuba muna nkangu wuyamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:27">—Khini kuidi nketo wubuta ayi wuyemika.<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Vayi Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:28">—Khini kuidi bobo beti wanga ayi beti tumukinanga mambu ma Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutemina batu ba tsungi yayi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayi 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Nkangu wu batu bu wukutakana, buna wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:29">—Tsungi yayi yidi tsungi yimbimbi yilembo tombi dimbu. Dimbu … Yilendi tambula dimbu dinkaka ko boyula kaka ko botula kakakioki ki Zonasi. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Bila banga bubela Zonasi dimbu kuidi basi Ninive, buawu bobo Muana Mutu kela bela dimbu kuidi batu ba tsungi yayi.<verse eid="LUK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Mu lumbu ki tsambusu, ntinu wu nketo wu Sude wela telama va kimosiayi batu ba tsungi yayi ayi wela bazengila nkanu. Bila niandi wubaku tsongi ntoto mu diambu di kuiza wa malongi ma diela ma Salomo. Muaki tala mutu widi vava viatukidi Salomo. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Mu lumbu ki tsambusu basi Ninive bela telama va kimosi ayi batu ba tsungi yayi ayi bela bazingila nkanu bila bawu babalula mavanga mawu bu bawa malongi ma Zonasi. Muaki vava vadi mutu wuviatukidi Zonasi.<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayi 5.15</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Malako 4.21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>Kuisi ko mutu bu kameni lemisa muinda, wuntulanga wawu va buangu kisuama voti ku tsi katini. Vayi wuntulanga wawu va yilu meza mu diambu babo bankota mu nzo bamona kiezila kiandi.<verse eid="LUK 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">Matayi 6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>—Meso maku mawu muinda mu nitu aku. Mu thangu meso maku madi mamboti buna nitu aku yimvimba yidi mu kiezila. Vayi enati madi mambimbibuna nitu aku yimvimba yidi mu tombi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Diawu lubuka mu diambu di kiezila kidi mu ngeyo kibika kituka tombi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Diawu enati nitu aku yimvimba yidi mu kiezila, mu kambu ndambu yi nitu mu tombi buna yela ba yikienzuka ngolo banga mu thangu muinda wukukienzulanga mu nlaki andi.<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutubidila Bafalisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:4-36">Matayi 23.4-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Bu kaba yoluka, Mfalisi wumosi wuntumisa mu dia ku nzoꞌandi. Bu kakota wuvuanda va meza. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Mfalisi bu kamona bobo, wusimina bila Yesu kasi kisukula ko tuamina kadia.<verse eid="LUK 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Buna Pfumu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:39">—Bena Bafalisi lunsukulanga bumboti va mbata yi kopo ayi yi dilonga vayi mu khati lufulukidi ayi mayindu ma buivi ayi mambimbi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Beno luidi bivulu ! Mutu wowo wuvanga va mbata kasia vanga ko mu khati e ? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Luvana bima biobi bidi yeno kuidi minsukami buna bosi bima bioso biela ba bivedila. <verse eid="LUK 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>Vayi mabienga kuidi beno Bafalisi bila lumvananga kuku ki kumi ki mintindu mioso mi biti ayi ki “meti ayi li”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Meti ayi li</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">biba bikunusu bifioti Bayuda baba kunanga. Biawu bibatotulangatsudi yi kitoko ayi biba sadulungu banga bilongo. Bikunusu beni bisia ba ko mu ntanda wu bima bifueti vanunungu kuku ki kumi bila bisia ba luvalu ko.</char></note> vayi lunlenzanabusongaayi luzolo lu Nzambi. Nganu mawu mama mambu lufueti vanganga ayi kadi zimbaka mana.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>Mabienga kuidi beno Bafalisi bila lunzolanga vuanda mu bibuangubinzitusu mu zinzo zi zikhutukunu ; lunzolanga baluvaninanga mbotimu bibuangu bi batu bawombo. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Mabienga kuidi beno ! Ludedikini banga mabumbi mankumbu monika ; batu balembu madiatidila mu kambu zaba.<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Vana vawu nlongi wumosi wu mina wuyuvula Yesu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:45">—Nlongi, bu wulembu tubi mambu momo buna beto kuandi wulembo fingi.<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Buna Yesu wumvutudila ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:46">—Mabienga ayi kuidi beno minlongi mi mina bila lueta kuika batu bizitu bidi zitu mu nata vayi beno veka kadi nlembo eno wumosi wusimbanga ko bizitu beni.<verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Mabienga kuidi beno bila lueta tunga mabumbi ma mimbikudi ayi bakulu beno baba vonda. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Lueta telimina mavanga ma bakulu beno kimbangi ayi lueti monangakhini. Bila bawu baba vonda vayi beno luntunganga mabumbi mawu.<verse eid="LUK 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Diawu nzayilu yi Nzambi yitubila ti : “Ndiela kuba fidisila mimbikudi ayi bamvuala, bela vondabankaka ayi bela yamisa bankaka.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Muingi menga ma mimbikudi mioso matengulu tona va vangimina ntoto mela tombulu va tsungi yayi <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>tona mu menga ma Abeli nate mu menga ma Zakali, mutu wowo bavondila va khatitsika diziku dinyokulungu makaba ayi nzo Nzambi. Bukiedika ndikulukamba mambu moso momo mela builu batu ba tsungi yayi.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>Mabienga kuidi beno minlongi mi Mina, beno luziona tsabi yinzayilu. Kadi sia ti beno veka lu kotanga ko vayi lunkandikanga bobo bazola kota.<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Bu kabotuka vana, minsoniki ayi Bafalisi batona kumfietikisaayi banzonzisa mu mambu mawombo ; <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>banlekila mintambu ; batomba diambu dilenda totukila mu munuꞌandi muingibabaka bila ki kumfundila.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Zaba teliminanga Yesu kimbangi.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Matayi 10.19-20</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:28-33">28-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Muna thangu yina, nkangu wu batu wuwombo-wombo wukutakana, babandiatasana bawu na bawu mu malu. Buna Yesu wutona kamba theti minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:1">—Lulubukila luvi lu Bafalisi. Mayuya mawu luawu luvi beni. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Bila kuisi ko diambu disuama diela kambu zabukusu voti kuisi ko matsueki mela kambu zabakana. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Diawu mambu moso luyolukila mu tombi mela wakakana ku kiezila ayi momo luyolukila va dikutu, mu bivinga, mela yamukusu ku mbata muangu. <verse eid="LUK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>Ndikulukamba, beno bakundi bama, lubika mona tsisi bobo balenda vonda nitu bila bawu vonga bobo balendi buela vanga diambu dinkaka ko. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Vayi ndieka kulumonisa bobo lufueti mona tsisi : Lutina mutu wowo beki lulendo lu lozila ku bulungi bu kameni vonda. Bukiedikandikulukamba, niandi mutu lufueti mona tsisi. <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Basumbisanga ko zitsiodila zitanu mu zimbongo zizole zi bisengo e ? Vayi Nzambi kasi zimbakana ko kadi yimosi mu zizioso. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Ayi zitsuki zi mintu mieno zidi zitangu. Lubika mona tsisibila lulutidi nkangu wu zitsiodila mu luvalu.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti woso mutu wela kuntelimina kimbangi vameso ma batu, muana mutu mamvandi wela kuntelimina kimbangi va meso ma zimbasi zi Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Vayi woso mutu wela kuthunuka va meso ma batu, mamvama ndielakuntunuka va meso ma zimbasi zi Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Woso mutu wela yolukila mambimbi mu diambu di Muana mutu wela lemvukulu vayi woso mutu wela finga Mpeve yinlongo kalendi lemvukulu ko.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>Mu thangu bela kulunata va ntuala zinzo zi lukutukunu, va ntualamazuzi ayi va ntuala bapfumu, lubika ba mayindu mu zaba buevi luelakukitabila ayi diambu mbi luela vutula ayi buevi lueta yolukila. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Bila Mpeve yinlongo wela kuluvana mambu momo luela tuba mu thangu yina kaka.<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Busina bu kiedika ayi bu luvunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Mutu wumosi wuba muna nkangu, wukamba Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:13">—A nlongi, khambila khombꞌama tukabana yandi kiuka.<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Vayi Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:14">—A Nkundi ama, nani wumbiekidi zuzi dieno voti nkabudi wu kiuka kieno e ?<verse eid="LUK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Bosi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:15">—Lulubuka luedi ba tsuina yi phila yina bila luzingu lu mutu luisi ko mu tezo ki bima biandi.<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Buna wuba kamba nongo yayi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:16">—Zitsola zi mutu wumosi wu busina zibutu ngolo. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Buna mutu beni wuyindula mu ntimꞌandi ti : “Mbi mfueti vanga ? Bila ndisi ko bibuangu biobi mfueti lundila mbongo ama ! <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Buna wukamba, tala diambu diodi ndieka vanga : Ndieka tiolumuna bilundulu biama ayi ndieka tunga bilutidi tola. Muawu ndiela lundila mbongoꞌama yoso ayi bima biama. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Buna ndiela kamba muelꞌama : A muelꞌama : bima biwombo bieka yaku mutezo ki mimvu miwombo. Vunda kuaku, dia, nua ayi mona khini.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Vayi Nzambi wunkamba : “vungisi ! Builu buabu kuandi maba lomba muelꞌaku ! Buna bima bioso biobi wukubikidi biela ba bi nani e ?” <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Buawu bobo buididi mutu wunyidikanga busina mu diambu di niandiveka ; vayi kasi sina ko mu mambu ma Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Yesu wukamba minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:22">—Diawu ndikulukambila ; lubika bela luzingu mayindu mu diambu di biobi luela dia ; lubika bela nitu mayindu mu diambu di biobi luela vuata. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Luzingu luviatukidi bidia ayi nitu yi vuatukidi minledi.<verse eid="LUK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Lutala zinuni ziozi beti tedilanga “minganga”, zikunanga ko ayi zitotanga bidia ko ; zisi ko kadi nzo voti lundulu vayi Nzambi wukuzidikila. Keti beno luvalu luidi viokila zinuni. <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Nani mu beno, mu diambu di mayindu mandi, lenda buela yika luzingu luandi ntela e ? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Enati luisi ko kadi lulendo mu mambu mama mafioti, buna bila mbi luididi mayindu mu diambu di momo mankaka e ? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Lutala biteka ; buevi bieti kudilanga, bisalanga ko, bitungangako vayi ndikulukamba, banza Salomo munkembo andi woso kasia vuata banga kiteka kimosi ko mu biteka biobi. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Enati Nzambi wuvuatisa kunusu kidi buabu ku tsola vayi mbazi ki lozolo ku mbazu. Buna buevi kela luta kuluvuatisila beno batu ba minu kifioti e ?<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Lubika banga mayindu mu diambu di tomba biobi luela dia ayi luela nua e ? Lubika kukiyamisa mu mambu momo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Bila Bapakanu ba ntoto bawu bantombanga mambu moso momo. Vayi Dise dieno zebi ti mfunu luvuidi bima biobi. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Vayi lutomba kipfumu kiandi buna bima bioso biobi bela kulubuedila biawu.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>Bika mona tsisi, ngeyo nkangu wu mameme ! Bila Dise dieno dimuenikhini mu kuluvana kipfumu.<verse eid="LUK 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayi 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>—Sumbisanu bima biobi bidi yenu ayi lukabudila minsukami. Bika lukikubikila ziphotomoni ziozi kazi fuanganga ko ayi lukikubikila kiuka, mu diyilu, kioki kakilendi suka ko, bila kuna muivi kalendi kukiyiba ko ayi zitselele zilendi bunga ko. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Bila koso kiudi kiuka kiaku kuna kuidi ntimꞌaku.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Banga wukubama bu weti vingila Pfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayi 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>—Luba bakubama mu kisalu ayi bika minda mienu milema. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Banu banga bisadi bimvingila pfumu awu mu yoso thangu bu kayendaku nyengo wu makuela, mu diambu bu kela vutuka ayi kela kokuta, bisadi biandi biela kunzibudila. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Khini kuidi bisadi biobi Pfumu awu bu kela vutuka, wela kuiza bata badi bakubama. Bukiedika ndikulukamba, niandi wela vuata minledi mi kisaluayi wela vuandisa bisadi biandi va meza wela fikama ayi wela kuba tudila bidia. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Kiza va midi mi phipa voti va nkielo wu buisi, wukuiza babati buna badi bakubama, buna khini kuidi bisadi bina.<verse eid="LUK 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Vayi luzaba kueno ti enati pfumu yi nzo zebi thangu mbi muivikankuizila, nganu wuleka nkielo ayi kasia tala ko bayiba nzo andi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Beno mamveno, banganu bakubama bila mu thangu yoyi lunkambubela mayindu yawu yinkuizila muana mutu.<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Piela wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:41">—A Pfumu, tubidi nongo yoyo mu diambu di beto kaka voti mu diambu di batu boso e ?<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Pfumu wuvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:42">—Buna nani kisadi kikuikama ayi ki diela kioki Pfumu kavana minsua mu yadila bisadi binkaka bi nzo andi mu kuba vananga kuku kiawuki ble mu thangu yifuana e ? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Khini kuidi kisadi kioki, pfumu andi bu kela vutuka, wela buanu wunsala, boso bu kantumina. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba pfumu andi wela kumvana minsua mu yadilabima biandi bioso.<verse eid="LUK 12:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Vayi enati kisadi beni yindudi mu ntimꞌandi ti : “Pfumu amakakadi vika vutuka” ayi tonini yamisa bisadi bi babakala ayi bi bakieto, tonini dia, nua ayi kolu, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>pfumu yi kisadi kina wela kuiza, mu lumbu kioki kela kambu bela mayindu ayi mu thangu yoyi kakambulu zaba. Buna pfumu andi wela kunloza ayi wela kumvana thumbudulu yi ngolo va kimosi ayi bakambulu bakuikama.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Kisadi kioki kizaba luzolo lu Pfumu andi vayi kasia kubama ko ayi kasia vanga ko boso buididi luzolo lu pfumu andi, wela zububikoti biwombo. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Vayi kisadi kioki kikambu zaba luzolo lu Pfumu andi ayi vengi mambu makalenda zubulu bikoti, wela zubu bikoti bifioti. Bila bela tomba biwombo kuidi mutu wowo bavana biwombo, ayi kuidimutu wowo bayekudila biwombo bela tombulu biwombo.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkabunu ayi tsambusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>—Mbazu ndiyizidi loza va ntoto ayi diambu mbi nzodidi enatimbazu beni yikikuikulu ? <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Vayi vadi mbotokolo yimfueti botama ayi ndikidi ku tsi mayindu nate yela vangama.<verse eid="LUK 12:50"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayi 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>—Beno lumbanzila ti minu ndembama ndineti vava ntoto e ? Nana vayi khabunu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Bila tona buabi, enati batu batanu badi mu nzo, bela ba bavasana : batatu bela ba ku ndambu yimosi bosi babuadi bela ba ku ndambu yinkaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Dise diela fuemina muana wubakala ayi muana wubakala welafuemina Dise. Ngudi wela fuemina muana wunketo ayi muana wunketo wela fuemina ngudi. Nzitu wunketo wela fuemina nketo wu muanꞌandi ayinketo wu muana wela fuemina nzitu andi wunketo.<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matayi 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Bosi Yesu wubuela kamba nkangu wu batu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:54">—Bu lueti monanga dituti ku ndambu wesite, buna lueti tuba : “mvula ma yinoka”, buna bobo bueta bela. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Bu lueti monanga phemo wu sude weka vevumuka, buna luetituba : “muini mawu ba wu ngolo” ; buna bobo bueta bela. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Bankua mayuya ! Luzebi bakula bidimbu bi ntoto ayi bi diyilubuna buevi lunkambu bakudilanga thangu yayi e ?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayi 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>—Bila mbi lunkambu sudikilanga, mu beno veka, mambu masonga e ? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Diawu bu lulembu yendi ku tilibinadu ayi mutu wowo wufundidibuna nuana mu dedikisa mambu beni bu lukidi mu nzila. Bila nganu wela ku funda kuidi zuzi ayi niandi wela kuyekula mu mioko mi masodi ayi mawu mela kukotisa mu nloko. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Muaki bukiedika ndikukamba wulendi totuka muna ko nate wela futazimbongo zioso zi tsuka.<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Pfumu widi mu balula khadulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Mu thangu yina ndambu yi batu bankaka baba vana, bankamba mambu momo mavioka momo matedi basi Ngalili bobo Pilatu kavondusu bu kasobikisamenga mawu ayi makaba mawu.<verse eid="LUK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:2">—Benu lumbanza ti basi Ngalili bobo bamueni ziphasi ziphila yoyo mu diambu babedi bankua masumu viokila basi Ngalili bankaka e ? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Buawu ko ndikulu kamba, vayi enati beno lukadi balula khadulubuna beno mamveno phila yimosi luela fuila.<verse eid="LUK 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Voti kumi dinana di batu bobo babuilu banga ki Silowe, bu kibavonda, beno lumbanza ti bawu baluta ba batu bambimbi viokilabatu bobo bamvuandanga ku Yelusalemi ? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Nana ndikilukamba, vayi enati lukadi balula khadulu buna beno mamveno phila yimosi luela fuila.<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Buna, wuba kamba nongo yayi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:6">—Mutu wumosi wuba ayi nti andi wu figi wukunu mu ndimꞌandiyi vinu. Wuyiza tomba muawu makundi vayi kasia baka ko. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Buna wukamba kisadi kiba nsalanga mu ndima beni : “Tala, wawu mvu wuntatu ndimeni tombila makundi ma figi mu nti wawu vayi kadidikundi ndibakanga ko. Kuanga kuandi wawu, bila mbi wulembu bungila kuandi buangu ki ntoto mu phamba e ?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Vayi kisadi beni kimvutudila : “A pfumu, bika wutadidila diaka wawu mvu wawu nate ndiela mana balula ntoto muyenda nti ayi ndiela mutula mbozi. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Mananga wela buta makundi mu mvu wunkuiza. Enati buawu ko buna wela kuanga wawu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa nketo mu lumbu ki saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Yesu bu kaba longa, mu lumbu ki saba, mu nzo yimosi yi lukutukunu, <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>tala, nketo wumosi wuba muna wuba ayi yimbimbi yi kimbevo mu tezo ki kumi dinana di mimvu. Nketo beni wuba wukomvama ; kadi baka bu luliminina. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesu bu kammona, buna wuntela ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:12">—A nketo, kululu mu kimvevo kiaku ! <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Buna wuntetika mioko ayi vana vawu wululama ayi wukembisa Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Vayi pfumu yi nzo yi lukutukunu wufuema mu diambu di Yesukabelusa nketo beni mu lumbu ki saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lumbu ki saba</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kiawu lumbu kilumingu kuidi Bayuda. Mina misia bavana ko minsua mu sala kioso kuandi kisalu mu lumbu kioki.</char></note> ; buna wubaluka kuidi nkangu ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:14">—Bilumbu bi kisalu bidi bisambanu ; luizanga mu belusu mu bilumbu bina vayi bika mu lumbu ki saba.<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Vayi Pfumu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:15">—Luidi bankua mayuya ! Kadika mutu mu beno kaniangunanga ko ngombi andi voti mpundꞌandi, mu dikulu mu lumbu ki saba ayi kuzinatangamu kuzi nuikina e ? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Ayi nketo wawu widi muana wu nketo wu Abalahami. Tala kumi dinana di mimvu dimeni vioka tona Satana kankangila, buna disi fuana ko mu ku nnianguna mu lumbu ki saba e ?<verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Bu kaba tuba mambu momo buna bambeni bandi zioso zifua tsonivayi nkangu woso wumona khini mu diambu di mambu momo ma nkembo momo mavangimina mu niandi.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zinongo zi dikundi di mutalide ayi yi luvi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Matayi 13.31-33</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Malako 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Buna Yesu wukamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:18">—Mu mbi mu dedikini kipfumu ki Nzambi ayi mu mbi ndenda ku kidedikisila e ? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Kidedikini banga dikundi di mutalide di loza mutu mu tsolꞌandi. Dikundi beni diyunduka, dikituka nti. Zinuni ziyiza tungila madianza mawu mu bitafi biandi.<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Buna wubuela diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:20">—Mu mbi ndenda dedikisila Kipfumu ki Nzambi e ? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Kidedikini banga luvi lubonga nketo, wusobikisa luawu mu bitezo bitatu bi falina nate yimana funa.<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukotila mu muelo wufioti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yesu wuviokila mu mavula ayi mu mala ; wulonga muawu bu kalandakana nzilꞌandi mu kuenda ku Yelusalemi.<verse eid="LUK 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matayi 7.13-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Buna mutu wumosiwunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">—A pfumu, bati buna batu bafioti kuandi bela vuka e ?<verse eid="LUK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>Buna wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:24">—Bika lunuana mu kotila mu luelo wufioti bila ndikulukambabawombo bela tomba mu kota vayi bela nunga ko.<verse eid="LUK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:10-12">Matayi 25.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>—Pfumu yi nzo bu kela telama ayi bu kela zibika muelo, enati ku nganda luela batakana, luela kokuta ayi luela leba : “A Pfumu, wutuzibudila”. Buna niandi wela ku luvutudila : “Ndisi zaba ko kuevi lubedi e ?”<verse eid="LUK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>—Buna luela tuba : “Keti beto tudia ayi tunua yaku va kimosi. Keti ngeyo wulonga mu zinzila zietu…”<verse eid="LUK 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Buna wela vutula : “Bukiedika ndikulukamba ndisi zaba ko kuevi lubedi. Luthatukila beno boso bisadi bi mambimbi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Kuna kuela ba bidilu ayi nkuetosolo wu meno mu thangu luela mona Abalahami, Isaki ayi Yakobi ayi mimbikudi mioso mu Kipfumu ki Nzambi, vayi, benu luela lozo ku nganda. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Batu bela ba ku Esite ayi ku Wesite, ku Node ayi ku Sude bela vuanda mu Kipfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Buna tala vadi batsuka bela ba batheti ayi batheti bela ba batsuka.<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wulandakana nzilꞌandi mu kuenda ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Mu lumbu kina, Bafalisi bayiza ayi bankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:31">—Katuka vava ayi yenda kuaku bila Elode tidi kuvonda.<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Vayi Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:32">—Yendanu lukamba mbaku wuna ti : “Tala ndilembo totula ziphevi zimbimbi ayi buabu ndilembu belusa bambevo. Vayi mbazi ayi lumbu kintatu mbanisini kuama. <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Vayi mfueti diata buabu mbazi ayi lumbu kina bila buisi fuana kombikudi kafuila ku nganda yi Yelusalemi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayi 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>—A Yelusalemi ! A Yelusalemi, divula dimvondanga mimbikudi ayi minlozilanga matadi bobo bakufidisilanga. Zikhumbu zikua ndizola kutikisilabana baku banga tsusu bu kankutikisilanga bana bandi ku tsi mavavi mandi vayi lumanga kuenu ! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Vayi tala beka kuluyekudila nzo eno. Ndikulukamba ti lulendi buela kumbona ko nate luela tuba : Bika kasakumunu mutu wowo wunkuizila mu dizina di Pfumu.<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa diaka mbevo mu lumbu ki saba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Lumbu kimosi ki saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Matayi 13.14</char></note>, Yesu bu kakota mu dia ku nzo yi pfumuyimosi yi Bafalisi, buna bobo baba muna baba kuntala bumboti. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Tala mutu wumosi wuba kimbevo kimvimbu wuba va ntualꞌandi. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Buna Yesu wuyuvula minlongi mi Mina ayi Bafalisi ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:3">—Minsua midi mu belusa mutu mu lumbu ki saba e ?<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Baba kuawu dio sui.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:4">Buna Yesu wusimba mutu beni, wumbelusa ayi wumvutula. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Bosi wukamba batu baba vana :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:5">—Nani mu beno wuidi muanꞌandi voti ngombiꞌandi vayi zimbukila yidodukidi mu dibulu, wunkambu vika ku yitapula mu lumbu ki saba e ?<verse eid="LUK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Basia vutula kadi diambu ko mu mambu momo.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zabanga ku kikulula ayi zabanga kaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Muaki wukamba nongo yimosi mu diambu di bobo batumusubu kamona buevi baba sobudilanga bibuangu binzitusu ; ayi wuba kamba :<verse eid="LUK 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>—Mu thangu bela kutumisa ku nyengo wu makuela buna bika kuenda vuanda va meza va buangu ki nzitusu, ayi zimbukila mutu wumosiwulutidi minsua wutumusu kuidi mutu wowo wutumisa <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>bila buna mutu wowo wulutumisa ngeyo ayi niandi wela kuiza ayi kukamba : “vana buangu kiaku kuidi mutu wawu”. Buna wela monazitsoni kuenda vuanda ku buangu kitsuka. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Vayi bu bela kutumisa yenda ayi vuanda ku buangu kitsuka mu diambu mutu wowo wulutumisini bu kela kuiza wela ku kamba : “A nkundi ama, yiza vuandi vava”. Buna wela zitisu va ntuala batu bosobela ba yaku va meza.<verse eid="LUK 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Bila woso wukukinangikanga wela kululu ayi woso wukukikululanga wela nanguku.<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Buna wukamba mutu wowo wuntumisa :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:12">—Ngeyo tumisa batu mu dia va muini voti va masika kadi tumisa bakundi baku, bakhomba ziaku, bambuta ziaku voti bamvuama bafikimini yakutala mamvawu babika kutumisa muingi bavutudila mambu momo wuba vangila. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Vayi mu thangu wumvangisa nyengo, bufueni wutumisa minsukami, babela binama, bantiudikanga, baphofo. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Ngeyo wela ba mu khini bila batu bobo basi ko kadi kiasa mu diambu bavutudila mambu momo wuba vangila. Buna Nzambi wela kumfuta mu lumbu kioki basonga bela fuluka.<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi nyengo wu dikuela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayi 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Buna mutu wumosi mu bobo baba va meza, bu kawa mambu momowukamba Yesu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:15">—Khini kuidi mutu wowo wela dia mu Kipfumu ki Nzambi !<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:16">—Mutu wumosi wuvangisa nyengo wunneni, wutumisa batu bawombo. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Thangu yi dia bu yifuana, wufidisa kisadi kiandi mu diambu kakamba batu batumusu ti “yizanu bila mamo makubinini.”<verse eid="LUK 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Vayi babo balomba nlemvo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:18">Wutheti wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:18">“Tsola ndisumbidi ayi mfueti kaka kuenda kuyitala, diawu ndemvukila.”<verse eid="LUK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Wunkaka wukamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:19">“Dikundi di zingombi ndisumbidi, ziawu ndieka kuenda makisa, diawu wundemvukila.”<verse eid="LUK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Wunkaka wukamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:20">“Bosi kuandi ndikuedidi, diawu ndilendi baka bu kuizila ko.”<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Kisadi beni bu kivutuka, kiyiza kamba Pfumu andi mambu moso mama. Buna pfumu yi nzo beni wufuema ayi wukamba kisadi kiandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:21">“Yenda nsualu mu zinzila ayi mu bina bi zinzila zi divula ayi tuala vava : minsukami, babela binama, baphofo ayi bantiudikanga…”<verse eid="LUK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Buna kisadi beni kiyiza kunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:22">“A pfumu matuminingi mavangimini vayi bibuangu bikidi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Buna pfumu andi wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:23">“Yenda mu zinzila, mu yenda ziphangu kuika batu biza koti mu diambu di nzoꞌama yifuluka. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Bila bukiedika ndikulukamba kadi mutu wumosi mu bobo batumusu kalendi dia ko.”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukiyekula mu bukiedika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Nkangu wu batu wuba wuwombo wuba kuenda nlandakananga. Buna Yesu wubaluka kuidi nkangu ayi wuba kamba :<verse eid="LUK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>—Enati mutu wizidi kuidi minu ayi enati kakadi lenda siandi, nguandi, nketuꞌandi, bana bandi, bakhomba bandi zi babakala ayi bakhomba bandi zi baketo, nkutu ayi luzingu luandi veka buna kkalendi banlonguki ama ko. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Woso wunkambu nata dikulusi diandi ayi wunkambu kundandakana, kalendi ba nlonguki ama ko. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Bila nani buna luidi bu katidi tungisa nzo yi banga wunkambu tuama vuandanga mu yindula thalu yela fua mu nzo beni mu diambu di zaba kani lenda manisa kisalu beni. <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Bila enati kakadi nunga mu manisa thungulu andi bu kamanisini tula zifundasio buna batu boso bobo bela kummona, bela kunsekinina <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>bu bela tuba : “mutu wawu wutona tungisa nzo vayi kasia nunga ko manisa yawu”.<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Voti ntinu mbi wowo tidi nuanisa ntinu wunkanka mvita wunkambu tuama vuandanga mu yindula kani mu dikumi mili di masodi buna lenda nungamu nuanisa mutu wowo wunkuiza kuidi niandi ayi makumuadi ma mili e ? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Enati buawu ko buna bu kakidi thama buna makafidisa mvualakuidi ntinu wunkaka ayi kunyuvula mambu mafueni mu kotisa ndembama.<verse eid="LUK 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Diawu woso kuandi buna luidi wunkambu yekula bima bioso bidi yandi buna kalendi ba nlonguki ama ko.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Malako 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>—Tsalu kidi kima kimboti vayi enati yizimbisidi lueki luandi bunabuevi balenda vutudila lueki beni e ? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Yisiedi kadi mfunu ko kani mu ntoto voti mu mbozi, yifueti kaka lozu ku nganda. Woso widi matu mawila buna bika kawa.<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Zinongo zitatu zi kiadi ki Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Mimfutisi mi ziphaku ayi bankua masumu bayiza kutakana vaba Yesu, muingi banwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Bafalisi ayi minlongi mi mina baniunguta ayi batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:2">—Mutu wawu wunyakula bankua masumu ayi wundia yawu va kimosi !<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi dimeme dizimbala ayi dimonika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayi 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Buna Yesu wuba kamba nongo yayi :<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>—Nani mutu mu beno buna luidi vuidi khama yimosi yi mameme vayi zimbukila zimbisidi dimeme dimosi, wunkambu sia yekula luvua ayi vua lu mameme mankaka muingi kenda tombi diodi dizimbala, nate kela dimona e ?<verse eid="LUK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Bu kadi bakudi, buna mu khini kela kuditudila va mavangiti mandi. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Niandi tula ku nzoꞌandi, buna wela tumisa bakundi bandi ayi bobo bafikimini yandi ayi wuba bakamba : “bila lumona yama khini va kimosi bila ndimueni dimeme diama dizimbala.”<verse eid="LUK 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Ndikulukamba ti khini yela ba mu Diyilu mu diambu di nkua masumuwumosi bu kabaludi mavanga mandi yela viokakana ayi yoyi yidi mu tala luvua ayi vua lu basonga bakambulu kuawu mfunu wu balula mavanga mawu.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi sengo kizimbala ayi kimonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>—Voti nketo mbi wowo vuidi dikumi di zimbongo zi bisengo vayi zimbisidi sengo kimosi, wunkambu lemisanga muinda ayi wunkambu kombulanga nzo ayi wunkambu tombanga bumboti sengo kiandi nate kammonakiawu e ? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Bu kamueni kiawu, buna wela kutikisa bakundi bandi ayi bobo bafikimini yandi ayi wela bakamba : “bika lumona yama khini va kimosibila ndimueni sengo kiama ki zimbongo kioki kizimbala.” <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Bobuawu ndikulukamba ti khini yiwombo yidi kuidi zimbasi zi Nzambi nkua masumu wumosi bu kabaludi mavanga mandi.<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi muana wuzimbala ayi wumonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Buna wubuela tuba diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:11">—Vaba mutu wumosi wuba ayi bana buadi bababakala. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Nleki wunkamba dise diandi : “a tata, bika wuphana ndambu ki kiuka kiama !” Buna dise diba kabudila kiuka kiandi.<verse eid="LUK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Ndambu yi bilumbu bu bivioka, nleki wutota bima biandi ayi wuyenda mu tsi yi thama. Kuna kamana fukisila bima biandi bioso mu luzingu lu divunzi. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Bu kamana fukisa bibio, buna kanda kingolo ki nzala ki yiza bua mu tsi beni ayi wutona mona nzala.<verse eid="LUK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Buna wuyenda sonama mu kisalu kuidi pfumu yimosi yi tsiyina. Buna pfumu beni wumfidisa ku zitsola ziandi mu diambu kenda sunganga zingulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Buna wuzola kuandi wesa dikutu diandi mu dianga bidia bi zingulu vayi kadi mutu kasia kumvana biawu ko.<verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Buna wutona yindula mu tsi andi ntima : “bisadi bioso bi dise diama bindianga boso buididi luzolo luawu vayi minu kuaku ndilembu fua nzala ! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Ndieka telama, ndieka kuenda kuidi dise diama ayi ndielakunkamba : Tatꞌama, ndivodidi masumu kuidi Nzambi ayi kuidi ngeyo. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Ndisi fuana diaka ko bathedila muanꞌaku vayi bika wuthangila banga kisadi kiaku.”<verse eid="LUK 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Buna wutelama ayi wuyenda kuidi siandi. Buna wukidi thamasiandi wummona ayi kiadi kingolo kimbuila. Buna wuyenda dengana nsualumuanꞌandi, wumbumbakana ayi wumfifa bibesi.<verse eid="LUK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Buna muana wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:21">“Tata ndivodidi masumu kuidi diyilu ayi kuidi ngeyo, ndisi fuanadiaka ko bathedila muanꞌaku.” <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Vayi dise dikamba bisadi biandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:22">“Lusia nsualu, lutuala kikhutu kilutidi kitoko ayi lumvuatisakiawu ; lumvuatisa pheti mu nlembo ayi lumvuatisa zisapatu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Bika lutuala muana wungombi wu mafuta ayi luvonda wawu. Tudianu ayi tuvangisa nyengo ; <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>bila muanꞌama wawu wubedi wufua vayi wufulukidi ; wubedi wuzimbala ayiwumonikini.” Buna batona nyengo mu khini.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>Mu thangu yina, muanꞌandi wu nkulutu wuba sala ku tsola. Bu kaba vutuka ayi bu kafikama ayi nzo wuwa miziki ayi makinu. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Buna wutumisa kisadi kimosi ayi wunyuvula keni mambu mbi malembu vioki kuna. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Kisadi beni kimvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:27">“Keti khimbꞌaku niandi vutukidi. Dise diaku divondisidi muana ngombi wu mafuta bila wummueni wumvimba ayi wukambu kimbevo.”<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Buna nkulutu wufuema ayi wumanga kota. Siandi wutotuka ayi wunleba.<verse eid="LUK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Vayi niandi wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:29">“Tala, mimvu miwombo ndimeni kusadila vayi kadi khumbu yimosi ndisia tinguna ko zithumunu ziaku, ayi kadi khumbu yimosi wusia kuphana ko muana khombo muingi ndimona khini va kimosi ayi bakundi bama. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Vayi muanꞌaku, mutu wowo wumana sikisa kiuka kiaku va kimosi ayi bandumba zi leta bu kizidi, buna vondisidi muana ngombi wu mafuta mu diambu diandi.”<verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Siandi wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:31">“A muanꞌama, ngeyo zithangu zioso widi yama va kimosi mu ayi bima biosobiobi phuidi ngeyo vuidi biawu. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Vayi mboti mu vangisa nyengo ayi mona khini bila khombꞌaku yayiwubedi wufua ayi wufulukidi, wubedi wuzimbala ayi monikini.”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi ayi zimbongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesu wukamba minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:1">—Mutu wumosi wuba busina buwombo, wuba ayi dikalaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dikalaka</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dedikini banga mutu wowo bayekudila kimvuama kuidi pfumu yimosi mu diambu kakebanga kiawu.</char></note> diandi, vayi batu bayiza funda dikalaka diandi ti niandi wufukisidi busina buandi. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Buna pfumu andi bu kantumisa buna wunyuvula : “mambu mbi momondilembu wanga mu diambu diaku e ? Vumbula kipholo mu zaba bueviwukebidi kisalu kiaku bila wulendi buela ba nkebi wu bima biama ko.”<verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Buna nkebi wu bima wuyindula mu ntimꞌandi : “diambu mbi ndiekavanga e ? Bila buabu pfumu ama weka kumbotula, ndilendi buela kebangabima biandi ko. Ndilendi salanga ntoto ko bila ndisi ko ngolo ; tsoni mu kuenda lombanga. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Buabu mbakudi diambu mbi ndieka vanga muingi batu baba kundiakulanga mu zinzo ziawu bu bela kumbotula mu kisalu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Vana vawu wutumisa batu boso baba zipholo kuidi pfumu andi. Wuyuvula wutheti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:5">“Kikua fueti futa pfumu ama e ?”<verse eid="LUK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Mutu beni wumvutudila ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">“Makumuandi ma mangungulu ma mafuta.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">Nkebi beni wunkamba : “tamla nkanda wowo wusonika, wawu vuanda vovo, tula nsuala ayi sonikati dikumi di mangungulu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Bosi wukamba wunkaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Ngeyo kikua fueti futa e ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">Niandi wumfutudila ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Zikhama zitanu zi zitsaku zi ble<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ble</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mpila kunusu kinsadulungu falina ; kidi banga masangu.</char></note>.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">Buna nkebi beni wunkamba mutu beni ti : “bonga nkanda wowo wusonika ayi sonika zikhama ziya.”<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Buna pfumu beni wuniemisa nkebi wowo wukambu kiedika mu philadiela diandi di kasadila. Bila, mu mambu mawu veka, batu ba thanguyayi balutidi bana ba kiezila mu diela.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Ayi minu ndikulukamba ti mboti lusadila kimvuama ki ntoto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kimvuama ki ntoto</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kinsundula kimvuama kikambulu kisonga.</char></note> muingi lubaka bakundi mu diambu dieno veka muingi mu thangu kiela manababa kuluyakula mu zinzo zi mvu ka mvu. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Woso mutu widi wukuikama mu bima bifioti buna widi diaka wukuikama mu bima biwombo. Ayi woso kambulu wukuikama mu bima bifioti kalendi ba wukuikama ko mu bima binneni. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Enati lusi ko bakuikama mu kimvuama kikambulu kisonga buna nani wela kuluyekudila kimvuama kikiedika e ? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Enati luisi ko bakuikama mu bima bingana buna nani wela kuluvana bima bieno veka e ?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:24">Matayi 6.24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>—Kuisi ko kisadi kilenda sadila bapfumu buadi. Bila bukiedika wela lenda pfumu yimosi ayi wela zola pfumu yinkaka. Voti wela kiyekulakuidi pfumu yitheti ayi wela lenza pfumu yinkaka. Lulendi sadila Nzambi ayi zimbongo va kimosi ko.<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Buna bamana wa mambu momo, Bafalisi babazolanga zimbongo basekinina Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Vayi niandi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:15">—Benu luidi batu beta zola kukimonikisa basonga va meso ma batu vayi Nzambi zebi mintima mieno. Bila mambu momo mammonika ma mfunuva meso ma batu madi mambu maphamba va meso ma Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mina ayi Kipfumu ki Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matayi 11.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>—Tsungi yi Mina ayi yi mimbikudi yiba nate mu thangu yi Yowani. Tona thangu yina Nsamu Wumbote wu Kipfumu ki Nzambi wulembu samunu ayi kadika mutu wulembo sadilanga zingolo ziandi mu kota muawu.<verse eid="LUK 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Muaki kadi kuandi phasi diyilu ayi ntoto mu vioka vayi kadi sonu kimosi ki Mina kilendi botulu ko.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:32">Matayi 5.32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>—Woso wumbotula nketo andi ayi kuedidi nketo wunkaka vengi kitsuza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minsekudi minkaka misonika ti “Vodidi kimpinga” va buangi ki vengi kitsuza.</char></note> ayi woso wunkuela nketo wubotalo kuidi bakala diandi vengi kitsuza.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkua kimvuama ayi Lazale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>—Kuba mutu wumosi wu kimvuama, wuba vuatanga minledi mintalu ayi mimboti. Kadika lumbu, luzingu luandi luba lu minyengo. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Nsukami wumosi, dizina diandi Lazale wuba lekanga vana muelonzo yi nkua kimvuama. Nitu andi yoso yiba ziphuta-ziphuta. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Wuba mayindu ma yukutanga mu bitsiadisila biobi biba dodukanga mu thangu mutu wu busina kaba dianga va meza. Vayi zimbua ziba kuiza vendanga ziphuta ziandi.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Vayi nsukami wuyiza fua ayi zimbasi zinnata nate vana ndambu Abalahami. Mutu wu kimvuama, mamvandi, wufua ayi wuziku. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Kuna tsi yi bafua, wumona ziphasi ziwombo, wuvumbula meso ayi wumona kuna thama Lazale buna kadi va ndambu yi Abalahami.<verse eid="LUK 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Buna wuyamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:24">“A tata Abalahami, bika wumbona kiadi ! Tuma Lazale kabuika tsongi yi nlembo andi mu nlangu muingi kandakisila dibeti mu ludimi luama bila phasi ndilembu moni mu diambu di minlaki mi mbazu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Vayi Abalahami wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:25">“A muanꞌama, bika wutebuka moyo ti ngeyo wutambula bima biaku mu thangu yi luzingu luaku vayi Lazale wutambula mabienga. Vayi buabu niandi wulembo bombo kuaku vayi ngeyo wulembo yamusu. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Ayi botula mambu momo, diyenga dinneni didi va khatitsika beto ayi beno mu diambu di bobo badi kuaku batidi kuiza kuidi beno babika bakadiluaku dikuizila koko luidi ayi mu diambu di bobo badi koko luidi batidi kuiza kuaku babika baka diluaku dikuizila kuaku tuidi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Buna mutu wu busina wubuela tuba diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:27">—A tata, lemvuka ! Tuma Lazale ku nzo yi siama <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>bila zikhombo zitanu zidi yama mu diambu di kabalubula muingi mamvawu babika kuiza ku buangu kiaki ki kiphasi.<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Vayi Abalahami wumvutudila : “Moyize ayi mimbikudi badi yawu bika baba wilukila”.<verse eid="LUK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Buna nkua busina wubuela tuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:30">“Nana, buawu ko bobo Tata Abalahami. Bila enati mutu fulukidi mu tsi yi bafua ayi wedi kuidi bawu buna bela balula mavanga mawu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Vayi Abalahami wubuela vutula ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:31">“Enati bakadi wila Moyize ayi mimbikudi buna balendi wila ko mutuwufua ka diambu ko wufuluka.”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Khadulu va khatitsika zikhombo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayi 18.6-7</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Malako 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesu wukamba minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:1">—Ziphukumunu zilendi kambu ko vayi mabienga kuidi woso wuntotukidilanga ziawu. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Bulutidi mboti bankanga ditadi diodi bannikinanga makundi mu tsingu, ku nloza mu mbu ayi mu diambu kabika vodisa, wumosi mu banababa, masumu. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Diawu lulubuka !</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 17:3">(<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">Matayi 18.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">—Enati khombꞌaku vodidi masumu, buna bika wuntubidila. Ayi enati baludimavanga buna bika wunlemvukila. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Ayi buba kuandi ti tsambudi di zikhumbu kavodidi masumu kuidi ngeyo mu lumbu kimosi, ayi tsambudi di zikhumbu kiza tubila ti : “mbaludi khadulu”. Buna bika wunlemvukila.<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minu kidi banga ki dikundi di mutalide</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:20">Matayi 17.20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Mimvuala mikamba Pfumu Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:5">—Wutubuela minu.<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Buna Pfumu Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:6">—Bukiedika ti minu kieno, ka diambu ko kidi banga buididi dikundi di mutalide<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dikundi di mutalide</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">diawu dikundi dilutidi keva mu makundi moso. Tala <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Matayi 17.20</ref></char>.</char></note>, nganu lulenda tumina nti wuna ti : “Vuzuka ayi yenda kikuni mu mbu” buna muna yina thangu wufueti kulutumukina.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisadi bikambulu mfunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>—Nani buna luidi widi ayi kisadi kiandi kinkunanga voti kinsunganga bibulu, kikunkambanga bu kabedi ku zitsola ti : “yiza nsualu ayi vuanda nsualu va meza ?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Keti kafueti kunkamba theti ti : “ndambila bidia, vuata minledi mi kisalu ayi thudila bidia va meza nate ndimanisa dia ayi nua ; bosi ngeyo mamvaku wudia ayi wunua ?” <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>A Buevi pfumu kavueti vutudila kisadi kiandi matondo mu diambu kavengi bumboti momo katumunu e ? Nana ! <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Buawu bobo kuidi beno mamveno. Bu luela mana vanga momo lutumunu buna bika luba tuba : “tuidi kaka bisadi bikambulu mfunu, tuvengi kaka momo tutumunu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa dikumi di batu baba buazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Buna wulembo yendi ku Yelusalemi, Yesu wuviokila ku Samali ayi Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Buna weka va difula di buala bumosi, kuna dikumi di batu babelabuazi bandengana. Thama batelimina <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>ayi bayamikina mu mbembo yingolo ayi batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:13">—A Pfumu Yesu, bika wutumona kiadi !<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Yesu bu kaba mona, buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">—Yendanu lukimonikisa kuidi banganga Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Mu thangu baba kuenda mu nzila, bazimbukila batumbulu vedila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">batumbulu vedila</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">voti babelukidi kuawu.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Wumosi mu bawu bu kamona ti belukidi, wuvutuka, wukembisa Nzambi mu ndinga yingolo. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Wufukama va malu ma Yesu, wuyinika zizi kiandi va tsi ayi wumvutudila matondo. Vayi mutu beni wuba muisi Samali.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Buna Yesu wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:17">—Keti dikumi divedusulungu e ? A kuevi kuidi divua dinkaka ? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Buna kadi mutu kasi yindula ko mu vutuka ayi vutudila Nzambi matondo botula kaka nzenza yayi e ?<verse eid="LUK 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Buna Yesu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:19">—Telama ayi yenda kuaku ; minu kiaku kibelusidi.<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buevi buela kuizila Kipfumu ki Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Bafalisi bayuvula Yesu mu diambu di zaba kani lumbu mbi kiela kuiza Kipfumu ki Nzambi. Niandi wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:20">—Kipfumu ki Nzambi bu kiela kuiza kilendi monu mu meso ko. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Ayi balendi tuba ko : “Tala, kidi kuaku” voti “tala kidi kuna” bila luzaba mboti ti Kipfumu ki Nzambi kidi va khatitsikꞌeno.<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Bosi wukamba minlonguki :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:22">—Bilumbu biela kuiza biobi luela bela tsatu yi mona, banza lumbu kimosi ki muana mutu vayi lulendi kimona ko.<verse eid="LUK 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayi 24.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>—Buna bela kulukamba : “Tala Klisto widi kuaku” voti “tala widikuna”. Buna kadi ba kuenda ayi kadi ku balandakana. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Bila banga lusiemo lueta totukila mu diyilu ayi lueta kienzudila tona tsongi yimosi nate tsongi yinkaka yi diyilu, buna buawu bobo buela bela muana mutu mu lumbu kiandi. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Vayi kafueti tuama mona ziphasi ziwombo ayi kafueti tuama lozu kuidi batu ba tsungi yayi.<verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">Matayi 24.37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>—Mambu momo maba mu thangu yi Nowa mawu mela buela ba mu bilumbu bi Muana Mutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Bila batu badia, banua, bakuelana, bakuedisa nate mu lumbu kioki Nowa kakota mu masuwa. Buna bosi nkuka yi nlangu yiyiza, ayi yimana ku babunga. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Banga kuandi bubela mu bilumbu bi Loti : batu badia, banua, basumba, basumbisa, bakuna batungisa. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Vayi mvula yi mbazu ayi yi sufele yinoka ayi yimana ku babungamu lumbu kioki Loti katotuka mu Sodoma. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Buawu bobo buela bela mu lumbu kioki Muana mutu kela monika. <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>Mu lumbu kina, enati mutu widi ku yilu muanzu vayi widi ayi bima biandi mu nzo buna kabika kuluka muingi kenda bongi biawu ; bobuawu woso wela batakana ku zitsola kabika buela vutuka ku nzo andi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Bika lutebukila nketo wu Loti moyo. <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Woso wela tomba vukisa luzingu luandi, wela luzimbisa vayi wosowela luzimbisa wela luvukisa.<verse eid="LUK 17:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba, muna builu buna, batu buadi bela lekamfulu yimosi, wumosi mu bawu wela botulu vayi wunkaka wela siala. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Baketo buadi bela tuta mfufu va kimosi, wumosi mu bawu wela botulu vayi wunkaka wela siala. [<verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Babakala buadi bela ba ku zitsola, wumosi mu bawu wela botuluvayi wunkaka wela siala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buku voti nzila yayi yikambulu mu minkanda minkaka. Tala mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:40">Matayi 24.40</ref></char>.</char></note>.]<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Buna minlonguki minyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">—A Pfumu, kuevi kuela viokila mambu momo e ? Niandi wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">—Koso kuidi mvumbi, kuawu kuidi bibala.<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Lusambila mu kambu vonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Yesu wukamba minlonguki miandi nongo yayi mu diambu di kuba sudikisa ti bafueti sambilanga mu zithangu zioso mu kambu vonga.<verse eid="LUK 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>—Kuba zuzi dimosi diba mu divula dimosi, zuzi beni kaba monanga Nzambi tsisi ko ayi kaba kinzikanga ko kadi mutu wumosi. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Mu divula beni muba diaka difuola dimosi. Difuola beni diba kuizanga kuidi niandi ayi diba kunkambanga : “Bika wundungisa va ntuala mbeni ama”. <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Thangu yiwombo zuzi beni kasia zola ko. Vayi niandi wukamba mu ntimꞌandi ti : “ka diambu ko ndimonanga Nzambi tsisi ayi ndikinzikanga batu ko, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>vayi difuola diandi dilembu thatisa buna ndieka kunnungisa muingi kabika buela kuiza ku thatisanga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Buna Pfumu wela tuba diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:6">—Lunwa bumboti mambu matuba zuzi diodi di mbimbi. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Buna lumbanza ti Nzambi kalendi nungisa ko batu bandi bobo kasobula ayi bobo baku nsambilanga builu ayi muini ? Beno lumbanzila ti niandi wela zingila mu kuba sadisa e ? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba, mu nsualu kela kuba nungisa. Vayi muana mutubu kela kuiza, buna wela kuiza bata kuandi batu badi minu va ntoto e ?<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi Mfalisi ayi mfutisi wu ziphaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Wubuela tuba diaka nongo yayi mu diambu di batu bobobakukimonanga ti badi batu basonga vayi banlenzanga bankaka.<verse eid="LUK 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>—Babakala buadi bayenda ku nzo Nzambi mu diambu di sambila. Mfalisi wumosi ayi mfutisi wu ziphaku wumosi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Mfalisi wutelama va lutengo ayi wusambila lusambulu lualu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:11">“A Nzambi, ndikuvutudila matondo bu khambulu dedakana bangabatu bankaka, bobo banzionanga bima bingana, bobo bakambulu basonga, bobo bavanganga kitsuza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Luka 16.18</char></note> voti bobo badi kuandi banga mfutisi wu ziphaku wowo. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Minu mu kadika sabala bilumbu biodi ndieta kukifuisila nzala mu diambu di lusambulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minsekudi minkaka misonika “mina nsoki” va buangu ki kukifuisa nzala mu diambu di lusambulu.</char></note> ayi ndieta vana kuku ki kumi mu bima bioso biobi bidi yama.”<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Mfutisi wu ziphaku thama kayenda telimina ayi kasia zolavumbula meso mandi ku diyilu ko. Vayi thulu andi yawu kaba bundanga bu katuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:13">“A Nzambi, bika wumbona kiadi bila ndidi nkua masumu !”<verse eid="LUK 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba, mfutisi wu ziphaku wowo sumbu kavutuka ku nzo andi, wumonika wusonga va meso ma Nzambi vayi bika mutu wowo wunkaka bila woso wukukikululanga wela nanguku ayi woso wukukinangikanga wela kululu.<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutambula bana bafioti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayi 19.13-15</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Malako 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Bannatisa bana bafioti muingi kaba simba vayi minlonguki bu mimonabobo mitubidila batu bobo babanata. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Yesu wuba tumisa ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:16">—Bika bana bafioti biza kuidi minu ayi kadi kuba kandika bila kipfumu ki Nzambi kivuiwulu kuidi batu badi banga bobo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti woso wunkambu tambula Kipfumu ki Nzambi banga muana wu fioti kalendi mu kota ko.<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bambuama ayi kipfumu ki Diyilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayi 19.16-30</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Malako 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Buna pfumu yimosi yinyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:18">—A nlongi wumboti, diambu mbi mvanga muingi ndibaka luzingu lukalumani e ?<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Buna Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:19">—Bila mbi wukuthedila wumboti ? Kuisi ko mutu wumboti botula kaka, Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Keti zebi zithumunu : <char style="qt">Kadi vanga kitsuza, kadi vonda, kadi yiba, kadi telama kimbangi ki luvunu, kinzika siaku ayi ngudi aku.</char><verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Buna niandi wuvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:21">—Ndinkebanga mambu moso momo tona bumuana buama.<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesu bu kawa bobo, buna wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:22">—Diambu dimosi dinkamba kuidi ngeyo : Yenda sumbisa bima bioso biobi bidi yaku ayi kabudila minsukami bioso wumbaka buna wela bakakiuka ku diyilu. Buna bosi wiza ayi wundandakana.<verse eid="LUK 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Bu kawa bobo, kiadi kingolo kimbuila bila kimvuama kiwombo kiba yandi.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesu bu kamona ti mutu beni weka kiadi-kiadi buna wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:24">—Didi diambu di phasi kuidi batu badi kimvuama mu kota mu kipfumu ki Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Bila kadi kuandi phasi kuidi kamela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kamela</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mpila bulu kidi banga phunda ; kikubuku mu natanga bizitu mu dikanga ayi nlangu wuwombo kieti nua.</char></note> mu viokila va divudu di tsoma vayi phasi kuidi nkua kimvuama mu kota mu kipfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Buna batu bobo bawa bobo, batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:26">—Buna nani wulenda vuka e ?<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:27">—Mambu momo batu beti lembakana, Nzambi lenda ku mavanga.<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Buna Piela wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:28">—Tata, tumana yekula bibioso ayi tulandakana.<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:29">—Bukiedika ndikulukamba, kuisi ko mutu wusia bika mu diambu di Kipfumu ki Nzambi, nzo andi, bambuta bandi bakhomba bandi, nketo andi voti bana bandi, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>wela kambu tambula mu thangu yayi, biwombo viokila biobi kabika ayiwela kambu tambula, mu thangu yinkuiza, luzingu lukalumani.<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuyolukila diaka lufua luandi ayi mfulukulu andi.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayi 20.17-19</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Malako 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesu wunata kumi ayi mimvuala miodi ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:31">—Tala, tueka kuenda ku Yelusalemi ayi mambu moso masonika mimbikudi mu diambu di Muana Mutu meka sunduka. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Bila bela kunyekula mu mioko mi bapakanu, bela kunsekinina, bela kumfinga, bela kunlobudila madita ; <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>ayi bela kunzuba bikoti, bela kumvonda. Bosi wela fuluka mu lumbu kintatu.<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Minlonguki misia sudika kadi diambu dimosi ko mu mambu moso mana bila tsundu yi mambu momo yiba yisuama kuidi bawu ; ayi misia bakula ko mambu mbi Yesu kaba yolukilanga.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa phofo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayi 20.29-34</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Malako 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Yesu bu kafikama ayi Yeliko, phofo yimosi yivuanda mu yenda nzila, wuba lombanga zimbongo. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Bu kawa biyoko bi nkangu wu batu wuba vioka, buna wuyuvula kani mbi biobi.<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Buna bamvutudila ti Yesu muisi Nazaleti wulembu vioki.<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Buna wuyamikina mu ndinga yingolo ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:38">—Yesu, Muana Davidi, wumboni kiadi !<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Btu bobo baba ku ntuala nkangu bantemina muingi kabika biyoko vayiniandiwuluta buela yamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:39">—A muana Davidi, wumboni kiadi !<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yesu bu katelama, buna wuvana lutumu ti bannatina niandi. Bu kafikama, Yesu wunyuvula :<verse eid="LUK 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>—A diambu mbi tidi ndivangila e ? Wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">—A pfumu, ntidi buela mona.<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Buna Yesu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:42">—Mona kuaku bila minu kiaku kibelusidi.<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Vana vawu niandi wumona ayi wunlandakana. Wunkembisa Nzambi. Batu boso bu bamona bobo bakembisa Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Zakayi wutambula luvulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Wukota mu divula di Yeliko ayi wudisabuka. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Tala mutu wumosi, dizina diandi Zakayi, wuba pfumu yi mimfutisi mi ziphaku ayi wuba nkua busina. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Wuzola mona Yesu mu diambu kazaba buevi kadidi vayi kadia nunga ko mu diambu di nkangu wu batu bila ntela wu khufi wuba yandi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Buna wuzawula kuna ntuala ayi wumota mu nti wu sikomole mu diambu kamona Yesu bila vana kafueti viokila.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Mu thangu Yesu katula vana buangu beni, wumbula meso, wummona ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:5">—Zakayi, kuluka nsualu bila buabu mu nzo aku mfueti vuanda.<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zakayi wukuluka mu nsualu ayi wutambula Yesu mu khini.<verse eid="LUK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Bu bamona bobo, batu boso baniunguta ayi batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:7">—Tala, wedi leki ku nzo nkua masumu wowo !<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Vayi Zalayi wutelama wukamba Pfumu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:8">—Tala, ndieka vana minsukami khatitsika yi bima biama ayi enati mutu ndivangila mbimbi mu kumvuna buna ndieka kumvutudila mu zikhumbu ziya.<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Buna Yesu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:9">—Pulusu yikotidi mu lumbu kiaki mu nzo yayi bila mutu wawu, mamvandi, widi muana wu Abalahami. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Bila muana mutu wuyiza mu tomba ayi mu vukisa bobo baba bazimbala.<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi zimbongo zi butisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayi 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Nkangu bu wuba wa mambu mama, Yesu wubuela bakamba nongo yimosibila buna Yelusalemi difikimini ayi batu babanzila ti kipfumu ki Nzambi kieka kuiza nsualu.<verse eid="LUK 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:12">—Mutu wumosi wu dikanda di luzitu wuyenda ku tsi yi thama muingi kenda bieku ntinu. Niandi mana bieku buna bosi kela vutuka ku tsi andi. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Buna wutumisa dikumi di bisadi biandi ayi wuvana kuidi kadikamutu sengo kimosi ki nolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sengo kimosi ki nolo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kiba luvalu lu dikumi di mine. Ayi mine yimosi yiba mfutu wu kisadi mu tezo ki nkama yimosi yi bilumbu bi kisalu.</char></note>. Bosi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:13">“Bika lubutisa zimbongo ziazi nate ndiela vutuka.”<verse eid="LUK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Vayi basi tsi andi banlenda. Diawu ku manima mandi bamfidisilamimvuala mu diambu mituba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:14">“Tumengi ti mutu wawu katu yadila.”<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>Bu kamana bieku ntinu, wuvutuka ku tsi andi ayi wutumisa bisadibiobi kasia bikila zimbongo. Wuzola zabathalu yibutisa kadika mutu mu zimbongo zikatambula.<verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Wutheti wuyiza ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:16">“A Pfumu, sengo kiaku ki nolo kibutidi dikumi di bisengo bi nolo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Buna Pfumu beni wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:17">“Sedi bumbote ! Widi kisadi kimboti. Sumbu wubedi wukuikama mu mambu mafioti, diawu ndiveni minsua mu yadila dikumi di mavula.”<verse eid="LUK 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Mutu wummuadi wuyiza ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:18">“A Pfumu, sengo kiaku ki nolo kibutidi bisengo bitanu binkaka bi nolo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Buna Pfumu wukamba kuidi kisadi kimmuadi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:19">“Ngeyo ndiveni minsua mu yadila mavula matanu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Wunkaka wuyiza ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:20">“A Nlongi, tala sengo kiaku kinolo, ndiki sueka bumboti va dikolo di nledi. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Bila minu tsisi ndimueni bila widi mutu wumosi mu thewa ; ngeyo wunzionanga biobi wukambu sala, ngeyo wuntotanga bidia biobi wusia kuna ko.”<verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Buna pfumu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:22">“Ndieka kusambisa mu mambu momo tubidi ngeyo veka widi kisadi kimbimbi ! Zebi kuaku ki ndidi mutu wu thewa. Ndinzionanga biobindikambu sala ayi ndintotanga bidia biobi ndisia kuna ko. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Vayi bila mbi wukambu tudila zimbongo ziama ku banki muingi ndibakila ziawu ndandu mu thangu ndivutukidi e ?”<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Buna wukamba batu bobo baba vana ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:24">“Lunzionanu sengo kinolo ayi vananu kiawu mutu widi dikumi di bisengo bi nolo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Vayi batu beni bankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:25">“A Pfumu, keti dikumi didi yandi e !”<verse eid="LUK 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Buna niandi wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:26">“Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti kuidi mutu wowo beki bela kumvanaayi kuidi mutu wowo kambulu, bela kunziona banza biobi bidi yandi. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Bosi lundatina vava bambeni ziama ziozi zimanga ti ndibika ku bayadila ayi luba vondila va meso mama.”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">KISALU KI YESU KU YELUSALEMI</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutambulu mu nkembo ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayi 21.1-11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:15-17">15-17</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-10">Malako 11.1-10</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-16">Yowani 12.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Bu kamana tuba mambu momo, Yesu wuba tuaminina ku ntuala mu kuenda ku Yelusalemi.<verse eid="LUK 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Buna beka nduka tula ku Betefange ayi ku Betani, ku ndambu mongo wu beta tedila “mongo minti mi Olive”, buna wutuma minlonguki miandi miodi <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:30">—Yendanu ku buala bobo butalini yeno. Beno kota muawu, buna malu monamuana phunda wukangama. Kadi mutu wumosi kavuandidiabu wawu ko. Luniangunawawu ayi lutuala wawu. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Enati mutu wuluyuvudi : “bila mbi lulembo niangunina wawu e ?” Buna lumvutudila ti : “Pfumu mfunu kavuidi wawu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Bobo batumbu bu bayenda, bamona mambu moso boso kabakambila.<verse eid="LUK 19:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Bu baba nianguna muana phunda, buna batu bobo bavua wawu baba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:33">—A bila mi luniangunina muana phunda wowo e ?<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Bawu bamvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:34">—Pfumu mfunu kavuidi wawu.<verse eid="LUK 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Buna bawu nata kuidi Yesu. Bu bamana yala minledi miawu va mbata phunda bakumisa vawu Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 19:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Bu kaba vioka, mu nzila batu bayala minledi miawu mu nzila. <verse eid="LUK 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Buna beka nduka tula, bu baba nengumuka mongo wu minti mi olive, nkangu woso wu minlonguki wumona khini, wukembisa Nzambi, mu ndinga yingolo, mu diambu di bikumu biobi mimona.<verse eid="LUK 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Bawu batuba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:38">—<char style="qt">Bika kasakumunu ntinu wowo wunkuizila mu dizina di Pfumu. Bika ndembama yiba ku diyilu ayi nkembo mu bibuangu bizangama !</char><verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Buna Bafalisi bankaka baba muna nkangu bakamba Yesu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:39">—A nlongi, temina minlonguki miaku.<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:40">—Bukiedika ndikulukamba, enati balembulu biyoko buna matadi mamayamikina.<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thumbudulu yi Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Mu thangu kafikama ayi divula, wumona divula ayi wudila mu diambudi divula beni. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>Bosi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:42">—Enati ngeyo mamvaku wedi zaba, kani ka lumbu kiaku kiaki mambu momo malenda kunatina ndembama ! Vayi buabu masuekulu va meso maku. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Bila bilumbu biela ku kuizila, biobi bambeni ziaku ziela kaba mimbuingi, ziela kuzungidila, ziela kufietikisa mu zindambu zioso. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Ziela kuvindubula va ntoto va kimosi ayi bana baku badi yaku ayi kadi ditadi dimosi, mu ngeyo, dilendi siala va yilu ditadi dinkaka ko. Bila wusia zaba ko thangu yoyo Nzambi kayiza ku buminina.<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wulonga mu nzo Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayi 21.12-13</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Malako 11.15-19</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Yowani 2.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Yesu wukota mu nzo Nzambi ayi wutona kuka batu bobo baba sumbisa bima, wuba kamba :<verse eid="LUK 19:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>—Didi disonama : <char style="qt">nzo ama yela ba nzo yi lusambulu vayi beni lukitudi yawu suamunu ki mivi !</char><verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Bilumbu bioso Yesu wulonga mu nzo Nzambi. Zimbumu zi banganga Nzambi, minlongi mi mina ayi bakulutu ba batu batomba diluaku di kumvondisila. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Vayi basia zaba ko busila bila batu boso banlandakana mu wa mambu mandi.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Balenza kipfumu ki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayi 21.23-27</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Malako 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Lumbu kimosi Yesu bu kaba longa batu mu nzo Nzambi, wuba kuba samunina Nsamu Wumbote ; zimbukila bapfumu banganga Nzambi, minlongi mi mina ayi bakulutu ba batu bayiza, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:2">—Wutukamba mu lulendo mbi wulembu vangila mambu momo ? Voti nani wuvana lulendo beni e ?<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yesu mamvandi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:3">—Minu mamvama kiuvu kimosi kidi yama mu kuluyuvula. <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Bika lukhamba : mbotokolo yi Yowani, ku diyilu yiba voti kuidi batu e ?<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Buna beka lembu kayindulanga mu bawu veka. Buna baniunguta : enati tutubidi ti : “Ku diyilu” buna maka tuyuvula “vayi bila mbi lusia kunwilukila ko e ?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Vayi enati tutubidi ti “kuidi batu” buna batu boso maba tuvondila mu matadi bila batu boso bazebi ti Yowani wuba mbikudi. <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Buna bavutula ti basi zaba ko kuevi kaba.<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Buna Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:8">—Minu mamvama, ndilendi kulukamba ko kani mu lulendo lu nani ndilembu vangila mambu mama.<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi bisadi bimbimbibi ndima yi vinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayi 21.33-46</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Malako 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Bosi wukamba batu nongi yayi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:9">—Mutu wumosi wukuna ndima yi vinu ; wuyekudila yawu minkuni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Minkuni</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">batu bobo bansalanga zitsola, bansadisanga zindima bawu beti tedilanga minkuni.</char></note> muingi mimvananga ndambu yi mimbutu mu kadika mvu ayi wuyenda mu nzietolo mu mimvu miwombo. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Mu thangu yimvelungu makundi ma vinu, wutuma kisadi kiandikimosi kuidi minkuni bi ndima muingi mimvana ndambu yi mimbutu mi vinu vayi minkuni mi ndima mintuta khuba ayi mimvutula mioko yi mioko. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Wubuela fidisa diaka kisadi kinkaka. Mamvandi wututu khuba, wufingu ayi mimvutula mioko yi mioko. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Pfumu yi ndima wubuela fidisa diaka kisadi kintatu vayi minkuni mi ndima minlueka ayi minloza ku nganda yi ndima.<verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Buna pfumu yi ndima wutuba : A mbi ndieka vanga e ? Ndieka fidisamuanꞌama wu luzolo ; mananga bela kummona lukinzu bu bela kummona.<verse eid="LUK 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Vayi minkuni mi ndima bu mimmona, mitubana bawu na bawu : “Tala mutu wela vinginina ndima, bika tumvonda muingi ndima beniyikituka yeto veka !”<verse eid="LUK 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Buna minkoka ku nganda yi ndima ayi mimvonda !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Buna pfumu yi ndima mbi kela vangila minkuni mi ndima e ? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Buna wela kuiz, wela vondisa minkuni mi ndima ayi wela yekudila ndima beni kuidi minkuni minkaka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Batu bobo bawa, bamvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">—Bulendi baka bu bela ko.<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Vayi niandi wuba tala ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:17">—Buna masonuku mama mbi mansundula :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">Ditadi diloza mintungi dikituka ditadi di mfunu</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">diodi didi va fuma ki nzo</char><verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>
    <char style="qt">woso wela bua va yilu ditadi beni</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:18">
    <char style="qt">wela keluka tsingu ayi</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:18">
    <char style="qt">woso mutu ditadi beni diela builu wela kosakana.</char><verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Bapfumu zi zinganga Nzambi ayi minlongi mi mina batomba mu thangu yina kaka, mu kunkanga vayi bamona batu tsisi bila basudika kuawu ti bawukavekula bu katuba nongo yoyi.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ziphaka mu diambu di phaku yi Sezali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayi 22.15-22</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Malako 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Buna batona kumfiela ; diawu bamfidisila batu mu diambu bamfiela. Batu beni baba kukimonikisanga batu basonga mu diambu bambuidila mu moso kuandi mambu kakuiza tubi muingi banyekula mu mioko mi zuzi ayi mu luyalu lu nyadi.<verse eid="LUK 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Buna batubeni banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:21">—A Nlongi, tuzebi ti ngeyo weta tubila mu busonga ayi weta longila mu busonga. Ngeyo wutalanga bizizi bi batu ko vayi weta longila mu bukiedika nzila yi Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>A buevi, minsua midi yetu mu futa phaku kuidi Sezali voti tuisi ko minsua e ?<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Bu kabakula mayuya mawu, buna wuba kamba :<verse eid="LUK 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>—Mbonisanu sengo kimosi ki denali ! Mfikula yayi yi nani ayi bisono biabi binani e ? Bamvutudila ti bi Sezali.<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Buna wuba kamba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:25">—Bika luvana bi Sezali kuidi Sezali bosi bi Nzambi kuidi Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Basia nunga ko kumbuidila mu mambu makatuba va meso ma batu. Basimina bu bawa mvutu andi ayi basia baka diaka diambu di tuba ko.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayuvula Yesu kiuvu mu diambu di mfulukulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayi 22.23-33</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Malako 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Ndambu Basaduki, batu bobo kaba kikininanga ko ti batu beti fuluka, bafikama ayi banyuvula kiuvu :<verse eid="LUK 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>—A nlongi, Moyize wutusonikina ti : <char style="qt">enati mutu fuidi vayi kasia bika muana ko, buna khombꞌandi yi bakala kafueti vinginina nketo wowo kabikidi muingi kabutila khombꞌandi bana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Vayi vaba tsambudidi bakhomba zi babakala. Wutheti wukuela, wufuamu kambu bika muana, <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>wummuadi, ayi wowo wuntatu bankuela. Buawu bobo buvangimina mu bawu boso, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>bawu tsambudi bafua mu kambu bika bana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Ku nzimunina bawu boso nketo beni mamvandi wufua. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Mu thangu yi mfulukulu, wela ba nketo wu nani bila wuba nketo wu tsambudi di bakhomba ziozo e ?<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:34">—Bana ba ntoto wawu balembo kuedi ayi balembo kuedisa <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>vayi bobo bela monika ti bafueni mu tula mu thangu yinkuiza ayi mu fuluka mu bafua balendi buela kuela ko ayi balendi buela kuedusu ko. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Bila balendi buela fua ko bila beka banga zimbasi ayi beka banaba Nzambi, bana ba mfulukulu. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Moyize wutelama kimbangi ti bafua bela fuluka mu nzila yi finti fiba lema. Bila kuna katedila Pfumu ti : <char style="qt">Nzambi yi Abalahami, Nzambi yi Izaki, Nzambi yi Yakobi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Vayi niandi kasi Nzambi yi bafua ko vayi Nzambi yi batu banzinga. Bila kuidi niandi, bawu boso balembu zingi.<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Buna ndambu minlongi mi mina mitaba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:39">—A nlongi, vutudi bumbote.<verse eid="LUK 20:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Basia buela kunyuvula kadi diambu dimosi ko.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Klisto widi muana nani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayi 22.41-46</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Malako 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Buna Yesu wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:41">—A buevi beta tubila ti Klisto widi muana wu Davidi e ? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Bila niandi veka Davidi wutuba mu minkunga :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="qt">Pfumu wukamba kuidi Pfumu ama :</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="qt">Vuanda va koko kuama ku lubakala</char><verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>
    <char style="qt">nate ndimanisa tula bambeni ziaku</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:43">
    <char style="qt">banga tetuku kiaku ki malu maku.</char><verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Davidi wunkuntedila Pfumu, buna buevi kalenda buela bela muanꞌandi e ?<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutemina minlongi mi mina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:6">Matayi 23.6</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Malako 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Sumbu batu boso bawa, buna wukamba minlonguki miandi :<verse eid="LUK 20:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>—Lulubukila minlongi mi mina mimmonanga khini mu diatilanga mu mazuela ma mula ayi minzolanga baba vaninanga zimbote mu mazandu, minzolanga vuandanga mu bibuangu binzitusu mu zinzo zi zikhutukunu ayi mu minyengo. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Minlongi beni mi mina minyibanga mu zinzo zi mafuola ayi mieta vunikisa sambila zitsambulu zi mula. Bawu bela baka thumbudulu yi lutidi ngolo.<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Difuola divana makaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Malako 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Bu katala, buna wumona bamvuama batula makaba mawu mu bipani. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Buna wumona diaka nsukami wu difuola wuyiza tibula bisengo biodi bi zimbongo. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Buna wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:3">—Bukiedika ndikulukamba nsukami wu difuola diadi niandi lutidi vana viokila batu boso bankaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Bila batu boso baba batambikidi bitsiadisila. Vayi difuola diadi diveni zizioso zibedi yandi mu zingila.<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuyolukila ziphasi ziela buila Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-8">Matayi 24.1-8</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-8">Malako 13.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Sumbu bankaka bayolukila nzo Nzambi bu batuba ti yawu yitungulu mu matadi ma kitoko ayi mu bima bitambuku banga makaba <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>buna Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:6">—Mu diambu di bima biobi lulembo tadi, bilumbu biela kuiza, biobi biela ba ti ; kadi ditadi dimosi diela siala va mbata ditadidinkaka ko dinkambutiolumuka.<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Buna bawu banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:7">—A nlongi, thangu mbi mambu beni mela vangiminina ayi mu bidimbu mbi bela zabila ti mambu momo mafueti vangama e ?<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:8">—Lulubuka tala luedi vukumunu bila bawombo bela kuizila mu dizinadiama, bela tuba ti : “Minu kuandi” ayi “thangu yifikimini”. Buna kadi ku balandakana ! <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Mu thangu luela wa zimvita ayi zikhindu buna lubika ba mona tsisibila mambu moso momo mafueti tuama ba. Vayi kadi sia ti buna tsukusunuyi ntoto yeka nduka.<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Buna wubuela diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:10">—<char style="qt">Luela mona tsi yela nuanisa tsi yinkaka ; kipfumu kiela nuanisa kipfumu kinaka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Kuela ba zindikunu zinneni zi ntoto mu bibuangu biwombo ; kuela ba bikanda ayi minsongo ; kuela ba mambu ma tsisi ayi bidimbu bitsisi bi diyilu.<verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:17-22">Matayi 10.17-22</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Malako 13.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>—Vayi tuamina mambu moso momo, bela tuama ku lubuila bela kuluyamisa, bela ku lunata mu zinzo zi zikhutukunu ; bela ku lukotisa mu nloko. Bela ku lunata va ntuala mintinu ayi minyadi mu diambudi dizina diama. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Mambu momo mela lukuizila mu diambu ma luvana diluakudi kuthelimina kimbangi.<verse eid="LUK 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Bika lusudika mu mintima mieno ti : lubika ba mayindu mu diambu mambu luela vutula mu kukikakila. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Bila minu ndiela luvana munu wutubila ayi diela ayi bambeni beno zilendi baka bu nuanisina ko ayi bu sudikila ko. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Zimbuta beno, bakhomba zieno, bibutu bieno ayi bakundi beno bela ku luyekula ayi bela vondisa bankaka mu beno. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Batu boso bela ku lulenda mu diambu di dizina diama. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Vayi kadi lusuki lumosi lu mintu mieno lulendi zimbala ko. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Lukindama buna luela tambula luvulusu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-25">Matayi 24.15-25</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Malako 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>—Bu luela mona masodi mazungididi Yelusalemi buna luzaba ti dieka nduka bungu. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Buna bika batu bobo badi mu Yuda batinina ku miongo. Bika bobo badi mu Yelusalemi baba tomba butinina. Bika bobo badi mu zitsola babika buela kota ku divula ! <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Bukiedika bilumbu bina biela ba bilumbu bi vutudila landi muingi mambu moso masonama madedakana.<verse eid="LUK 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Vayi mabienga kuidi baketo bobo badi mu buemba ayi kuidi bobo bela yemika mu bilumbu bina. Bila ziphasi zingolo ziela ba mu tsi ayi nganzi yingolo yela fuemunu batu baba. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Batu beni bela vondulu mu mbedi voti bela natu mu kivika mu zitsizioso ayi bapakanu bela diatila Yelusalemi nate thangu yi fuana.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndizulu yi Muana Mutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-35">Matayi 24.29-35</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-31">Malako 13.24-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>—Bidimbu bi tsisi biela monika mu thangu, mu ngonda ayi mu zimbuetete. Va ntoto, batu bela mona tsisi yingolo mu diambu di biyoko bi mbuayi bi mayo mandi. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Batu bela fuila mu tsisi mudiambu di boma bu mambu mela bua va ntotowumvimba bila lulendo lu diyilu luela nikunu. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Buna bela mona Muana Mutu wela kuizila mu matuti mu lulendo ayi mu nkembo wunneni.<verse eid="LUK 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Mambu mama bu mela tona buna luvumbuka ayi luba vumbula mintu mienobila buna khudulu eno yifikimini.<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Wubuela tuba diaka nongo yayi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:29">—Lutala nti wu figi ayi minti mioso. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Muthangu mieti tona mena buna beno veka, mu ku mitala, luzebi ti thangu yi luanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thangu yi luanga</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yidi thangu yi mini mingolo.</char></note> yifikimini. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Bobuawu, beno mamveno buna luela mona ti mambu momo mavangiminibuna luzaba ti kipfumu ki Nzambi kifikimini. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti tsungi yayi yilendi vioka ko tuaminamambu moso mama mavangama. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Diyilu ayi ntoto biela vioka vayi mambu mama malendi vioka ko.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>Lukikeba beno veka mu diambu di mintima mieno mibika ba zitumu diambudi phulu yi dia ayi yi kolo malavu ; ayi mu diambu di mayinduma luzingu lualu muingi lumbu kina kibika lukuizila mu kinzimbukila. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Bila kiela kuizila banga dikondi dibuididi batu boso bamvuandanga va ntoto. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Luzibula meso ayi lusambila mu zithangu zioso mu diambu luba monikabatubafuana mu tina mambu moso mama mafueti kuiza ayi mu diambu lubakabu telumina va ntuala Muana Mutu.<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Mu muini Yesu wuba longanga mu nzo Nzambi. Wuba totukanga kadika builu ayi wuba vuandanga ku mongo wu minti mi olive. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Muna nsuka-nsuka batu boso baba kuizanga ku nzo Nzambi mu diambu banwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="ms1">LUFUA AYI MFULUKULU YI YESU KU YELUSALEMI</para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wusumbisa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayi 26.1-5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">14-16</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Malako 14.1-2</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 11:47-53">Yowani 11.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Buna Pasika yeka nduka, “nyengo wu mapha makambu tulu luvi”, <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>bapfumu banganga Nzambi ayi minlongi mi mina batomba diluaku divondisila Yesu bila batu baba mona tsisi.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Buna satana wukota mu Yuda wubaba ntedilanga Isikalioti, wubawumosi mu kumi ayi minlonguki miodi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Niandi wuyenda wuwizana ayi bapfumu banganga Nzambi ayi bapfumu zi bobo bansunganga nzo Nzambi mu zaba buevi kafueti kuba yekudila niandi. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Bawu bamona khini ayi bawizana mu kumvana zimbongo. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Yuda wukikinina ayi wutona tomba diluaku dimboti di kuba yekudila niandi nkanguwu batu mu kambu zaba.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayi minlonguki miandi badia Pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Matayi 26.17-19</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-16">Malako 14.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Lumbu kinyengo wu mapha makambu tulu luvi kifuana ; kiawu lumbu baba tambikanga muana dimemi wu Pasika. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesu wutuma Piela ayi Yowani wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:8">—Yendanu lutukubikila bidia bi Pasika muingi tudia.<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Bawu banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:9">—A kuevi tidi tuenda kubikila yawu e ?<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Niandi wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:10">—Tala, muthangu lukuiza koti mu divula buna ma dengana bakala dimosi dineti mvungu. Buna lunlundakana nate mu nzo kankota. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Bosi lutuba kuidi pfumu yi nzo ti : “nlongi wuyuvuditi : kuevi kuidi buangu kioki kafueti dila Pasika va kimosi ayi minlonguki miama e ?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Niandi ma kalumonisa ku yilu banga vinga kimosi kinneni kikubuku. Kuna lufueti kubikila bidia bi Pasika.<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Bawu bayenda ayi babata mambu moso boso kaba kambila ayi bawubakubika bidia bi Pasika.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Matayi 26.26-29</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Malako 14.22-25</ref> ; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolinto 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Thangu bu yifuana, Yesu wuvuanda va meza va kimosi ayi mimvuala miandi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:15">—Phuila yiwombo yiba yama mu diambudi dia Pasika yayi va kimosi ayi beno tuamina ndimona ziphasi. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Bila ndikulukamba ndilendi buela yi dia ko nate yela mana fuana mu Kipfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Bu kabonga mbungu, wuvutula matondo ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:17">—Bonganu mbungu yayi ayi lukabana yawu beno na beno <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>bila ndikulukamba ti ndilendi buela nua vinu ko nate kipfumu ki Nzambi kiela kuiza.<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Wubonga dipha, wuvutula matondo. Wubukuna diawu ayi wuba vana diawu. Bosi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:19">—Yayi yawu nitu ama [yitambuku mudiambu dieno. Luvanganga bobo mu kumbanzanga.<verse eid="LUK 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Buna bamanisa dia, wuba vana mbungu ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:20">—Mbungu yayi yidi Nguizani yimona mu menga mama matengulu mu diambu dieno<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mambu madi mu [ ] masi ko mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note>.]<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayi 26.20-25</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Malako 14.17-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>—Vayi tala mutu wowo wukunyekula widi vava, wundia yama va meza. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Ayi Muana mutu wedi bumbote boso butezulu vayi mabienga kuidimutu wowo wunyekudi.<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Buna batona kukiyuvula bawu na bawu kani nani mu bawu wukuiza vangi diambu diodi.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nani lutidi munneni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:25-28">Matayi 20.25-28</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-45">Malako 10.42-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Minlonguki mifindana ziphaka ziwombo mu diambu di zaba nani mu bawu lutidi munneni.<verse eid="LUK 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Buna Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:25">—Mintinu mi Bapakanu minyadilanga batu bawuayi bobo beti yadila mubawubeti tedulu : “mimvangi mi mambote”. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Vayi bwawu ko bufueti bela kuidi beno. Woso widi wunneni mu benobuna bika kakituka banga muana lezi. Ayi woso weti yala kaba banga kisadi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Bila nani lutidi munneni : mutu vuendi va meza voti mutu wowo wulembu sadi e ? Keti mutu wowo vuendi va meza lutidi munneni e ? Vayi minu ndidi va khatitsikꞌenu banga kisadi.<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:18">Matayi 19.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>—Vayi beno, luidi batu bobo babedi bakuikama yama mu zithotolo ziama. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Sumbu didi ti Tata wuphana Kipfumu, mamvana ndiluveni Kipfumu beni <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>muingi lubaka budila ayi bu nuina va meza yama mu Kipfumu kiama ayimuingi lubaka bu vuandila mu bikundu bi Kipfumu mudiambu di sambisa kumi makanda muadi ma Iseli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuna ti Piela wela kuntunuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayi 26.31-35</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Malako 14.27-31</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yowani 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Yesu wukamba Simoni ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:31">—A Simoni, A Simoni, satana wululombidi mudiambu kaluyungula banga bu beti yungudila ble<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ble</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hila kunusu kinsadulungu falina ; kidi banga masangu.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Vayi minu tsambidingi mu diambu diaku muingi minu kiaku kibika lebakana. Diawu buna ngeyo wela vutuka, buna wuba kindisa bakhomba zikau.<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Simoni wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:33">—A Pfumu, ndidi wukubama mu kuenda yaku mu nloko ayi ku lufua.<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Vayi Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:34">—A Piela, bukiedika ndikukamba ti mu buabu kuandi tuamina tsusu yikokula ngeyo zikhumbu zitatu mawu thunukina ti wusi kunzaba ko.<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusambila ku mongo minti mi Olive</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">—Mu thangu ndilutuma mu kambu nata photomoni, mu kambu sakosi, mu kambu nata zisapatu ; a kima mbi lukambu e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Bawu bamvutudila ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">—Kadi kima tusia kambu ko.<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Vayi Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:36">—Vayi buabu woso widi photomoni buna bika kayibonga ; bobuawu woso widi ayi sakosi bika kayibonga ayi woso kambulu mbedi bika kasumbisa nledi andi mu diambu kasumba mbedi <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>bila ndikulukamba ti mama masonama madedakana mu diambudiama : bantula mu ntanda wu batu bambimbi. Bila mambu momo masonama mu diambu diama madi ayi tsukulu.<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Bawu batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">—A Pfumu, tala zimbedi zizole zidi vava !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Niandi wuba vutudila ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">—Bufueni.<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusambila ku mongo minti mi olive</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-45">Matayi 26.36-45</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-41">Malako 14.32-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Buna wutotuka boso bubela kifu kiandi, wuyenda ku mongo mingi mi olive. Minlonguki miandi minlandakana. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Bu katula, ku buangu beni, buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:40">—Lusambila tala luedibua mu phukumunu. <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Buna niandi veka wuba tatukila fiote mu tezo kilenda tudila ditadi bu diozulu. Buna wufukama ayi wusambila :<verse eid="LUK 22:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>—A Tata, enati zodidi, khatudila mbungu yayi. Muaki bika luzolo luaku luvangama vayi bika luama. [<verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Buna mbasi yitotukila ku Diyilu yiyiza kunkindisa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Bu kaba mu tsisi yi khindu ; wuluta buela sambila diaka ngolo ayi diunga ditotuka mu nitu andi diba banga mabeti ma menga maba bua va ntoto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">[43 nate 44] Bibukubiabibisi ko mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note>.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Bu kamanisa sambila, wutelama ayi wuyiza vaba minlonguki miandi. Wuba buana baleka mu diambu di kiadi.<verse eid="LUK 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:46">—Bila mbi lulembo lekila tulue ? Kotukanu ! Lusambila tala luedi bua mu phukumunu.<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakanga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-55">Matayi 26.47-55</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-49">Malako 14.43-49</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 18:2-11">Yowani 18.2-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Buna kamanisini ko tuba, tala nkangu wu batu wutotuka. Yuda, wumosi mu kumi mimvuala miandi miodi, wuba vana ntuala ; wufikama vaba Yesu mu diambu kamfifa besi. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Vayi Yesu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:48">—A Yuda, mu besi weka yekudila Muana mutu e ?<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Bobo banzungidila bu bamona mambu momo meka bua bankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:49">—A nlongi, tubonga zimbedi muingi tunuana e ?<verse eid="LUK 22:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Wumosi mu bawu wuzuba kisadi ki pfumu yi banganga Nzambi ayi wunzenza dikutu diandi di lubakala. <verse eid="LUK 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Vayi Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:51">—Bikanu mabela bobo nate buabu ! Bu kasimba dikutu buna wumbelusa. <verse eid="LUK 22:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Bosi yesuwukamba bapfumu banganga Nzambi, bapfumu zi minsungi mi nzo Nzambi ayi bakulutu ba batubobo banata nkangu wubatu mudiambubiza nkangi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:52">—Lutotukidi ayi zimbedi ayi zimbindi mudiambu di lunuanisa dovula e ? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Bilumbu bioso bu ndibedi yeno mu nzo Nzambi ayi kadi mutu kadiaku khanga ko vayi buabu yawu thangu eno ayi thangu yi luyalu lu tombi.<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Piela wutunuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matayi 26.57-58</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Malako 14.53-54</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-16">Yowani 18.15-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Buna bambuila, bannata ayi bankotisa mu nzo yi pfumu yi zingangazi Nzambi. Piela kuna manima kaba nlandikinina. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Mu thangu balunga mbazu va khatitsika nganda ayi bu bavuanda va kimosi. Piela mamvandi wuvuanda yawu.<verse eid="LUK 22:55"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayi 26.69-75</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Malako 14.66-72</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 18:17-18">Yowani 18.17-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Kisadi kimosi ki nketo wummona buna kavuendi va ndambu mbazu, wunsungimina kuntala mu kiezila wu nlaki wu mbazu, ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:56">—Mutu wawu bedingi yandi !<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Vayi Piela wutunuka kuandi bu katuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:57">—A nketo, ndisi kunzaba ko !<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Buela vuanda fioti, mutu wunkaka wumona Piela ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">—Ngeyo widi mu dikabu di batu bobo ! Vayi Piela wuvutula ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">—A bakala, minu ndisi ko mu dikabu diawu.<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Nduka-nduka thangu yimvimba yivioka, mutu wunkaka wuyiza buelasindisila diaka ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:59">—Bukiedika mutu wawu bedingi yandi bila mamvandi widi muisi Ngalili.<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Vayi Piela wuvutula ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">—A bakala, ndisi zaba ko diambumbi wunyolukila ! Muna thangu buna wukidi tubi tsusu yikokula. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Pfumu wubaluka, wutala Piela. Buna Piela wutebukila moyo mambumankamba Yesu ti “tuamina tsusu yikokula, ngeyo mu zikhumbu zitatu mawuthumukina”. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Buna Piela wutotuka ku nganda ayi wudila ngolo.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayi 26.67-68</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Malako 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Batu bobo basunga Yesu bansekinina ayi bambeta. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Bamfukidila zizi ayi banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:64">—A ngeyo, bikula ko e ! Nani wubetidi e ? <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Buna batuba mambu mawombo mankaka mu diambu di kumfinga.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Basambisa Yesu va ntuala lukutukunu lunneni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-65">Matayi 26.59-65</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Malako 14.55-64</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yowani 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Buisi buna bukia, bakulutu ba batu, bapfumu banganga Nzambi va kimosi ayi minlongi mi mina bakutakana. Banata Yesu va ntualalukutukuu luawu lunneni ; <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Bawu banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">—Enati ngeyo widi Klisto, buna bika wutukamba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Buna wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">—Enati ndilukembi, buna lulendi wilukila ko. <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Ayi enati ndiluyuvudi biuvu, lulendi kuphana ko mvutu. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Vayi tona buabu Muana mutu wela vuanda va koko ku lubakala lu lulendo lu Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Buna bawu bobo batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">—Buna ngeyo widi muana Nzambi e ? Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">—Beno veka lutubidi ti minu buawu bobo ndididi.<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Vana vawu bayamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:71">—Mbi kimbangi kinkaka tufueti buela tomba e ? Bila beto veka tunwilumu mambu mandi katubidi.<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Pilatu ayi Elode basambisa yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:2">Matayi 27.2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Malako 15.1-5</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yowani 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Batu boso batelama va kimosi ayi bannata kuidi Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Kuna bamfundila bu batuba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:2">—Mutu wawu tummueni wulembo votikisa batu ba tsi eto. Niandi wubedi kuba kandikanga babika futa phaku kuidi Sezali ayiwubedi tubanga ti niandi Klisto (bu dinsundula ti ntinu).<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Buna Pilatu wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">—Ngeyo widi ntinu wu Bayuda e ? Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">—Ngeyo weka tubidi buawu.<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Buna Pilatu wukamba bapfumu banganga Nzambi ayi nkangu wu batu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:4">—Ndisi mona kadi diambu di mbimbi ko mu mutu wawu.<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Bawu baluta buela sindisila ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:5">—Niandi wutonisanga zikhindu mu malongi mandi momo kalonga mu Yuda dioso ; bu katonina ku Ngalili nate kuaku.<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Pilatu bu kawa ti bayolukila Ngalili, buna wuyuvula kani mutu wowo wuba muisi Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Bu kawa ti wuba muisi zunga kiyadila Elode ; buna wumfidisa kuidi Elode bila mu bilumbu bina, Elode buna widi ku Yelusalemi.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Elode wumona khini bu kamona Yesu bila tona thama wuba tombanga diluaku di kummonina mu diambu di mambu mawombo kawa mu niandi ; ayi wutula diana ti maka mona kumu kioki maka vanga. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Buivu biwombo kanyuvula vayi Yesu kasia vutula kadi diambu dimosi ko.<verse eid="LUK 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Vayi bapfumu banganga Nzambi ayi minlongi mi mina batelama vana ayi baba kumfunda ngolo. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Elode va kimosi ayi masodi mandi banlenza bansekinina bamvuikanledi wu kitoko ; wumvutula kuidi Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Pilatu ayi Elode bakituka bakundi tona mu lumbu kina bila batuama ba bambeni.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bazengila yesu nkanu wu lufua.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-28">Matayi 27.15-28</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Malako 15.6-15</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Yowani 18.39-40</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 19:4-16">19.4-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilatu wukutikisa bapfumu banganga Nzambi, bakulutu ba batu va kimosi ayi batu. Wuba kamba :<verse eid="LUK 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>—Beno lundatiningi mutu wawu bu lumfundidingi ti niandi wulembu vukumuna batu. Vayi tala minu veka mbeni kunsambisa va meso meno ayi ndisi mona kadi diambu di mbimbi ko mu mutu wawu mu mambu momo lulembu mfundila. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Elode mamvandi kasi mona diambu di mbimbi ko bila wutuvutudidi niandi. Mutu wawu kasi vanga ko bila kioki kafueti vondulu. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Diawu ndieka kunzubisa bikoti bosi ma ndiyekula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:16">[<verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Pilatu wuba kifu ki kuba totudilanga mutu wumosi wu nloko mu kadikanyengo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buku kiaki kisi ko mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note>.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Vayi nkangu woso wuyamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:18">—Vondisa mutu wowo ; totula Balabasi !<verse eid="LUK 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Balabasi beni wukotusu mu nloko mu diambu di khindu yimosi yiba mu divula, ayi mu diambu di vonda batu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Vayi Pialatu wuzola totula Yesu, wubuela yuvula nkangu vayi wawu wuyamikina diaka :<verse eid="LUK 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>—Mbanda va dikulusi ! Mbanda va dikulusi !<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Buna wuyuvula diaka mu khumbu yintatu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:22">—Vayi mbimbi mbi kavengi e ? Ndisi mona kadi diambu di mbimbi kodiodi kafueti zengulu nkanu wu lufua. Ndieka kunzubisa bikoti bosi ma ndinyekula.<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Vayi babuela sindisila mu ngolo ayi baluta buela yamikina ti kabandu va dikulusi. Buna yamikina kuawu ayi koko ku bapfumu zi zinganga Nzambi kununga.<verse eid="LUK 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Pilatu wubaka lunaku luvanga luzolo luawu. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Wuba totukila mutu wowo balomba, wowo wuba mu nloko mu diambu di khindu ayi mu diambu di vonda batu. Wuba yekudila Yesu muingi bamvangila boso bubela luzolo luawu.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufua lu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayi 27.32-44</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Malako 15.21-32</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-22">Yowani 19.17-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Bu baba kunnata, babuila mutu wumosi dizina diandi Simoni muisi Silene ku nsitu kuandi kaba. Bankuika kanata dikulusi, ku manima ma Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Nkangu wu batu wunlandakana va kimosi ayi baketo banionga mu diambudiandi, badila mu diambu diandi.<verse eid="LUK 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Bu kabaluka kuidi baketo beni ; wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:28">—A beno baketo ba Yelusalemi, lubika dila mu diambu diama ! Vayi ludila mu diambu dieno veka ayi mu diambu di bana beno. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Bila tala bilumbu bilembu yizi ku ntuala biobi batu bela tuba ti : “Khini kuidi bisita ayi kuidi bivumu bikambu buta ayi khini kuidi mabenimakambu yemika !” <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Buna bela kamba miongo : “Bika lutubuila !” ayi zikhundubula : “bika lutufuka !” <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Bila enati bamvangila mambu mama kuidi nti wu nlandu bunabuevi bela vangila nti wu yuma e ?<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Batu buadi bankaka, mimvangi mi mambu mambimbi, banatu yandi mu vondu va kimosi.<verse eid="LUK 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Bu batula va buangu kintedulungu “Mvesi wu ntu” vana bambandilava dikulusi va kimso ayi mimvangi miodi mi mambu mambimbi. Wumosiku koko kuandi ku lubakala ayi wunkaka ku koko kuandi ku lumoso.<verse eid="LUK 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Buna Yesu wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">—A tata, bika wuba lemvukila bila basi zaba ko mambu balembu vangi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mambu mama matuba Yesu masi ko mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Babula zeki mu diambu di kabana minledi miandi.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Nkangu wu batu wutelama vana, wutala. Ayi minyadi mamvawu minsekinina bu mituba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:35">—Niandi wuvukisidi batu bankaka, bika kakivukisa niandi veka enati niandi Klisto, mutu wusobulu kuidi Nzambi !<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Masodi mamvawu mansekinina ; mafikama va kaba ayi mantambika vinu ki ngami <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>ayi batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:37">—Enati ngeyo widi ntinu wu Bayuda, bika wukivukisa ngeyo veka !<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Va mbata ntu andi vaba tini ki dibaya kisonama mambu mama : “Niandi niawu ntinu wu Bayuda.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Wumosi mu mimvangi mi mambu mambimbi wubandu va mdikulusiwumfinga bu katuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:39">—Ngeyo ko Klisto e ? Buna wukivukisa ngeyo veka bosi wutuvukisa beto mamveto !<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Vayi wunkaka wuntebidila bu kankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:40">—Ngeyo kadi tsisi wukadi mona Nzambi ! Bila ngeyo widi ku thumbudulu yimosi ? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Beto tubeki thumbudulu yifueni ayi yisonga bila tutambudi mfutu wufueni mu mambu matuvengi vayi niandi kasi vanga kadi diambu dimosi dimbimbi ko.<verse eid="LUK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Buna wukamba Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:42">—A Pfumu bika wuba kuthebukila moyo mu thangu wela kuiza mu kipfumu kiaku !<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Buna Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:43">—Bukiedika ndikukamba, mu lumbu kiaki ngeyo ma wuba yama va kimosi ku Paladisu.<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayi 27.45-56</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Malako 15.33-41</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 19:25-30">Yowani 19.25-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Yiba nduka-ndkuka midi, tsi yoso yiba mu tombi ayi kiawukinzingila nate mu thangu yi ntatu ku manima midi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Thangu yinomba bosi lido yinneni yi nzo Nzambi yikanzuka va khatitsika. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Buna Yesu wuyamikina mu ndinga yingolo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:46">—<char style="qt">A tata, mu mioko miaku ndintambika mpeve yama !</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:46">Bu katuba mambu momo, wufua.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Pfumu yi masodi bu kamona mambu mavioka, wukembisa Nzambi bu katuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:47">—Bukiedika kuandi ti mutu wawu wubedi wusonga !<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Nkangu woso wu batu bakutakana mu tala mambu mavangama, bu bamona mambu mavioka, bavutuka kuawu, ayi baba nionga. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Ayi batu bobo bazabana yandi ayi baketo bobo banlandakana tona ku Ngalili thama batelimina mu tala mambu momo.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bazika Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayi 27.57-61</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Malako 15.42-47</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yowani 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Tala, mutu wumosi dizina diandi Zefu wuba wumosi mu batu baba kotanga mu lukutukunu lunneni lu Bayuda. Wuba mutu wumboti ayi wusonga. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Niandi kasia bundana mu nzengolo yawu ko ayi mu mavanga mawu ko. Niandi wuba muisi divula di Alimate, divula di bayuda ayi niandi mamvandi wuba vingilanga Kipfumu ki Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Wuyenda kuidi Pilatu, wunlomba nitu yi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Bu kayi kulula va dikulusi, buna wuyizinga mu dilasola di lino ayi wutula yawu mu dibumbi disokulu mu ditadi dinneni. Kadi mutu kazikulu ko mu dibumbi beni. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Kiba lumbu ki khubumunu, tuamina lumbu ki saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.54 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lumbu ki saba</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuidi Bayuda lumbu ki saba kiawu lumbu kiawu kilumingu.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 23:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Baketo bobo balandakana Yesu tona ku Ngalili balandakana Zefu, bamona bibumbi ayi buevi batudila nitu yi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Bosi bavutuka kuawu ayi bakubika mafuta ma tsudi yi kotoko ayi malasi. Bavunda kuawu mu lumbu ki saba boso bubela mina.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wufuluka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-9">Matayi 28.1-9</ref> ; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Malako 16.1-8</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yowani 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Mu nsuka-nsuka wu lumbu kitheti ki sabala, baketo bayenda kudibumbi. Banata mafuta ma tsudi yi kitoko momo bakubika. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Bamona ditadi difuka mualo wu dibumbi divindumunu va ndambu muelo. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Bakota vayi basia mona ko nitu yi Pfumu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Buna bakidi yindula tsundu yi diambu diodi, bazimbukila batu buadibavuata minledi miba lezama batelama va ndambu. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Sumbu bamona tsisi ayi bayinika bizizi biawu mu tsi, buna batu beni baba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:5">—Bila mbi luntombila mutu widi moyo va khatitsika yi batu bafua e ? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Kasiedi vava ko vayi fulukidingi. Lutebuka moyo buevi kaluyolukilabuna wukidi ku Ngalili bu kalukamba ti : <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>“Muana Mutu kafueti yekulu mu mioko mi bankua masumu, wela bandu va dikulusi ayi wela fuluka mu lumbu kintatu.<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Buna batebukila mambu mandi momo moyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Basia bika dibumbi, bavutuka kuawu ayi bavumbudila kipholo ki mambu moso mama kuidi kumi mimvuala wumosi ayi kuidi batu boso bankaka. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Mu bawu muba Maliya muisi Mangadala, Zana, Maliya ngudi yi Zaki va kimosi ayi maketo bankaka basamuna mambu mama kuidi mimvuala. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Vayi mimvuala mimanga wilukila mambu mawu bila mimonina mambu mawu banga mambu makambulu tsundu.<verse eid="LUK 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Vayi Piela wutelama, wuzawula ku dibumbi. Bu kayinama, buna miomiminledi mikazikulu kaka kamona. Wuvutuka kuandi ku nzo andi wusiminamu diambu di mambu momo mavioka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buku kiaki kisi ko mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wumonikina minlonguki miodi mu nzila yi Emawusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Mu kina kiawu lumbu, minlonguki miodi miyenda ku buala bumosibaba ntedilanga Emawusi. Buala beni butatukila Yelusalemi nduka-ndukamu tezo ki kumi kilometele biodi. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Miyolukila mambu moso momo mavioka. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Bu miba solula ayi miba findana zimpaka, mizimbukila niandi veka Yesu wuba fikama ayi wuyenda yawu va kimosi. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Vayi meso mawu maba mafuku mu diambu babika kumbakula.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Buna wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">—A mambu mbi momo lulembu yolukila bu lueti kuenda yendingi e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Mitelama ayi bizizi bi kiadi-kiadi. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Wumosi mu bawu, dizina diandi Klewopasi wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:18">—Vayi buna ngeyo kaka mu batu bobo bamvuandanga ku Yelusalemikambulu zaba mambu maviokidi muawu mu bilumbu biabi e ?<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Niandi wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">—A mambu mbi momo e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Bawu bamvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">—Mambu mabuilulu Yesu muisi Nazaleti wubedi mbikudi wu lulendomu mavanga mandi ayi mu thubulu andi va ntuala Nzambi ayi va ntuala batu boso. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Bapfumu zieto zi banganga Nzambi ayi bapfumu zieto zinyekudi mu diambu di banzengila nkanu wu lufua ayi mu diambu di bambanda va dikulusi. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Diana tubedi tulanga ti niandi wukuiza kudi Iseli. Vayi talabuabu kiawu kiaki lumbu kintatu tona mambu beni makibelanga.<verse eid="LUK 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Bukiedika kuandi ti baketo bankaka mu beto batuyindusidingi ngolo bu babedingi ku dibumbi va nsuka-nsuka. <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Sumbu basi monanga ko nitu andi, buna biza samunanga ti tsongolobamueningi ; bamueningi zimbasi zibakembingiti bukiedika widi moyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Buna bankaka mu bobo badi yeto bedingi ku dibumbi. Benda buanangamambu boso busamuniningi baketo ; vayi, niandi, basi kummonanga ko.<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Buna Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:25">A batu bakambu diela ayi fuana phasi lummona mu mintima mu wilukila mambu moso mimbikudi mibikula. <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>A keti Klisto kafueti tuama mona phasi mu diambu di mambu momosimbu kakota mu nkembo andi e ?<verse eid="LUK 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Bosi Yesu wutona kuba sudikisa mambu moso masonama mu diambu dianditonina mu Moyize nate mu mimbikudi mioso. <verse eid="LUK 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Vayi buna bafikama buala bobo baba kuenda ; niandi wuvunikisa kuenda thama <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>vayi bansimbidila bu banleba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:29">—Vuanda yeto, tala buisi bueka yila ayi masika mazidi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:29">Buna wukota yawu mu nzo ayi wuvuanda yawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Wuvuanda yawu va meza, wubonga dipha ayi wudisakumuna, wudibukuna bosi wuba kabudila diawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Buna meso mawu mazibuka ayi bambakula vayi kasia buela monikako, wutumbu zimbala va meso mawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Buna bakambasana bawu na bawu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:32">—Keti mintima mieto misi banga mu khini ko mu thangu kalembukutuyolukilanga mu nzila, bu katuzingu budidi masonuku e ?<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Muna yina thangu, bavutuka ku Yelusalemi. Bayiza bata kumi mimvuala wumosi buna bakutikini va kimosi ayi bobo baba yawu, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>balembu tubi ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:34">—Bukiedika ti Pfumu fulukidingi ; wukimonikisidingi kuidi Simoni.<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Buna minlonguki miodi beni mamvawu misamuna mambu momo mimonamu nzila ayi buevi miyiza bakudila Yesu mu thangu kabukuna dipha.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wumonika kuidi kumi mimvuala wumosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yowani 20.19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Buna bakidi solula mu diambu di mambu beni, Yesu wutelamava khatitsikꞌawu ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:36">—Ndembama yibanga yeno<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mambu mama : wuba kamba “Ndembama yibanga yeno” masi ko mu minkandaminkaka.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Vayi baboso batita, bamona tsisi bila babanzila ti nkuyu bamueni. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:38">—A bila mbi luekila tsisi-tsisi ? Bila mbi mayindu mu mintima mieno ? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Talanu mioko miama ayi malu mama. Keti minu kuandi e ! Bika lutsimba ayi lutala ! Keti nkuyu kasi ko minsuni ayi mimvesi vayi lulembu moni kueno ti minu minsuni ayi mimvesi midi yama.<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Bu katuba bobo, wuba monisa mioko miandi ayi malu mandi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wuba monisa mioko ayi malu bila muawu bantobudila zitsoso.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Bu bakambu vika wilukila mu diambu di khini ayi mu diambu di simina, buna wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:41">—Kima kidia kidi yeno vava e ?<verse eid="LUK 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Buna bamvana tini ki mbizi ki lambu. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Wukibonga ayi wukidia va meso mawu.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Bosi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:44">—Tala mawu mama mambu ndilukamba buna ndikidi yeno va kimosimambu mamo masonama mu diambu diama mu Mina mi Moyize, mu minkanda mi mimbikudi ayi mu minkunga mafueti kaka dedakana !”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Buna wuzibula diela diawu muingi babaka bu sudikila masonuku.<verse eid="LUK 24:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Wuba kamba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:46">—Disonama ti Klisto kafueti mona phasi ayi wela fuluka mu lumbu kintatu <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>ayi bela samuna kuidi batu ba makanda moso tonina mu Yelusalemi ti mu dizina diandi, batu babalula mavanga ayi batambula nlemvo mu masumu mawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Beno luidi bambangi ba mambu momo. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Tala minu ndieka nduka kulufidisila biobi Dise diama kaluvaninatsila. Diawu beno luvuanda kaka mu divula nate luela vuiku lulendo lu diyilu.<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutombulu ku diyilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Bosi wuba nata ku nganda yi divula nate ku ndambu yi Betani. Kuna kamvumbudila mioko miandi ayi wuba sakumuna. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Mu thangu kaba kubasakumuna, wuvambana yawu ayi wutombulu mu diyilu.<verse eid="LUK 24:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Bawu buna bamana kunsambila, mu khini bavutukila ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Thangu ka thangu bavuanda kuawu mu nzo Nzambi mu diambu di zitisanga ayi kembisanga Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
